{"_id":"0703de963a247170","name":"Ignite Fervor","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Bolster Ally; Inspire Confidence","benefit":"Whenever you hit an opponent with a melee or ranged attack, you can, as a free action, choose to give one ally within your line of sight a bonus to damage on the ally's next attack equal to the ally's character level. Once ignited, the ally need not remain within your line of sight; if the next attack misses, the bonus is lost. You cannot ignite fervor in yourself.","description":{"value":"Whenever you hit an opponent with a melee or ranged attack, you can, as a free action, choose to give one ally within your line of sight a bonus to damage on the ally's next attack equal to the ally's character level. Once ignited, the ally need not remain within your line of sight; if the next attack misses, the bonus is lost. You cannot ignite fervor in yourself."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.d6e7f7178e643717","name":"Bolster Ally"},{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.4d8882a28da30454","name":"Inspire Confidence"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"72d32ebcbb607314","tags":["ally_support","support","teamwork","damage_bonus","melee","ranged","scaling","action_economy"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"social_commander_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Follower/dependent-actor subsystem or GM/player managed","notes":"Ally/follower/minion effects need dependent actor, adjacency, line-of-sight, attack, or action timing context; they should not mutate owner static totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"ignite-fervor","name":"Ignite Fervor","label":"Ignite Fer