{"_id":"16f53472844251a7","name":"Problem Solver","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a Swift Action once per turn, you can designate a single Vehicle within your line of sight whose Pilot can hear and understand you. That Pilot's Vehicle ignores Difficult Terrain until the start of your next turn, and the Pilot gains a +5 insight bonus on all Pilot checks made to avoid Hazards and Collisions until the start of your next turn.","description":{"value":"As a Swift Action once per turn, you can designate a single Vehicle within your line of sight whose Pilot can hear and understand you. That Pilot's Vehicle ignores Difficult Terrain until the start of your next turn, and the Pilot gains a +5 insight bonus on all Pilot checks made to avoid Hazards and Collisions until the start of your next turn."},"class":"b85240cf77cf95eb","costNumeric":null,"category":"Military Engineer","treeId":"e32009b1b0aee8c9","tags":["evasion"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"problem-solver","name":"Problem Solver","label":"Problem Solver","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Designate one vehicle in line of sight whose pilot can hear and understand you; that vehicle ignores difficult terrain until the start of your next turn.","notes":"Designate one vehicle in line of sight whose pilot can hear and understand you; that vehicle ignores difficult terrain until the start of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Mechanics","when":"GM may request a technical/tactical check"}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":["Vehicle in line of sight","Pilot can hear and understand you"],"targetHint":"One vehicle"}],"phase17TechEngineeringCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual action-economy card. Automation can be added later without invent