{"_id":"2afe84b999aa1c43","name":"Exposing Strike","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you use a Lightsaber to deal damage to a target, you can spend a Force Point to make that target Flat-Footed until the end of your next turn.","description":{"value":"When you use a Lightsaber to deal damage to a target, you can spend a Force Point to make that target Flat-Footed until the end of your next turn."},"class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"10c843cef8ce2798","tags":["force","force_offense","light_side","lightsaber","melee"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"ACTION","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Exposing Strike"}]},"talent_tree":"Jedi Guardian","talentTree":"Jedi Guardian","tree":"Jedi Guardian","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","summary":"When you use a Lightsaber to deal damage to a target, you can spend a Force Point to make that target Flat-Footed until the end of your next turn.","page":21},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.exposing_strike","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.406Z","detectedPredicates":[],"sourcePatch":"jedi-guardian-runtime-pass"}}}
{"_id":"2b31cb2ea7ad64b9","name":"Attract Minion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You attract a loyal Minion. The Minion is a Nonheroic character with a Class Level equal to your heroic level - 2 (minimum 1). You may select this Talent multiple times; each time you select this Talent, you gain another Minion. Normally, you can have only one Minion with you at a time. Any other Minions you have are assumed to be looking after your various interests. If you lose a Minion, you can send for another Minion if you have one (although normal Travel Time still applies). Each Minion that accompanies you on an adventure is entitled to an equal share of the total Experience Points earned for that adventure. For example, a Minion that accompanies a party of five heroes on an adventure receives one-sixth of the XP that the group earns.","description":{"value":"You attract a loyal Minion. The Minion is a Nonheroic character with a Class Level equal to your heroic level - 2 (minimum 1).\n\nYou may select this Talent multiple times; each time you select this Talent, you gain another Minion. Normally, you can have only one Minion with you at a time. Any other Minions you have are assumed to be looking after your various interests. If you lose a Minion, you can send for another Minion if you have one (although normal Travel Time still applies).\n\nEach Minion that accompanies you on an adventure is entitled to an equal share of the total Experience Points earned for that adventure. For example, a Minion that accompanies a party of five heroes on an adventure receives one-sixth of the XP that the group earns."},"class":"324631ca844a88be","costNumeric":null,"category":"Crime Lord","treeId":"560cc7994b357a0d","tags":["action_economy","mobility","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"progression_or_dependent_actor","applicationScope":"follower_minion_subsystem","staticSheetPolicy":"not_a_modifier","requiresRuntimeContext":false,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"FOLLOWER_TALENT_CONFIG + follower-hooks + MinionCreator/MinionManager + minion action rule cards","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. Crime Lord/Master Privateer minion subsystem owns dependent actor slots, minion talent flags, and manual tactical rule cards. No passive actor modifier is valid here."},"summary":"You attract a loyal Minion. The Minion is a Nonheroic character with a Class Level equal to your heroic level - 2 (minimum 1).","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":210},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.attract_minion","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.407Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","proximity.ally-nearby"],"nobleOfficerCorporateCleanup":{"phase":"T10","status":"implemented_follower_slot_owner","owner":"FOLLOWER_TALENT_CONFIG + follower-hooks + FollowerCreator/MinionCreator","note":"This talent grants a dependent actor slot. The follower/minion subsystem already owns slot creation; passive modifiers would be wrong."}}}}
