{"_id":"2c18952e0c014127","name":"Force Cloak","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":"As a swift action, you can surround yourself with an invisible bubble of Force power that shields you and anything you're carrying from electronic surveillance. The bubble also blocks all electronic sensors and communications. The Force cloak lasts for as long as you concentrate or until the start of your next turn.","benefit":"As a swift action, you can surround yourself with an invisible bubble of Force power that shields you and anything you're carrying from electronic surveillance. The bubble also blocks all electronic sensors and communications. The Force cloak lasts for as long as you concentrate or until the start of your next turn.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"f5c62e2e81f648aa","tags":["action_economy","concealment","force","force_defense","force_offense","mobility","standard_action","stealth","support","swift_action"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"force-cloak","name":"Force Cloak","label":"Force Cloak","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"As the Talent, except you can expand the bubble to envelop a number of creatures (including yourself) equal to your Character Level. As a Swift Action, you can take a penalty of up to -5 on your attack roll and add the same number (up to +5) as a Force bonus to an ally's Reflex Defense, provided the ally is within your line of sight when you activate this talent. The bonus you confer cannot exceed your Base Attack Bonus. The changes to your attack rolls and your ally's Reflex Defense last until the start of your next turn.","notes":"As the Talent, except you can expand the bubble to envelop a number of creatures (including yourself) equal to your Character Level. As a Swift Action, you can take a penalty of up to -5 on your attack roll and add the same number (up to +5) as a Force bonus to an ally's Reflex Defense, provided the ally is within your line of sight when you activate this talent. The bonus you confer cannot exceed your Base Attack Bonus. The changes to your attack rolls and your ally's Reflex Defense last until the start of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Choose attack penalty up to -5; ally Reflex bonus up to same amount until next turn"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Jensaarai Defender","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"Create a Force bubble that blocks electronic surveillance, sensors, and communications.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":107},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.407Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex"],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Jensaarai Defender","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
