{"_id":"2dc6ad1667133f2d","name":"Share Force Secret","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Must know at least 1 Force secret","benefit":"When you take this talent, choose one Force secret that you know. Once per turn as a swift action, you can grant the use of this Force secret to one ally within 12 squares of you who is trained in the Use the Force skill. The target gains the benefit of this secret until the end of your next turn.","description":{"value":"When you take this talent, choose one Force secret that you know. Once per turn as a swift action, you can grant the use of this Force secret to one ally within 12 squares of you who is trained in the Use the Force skill. The target gains the benefit of this secret until the end of your next turn."},"class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"303d91124d4548c0","tags":["force","light_side","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Share Force Secret"}],"status":"talent_backcheck_user_text_2026_06_11","description":"Choose a known Force Secret; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","mechanicsMode":"action_or_contextual","applicationScope":"choice_grant_force_secret","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":true,"conditionSummary":"Choose a known Force Secret; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","metadataPhase":"jedi-prestige-talent-backcheck","metadataNotes":"Updated from user-provided source text; non-automatable targeting/LOS/session adjudication remains GM/player confirmed.","rules":[{"type":"TALENT_RULE","id":"share_force_secret","label":"Share Force Secret","summary":"Choose a known Force Secret; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","action":"swift-action","mode":"choice_grant_force_secret","text":"When you take this Talent, choose one Force Secret that you know. Once per turn as a Swift Action, you can grant the use of this Force Secret to one ally within 12 squares of you who is Trained in the Use the Force Skill.\n\nThe target gains the benefit of this Force Secret until the end of your next turn."}]},"effect":"When you take this Talent, choose one Force Secret that you know. Once per turn as a Swift Action, you can grant the use of this Force Secret to one ally within 12 squares of you who is Trained in the Use the Force Skill.\n\nThe target gains the benefit of this Force Secret until the end of your next turn.","shortSummary":"Choose a known Force Secret; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","prerequisite":"At least 1 Force Secret","prerequisitesText":"At least 1 Force Secret","grantsActions":["swift-action"],"summary":"When you take this talent, choose one Force secret that you know.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":19},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.share_force_secret","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.407Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentBackcheck":{"source":"user-pasted-rules","date":"2026-06-11","updatedFields":["system.description","system.benefit","system.effect","system.shortSummary","system.prerequisite","system.abilityMeta"]}}}}
{"_id":"2e500e16dc0c4a73","name":"Outsider's Eye","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Trained in the Perception skill","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, make a DC 20 Perception check as a standard action. On success, choose one of the following pieces of information: one Defense score of one character or vehicle within line of sight, or the identity of the character or vehicle within line of sight with the lowest or highest current hit points or the lowest or highest position on the condition track."},"benefit":"Once per encounter, make a DC 20 Perception check as a standard action. On success, choose one of the following pieces of information: one Defense score of one character or vehicle within line of sight, or the identity of the character or vehicle within line of sight with the lowest or highest current hit points or the lowest or highest position on the condition track.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"b15586b9c9554cf8","tags":["action_economy","mobility","perception","precision","skills","social","standard_action","stealth"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"outsiders-eye-t30-reference","name":"Outsider's Eye","label":"Outsider's Eye","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Your status as an outsider gives you an objective view of enemies and acquaintances. Once per encounter, you can make a DC 20 Perception check as a Standard Action. If the check is successful, you gain your choice of one of the following pieces of information:","notes":"Your status as an outsider gives you an objective view of enemies and acquaintances. Once per encounter, you can make a DC 20 Perception check as a Standard Action. If the check is successful, you gain your choice of one of the following pieces of information:","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Once per encount