{"_id":"2ed2cffbd702c1c3","name":"Mandalorian Glory","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Above everything else, Mandalorians fight for glory in battle. Once per encounter, when you reduce an opponent's hit points to 0, you gain a +5 attack bonus with your next attack during the same encounter.","description":{"value":"Above everything else, Mandalorians fight for glory in battle. Once per encounter, when you reduce an opponent's hit points to 0, you gain a +5 attack bonus with your next attack during the same encounter."},"class":"c4dbedcf989cb6b2","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","treeId":"4b8857716e056f62","tags":["action_economy","armor","battlefield_control","damage_reduction","lightsaber","melee","mobility","support","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action_reference","applicationScope":"martial_protector_arena_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until exact target/ally/battlefield context exists","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive automation. Conditional target, ally, positioning, or scene-state effects should be applied at the table or through a future runtime prompt.","combatActions":[{"id":"mandalorian-glory-t30-reference","name":"Mandalorian Glory","label":"Mandalorian Glory","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"Above everything else, Mandalorians fight for glory in battle. Once per encounter, when you reduce an opponent's Hit Points to 0, you gain a +5 attack bonus with your next attack roll during the same encounter.","notes":"Above everything else, Mandalorians fight for glory in battle. Once per encounter, when you reduce an opponent's Hit Points to 0, you gain a +5 attack