{"_id":"3449cb22b384498b","name":"Manifest Guardian Spirit","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can spend a Force Point as a swift action to have your guardian spirit manifest for the duration of the encounter. Your guardian spirit appears in any square within 6 squares of you. A guardian spirit occupies a space, but creatures can move through the guardian spirit without obstruction. As long as the guardian spirit remains within 12 squares of you, you gain a +1 morale bonus on attack rolls, a +2 morale bonus on Use the Force checks, and a +2 morale bonus to Will Defense. You can move the guardian spirit up to 6 squares as a swift action once per turn.","description":"You can spend a Force Point as a swift action to have your guardian spirit manifest for the duration of the encounter. Your guardian spirit appears in any square within 6 squares of you. A guardian spirit occupies a space, but creatures can move through the guardian spirit without obstruction. As long as the guardian spirit remains within 12 squares of you, you gain a +1 morale bonus on attack rolls, a +2 morale bonus on Use the Force checks, and a +2 morale bonus to Will Defense. You can move the guardian spirit up to 6 squares as a swift action once per turn.","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"6629c34384c4ca53","tags":["ally_support","healing","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"manual_or_reference_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"manifest-guardian-spirit","name":"Manifest Guardian Spirit","label":"Manifest Guardian Spirit","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"When you have a manifested Guardian Spirit, the Guardian Spirit also discourages your enemies and distracts them from their goals. Any enemy within 3 squares of your Guardian Spirit takes a -2 penalty to their Will Defense and a -2 penalty on attack rolls against you.","notes":"When you have a manifested Guardian Spirit, the Guardian Spirit also discourages your enemies and distracts them from their goals. Any enemy within 3 squares of your Guardian Spirit takes a -2 penalty to their Will Defense and a -2 penalty on attack rolls against you.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll"}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":["Target context confirmed"],"targetHint":"GM/player adjudicated target or affected creature(s)","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"notes":"T28 removed unsafe migrated modifier/effect data. This talent depends on Force-suite, target, equipment, ally, encounter, or table-position context and is surfaced as a truthful manual/runtime card rather than a passive actor mutation.","phase28ForceMicrotraditionCleanup":{"phase":"T28","tree":"Guardian Spirit","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Force/special-tradition microtree cleanup. Unsafe always-on rows were removed; final bonuses/effects require player/GM or future dedicated runtime owner."}},"summary":"You can spend a Force Point as a swift action to have your guardian spirit manifest for the duration of the encounter.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":17},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.manifest_guardian_spirit","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will"]}}}
{"_id":"34669d959223b187","name":"Boarder","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You are skilled at boarding hostile vessels. You ignore cover (but not improved cover) with your character-scale ranged attacks while aboard a Starship or space station.","description":{"value":"You are skilled at boarding hostile vessels. You ignore cover (but not improved cover) with your character-scale ranged attacks while aboard a Starship or space station."},"class":"fcf8cc428a6eb01a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Master Privateer","treeId":"df6678946610c554","tags":["positioning","ranged","scaling"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"gm_player_managed","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until target/ally/minion context automation exists","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent depends on target identity, ally/minion state, line of sight, positioning, encounter timing, or GM adjudication. It should not mutate permanent actor sheet totals."},"summary":"You are skilled at boarding hostile vessels.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":52},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.boarder","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-ranged"]}}}
{"_id":"34f21902e365a861","name":"Keep It Going","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Ambush Specialist","benefit":"If you reduce your Prime Target to 0 Hit Points, as a Free Action you can designate another target within your line of sight as your new Prime Target. This new target remains your Prime Target until the end of the encounter.","description":{"value":"If you reduce your Prime Target to 0 Hit Points, as a Free Action you can designate another target within your line of sight as your new Prime Target. This new target remains your Prime Target until the end of the encounter."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.e835b21a01ae2ee7","name":"Ambush Specialist"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"12027e0ad5e4d260","tags":["damage_reduction"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"If you reduce your Prime Target to 0 Hit Points, as a Free Action you can designate another target within your line of sight as your new Prime Target.","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","page":28},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.keep_it_going","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"34ff9dc64050028d","name":"Full Throttle","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can take 10 on Pilot checks made to increase your vehicle's speed. In addition, when you use the all-out movement action while piloting a vehicle, your vehicle moves up to five times its normal speed instead of four times.","description":{"value":"You can take 10 on Pilot checks made to increase your vehicle's speed. In addition, when you use the all-out movement action while piloting a vehicle, your vehicle moves up to five times its normal speed instead of four times."},"class":"9c9989c34714f920","costNumeric":null,"category":"Ace Pilot","treeId":"b17c1515c06361d6","tags":["mobility"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"MODIFIER","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"full-throttle-all-out-movement","name":"Full Throttle: All-Out Movement","label":"Full Throttle: All-Out Movement","actionType":"full-round","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Use All-Out Movement with Full Throttle; your vehicle can move up to five times normal speed instead of four. Take 10 on Increase Vehicle Speed Pilot checks where applicable.","notes":"Use All-Out Movement with Full Throttle; your vehicle can move up to five times normal speed instead of four. Take 10 on Increase Vehicle Speed Pilot checks where applicable.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Pilot"}],"resources":["Vehicle movement"]}],"phase16VehicleStarshipCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual combat action card in the action economy UI."}},"summary":"Take 10 when increasing vehicle speed and move up to 5x speed with all-out movement.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":207},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.full_throttle"}}}
{"_id":"35b42e14e3ef7d0d","name":"Damage Reduction 10","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":null,"benefit":"You can spend a Force Point as a standard action to gain damage reduction 10 for 1 minute.","description":"You can spend a Force Point as a standard action to gain damage reduction 10 for 1 minute.","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"d3661aa9906bdc79","tags":["force","recovery","resilience","resource_recovery","will_defense"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"damage-reduction-10","name":"Damage Reduction 10","label":"Damage Reduction 10","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Gain DR 10 for one minute.","notes":"Gain DR 10 for one minute.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Duration: 1 minute","Track DR state manually until condition-state owner exists"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"Spend a Force Point as a standard action to gain DR 10 for 1 minute.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":101},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.damage_reduction_10","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":[],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"35cbdbe9c91ba1d0","name":"Skilled Advisor","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can spend a Full-Round Action advising an ally, thereby granting them a +5 bonus on their next Skill Check. If you spend a Force Point, the bonus increases to +10. The target must be able to (and willing) to hear and understand your voice. You cannot advise yourself. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.","description":"You can spend a Full-Round Action advising an ally, thereby granting them a +5 bonus on their next Skill Check. If you spend a Force Point, the bonus increases to +10. The target must be able to (and willing) to hear and understand your voice. You cannot advise yourself. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.","class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"e99cfa9db8493573","tags":["action_economy","force","light_side","mobility","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"conditional","applicationScope":"runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true,"engineOwner":"Skill resolver / ally prompt","conditionSummary":"Skilled Advisor: full-round action grants an ally +5 on next skill check, or +10 if spending a Force Point.","recommendedAction":"Needs an ally-targeted temporary skill bonus prompt; do not add to permanent skill totals.","modifiers":[]},"summary":"You can spend a Full-Round Action advising an ally, thereby granting them a +5 bonus on their next Skill Check.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":40},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.skilled_advisor","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["proximity.ally-nearby"],"runtimeImplemented":true,"implementationNote":"Implemented through ConsularTalentActions and the combat action tracker."}}}
{"_id":"35cd0efb3aae31c7","name":"Double Agent","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you roll Initiative at the beginning of combat, also roll a Deception check, comparing the result to the Will Defense of all enemies in line of sight. If your Deception check is successful, that target cannot attack you and does not believe you to be an enemy (though they do not consider you an ally) while this effect is active.\n\nIf you attack or otherwise obviously harm or hinder a target under the effect of this Talent, or one of that target's allies, this effect ends. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.","description":{"value":"When you roll Initiative at the beginning of combat, also roll a Deception check, comparing the result to the Will Defense of all enemies in line of sight. If your Deception check is successful, that target cannot attack you and does not believe you to be an enemy (though they do not consider you an ally) while this effect is active.\n\nIf you attack or otherwise obviously harm or hinder a target under the effect of this Talent, or one of that target's allies, this effect ends. This is a Mind-Affecting effect."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","treeId":"4dc70f924e7794ac","tags":["action_economy","skills","social","support","intrigue","ally_support","battlefield_control"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"gm_player_managed","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Follower/dependent-actor subsystem or GM/player managed","notes":"Ally/follower/minion effects need dependent actor, adjacency, line-of-sight, attack, or action timing context; they should not mutate owner static totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"double-agent-t31-reference","name":"Double Agent","label":"Double Agent","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualRe