 check, comparing the result to the Will Defense of all enemies in line of sight.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":22},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.double_agent","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will"],"nobleOfficerCorporateCleanup":{"phase":"T10","status":"gm_player_managed","owner":"Follower/dependent-actor subsystem or GM/player managed","note":"Ally/follower/minion effects need dependent actor, adjacency, line-of-sight, attack, or action timing context; they should not mutate owner static totals."}}}}
{"_id":"366ac9dea2e484d3","name":"Improved Redirect","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Deflect, Redirect Shot","benefit":"Once per turn, when you successfully redirect an attack with the Redirect Shot talent, do not count the Deflect use that triggered the redirected attack (thus, you take no cumulative penalty to Use the Force checks from that Deflect attempt). Subsequent Deflect attempts before the beginning of your next turn impose penalties as normal.","description":"Once per turn, when you successfully redirect an attack with the Redirect Shot talent, do not count the Deflect use that triggered the redirected attack (thus, you take no cumulative penalty to Use the Force checks from that Deflect attempt). Subsequent Deflect attempts before the beginning of your next turn impose penalties as normal.","class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"b3c5d90b5036f39b","tags":["force","deflect","ranged","ranged_defense","counterattack","reaction","action_economy","use_the_force","reliability"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"triggered_deflect_penalty_credit_after_redirect","applicationScope":"redirect_shot_runtime","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":false,"uses":{"max":1,"perTurn":true}},"summary":"Once per turn, when you successfully redirect an attack with the Redirect Shot talent, do not count the Deflect use that triggered the redirected attack (thus, you take no cumulative penalty to Use the Force checks from that Deflect attempt).","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":39},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.improved_redirect","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
