{"_id":"36f8497081dce05a","name":"Fast Repairs","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Trained in the Mechanics skill","benefit":"Whenever you jury-rig an object or vehicle, the vehicle gains a number of temporary hit points equal to the result of your Mechanics check. Damage is subtracted from these temporary hit points first, and temporary hit points go away at the conclusion of the encounter.","description":{"value":"Whenever you jury-rig an object or vehicle, the vehicle gains a number of temporary hit points equal to the result of your Mechanics check. Damage is subtracted from these temporary hit points first, and temporary hit points go away at the conclusion of the encounter."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"745a5686d6f21e8c"}],"_source":"fix5F-canonical"},"treeId":"f1657b1d23a4c7dc","tags":["mechanics","skills"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase17TechEngineeringCleanup":{"status":"cleaned_future_runtime_context","owner":"future_jury_rig_repair_resolver","notes":"Changes temporary hit points from Jury-Rig based on Mechanics check result."}},"summary":"Jury-rigging grants temporary hit points equal to your Mechanics check result for the encounter.","source":"Starships of the Galaxy","page":16},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.fast_repairs","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit"]}}}
{"_id":"36fbab1a05c08fdd","name":"Exceptional Skill","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Trained in the chosen skill","description":{"value":"When you select this talent, choose one skill. Whenever you roll a skill check with that skill, a result of 2-7 on the die is always treated as though you had rolled an 8.\n\nYou can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different skill to gain the benefits of this talent."},"benefit":"When you select this talent, choose one skill. Whenever you roll a skill check with that skill, a result of 2-7 on the die is always treated as though you had rolled an 8.\n\nYou can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different skill to gain the benefits of this talent.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"04a6f32128cc4b98","talent_tree":"Superior Skills","source":"Galaxy of Intrigue","page":21,"tags":["reliability","skill-mastery","skills","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","repeatable":true,"abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"gm_player_managed","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":true,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed","notes":"The talent resolves against live check results, encounter state, or player timing decisions and should not alter permanent actor values.","combatActions":[],"rules":[{"type":"RUNTIME_CONTEXT_REFERENCE","id":"exceptional-skill-superior-skills-context","label":"Exceptional Skill","summary":"When you select this Talent, choose one Trained Skill. Whenever you roll a Skill Check with that Skill, a result of 2-7 on the die is always treated as though you had rolled an 8. You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you must choose a different Skill to gain the benefits of this Talent."}]},"choiceMeta":{"resolution":"immediate","required":true,"repeatable":true,"choiceKind":"trained_skill","choiceKey":"exceptional_skill","choiceSource":"fixed","storagePath":"flags.swse.choices.exceptional_skill","optionRegistry":"data/feat-choice-options.json#choiceKinds.trained_skill","label":"Exceptional Skill Trained Skill","prompt":"Choose the Trained Skill that Exceptional Skill applies to."},"summary":"For a trained chosen skill, natural results 2-7 count as 8; may be selected for different skills."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"3713870862584269","name":"Soothe","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Vital Transfer","benefit":"When using Vital Transfer to heal somebody, you can move the target +1 step on the Condition Track instead of healing damage. When doing so, you move -1 step on the Condition Track.","description":{"value":"When using Vital Transfer to heal somebody, you can move the target +1 step on the Condition Track instead of healing damage. When doing so, you move -1 step on the Condition Track."},"class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"a2a7a376e4905da9","tags":["condition_removal","force","force_control","force_support","light_side","medicine","mobility","skills","support"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"action_or_contextual","applicationScope":"vital_transfer_condition_track_option","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true,"engineOwner":"Force suite / Force roll flow","conditionSummary":"Vital Transfer can move the target +1 CT instead of healing damage; you move -1 CT.","recommendedAction":"Needs Vital Transfer runtime option; do not add a global healing bonus.","modifiers":[],"status":"talent_backcheck_user_text_2026_06_11","description":"Vital Transfer can move the target +1 CT instead of healing damage; you move -1 CT.","requiresSelectedChoice":false,"metadataPhase":"jedi-prestige-talent-backcheck","metadataNotes":"Updated from user-provided source text; non-automatable targeting/LOS/session adjudication remains GM/player confirmed.","rules":[{"type":"TALENT_RULE","id":"soothe","label":"Soothe","summary":"Vital Transfer can move the target +1 CT instead of healing damage; you move -1 CT.","action":"vital-transfer","mode":"vital_transfer_condition_track_option","text":"When using Vital Transfer to heal somebody, you can move the target +1 step on the Condition Track instead of healing damage. When doing 