{"_id":"379019c29b37d717","name":"Unarmed Parry","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Teräs Käsi Basics, Martial Arts I, Martial Arts II","benefit":"When you fight defensively, as a reaction you can negate a melee attack by making a successful unarmed attack roll. If your attack roll equals or exceeds the attack roll of the incoming melee attack, the attack is negated. You must be aware of the attack and not flat-footed, and you take a cumulative -2 penalty to all attack rolls for each attack roll made since the beginning of your last turn.","description":{"value":"When you fight defensively, as a reaction you can negate a melee attack by making a successful unarmed attack roll. If your attack roll equals or exceeds the attack roll of the incoming melee attack, the attack is negated. You must be aware of the attack and not flat-footed, and you take a cumulative -2 penalty to all attack rolls for each attack roll made since the beginning of your last turn."},"costNumeric":null,"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.67bddb17ae2770f3","name":"Teräs Käsi Basics"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"ba726f623e42f849","tags":["action_economy","counterattack","martial_arts","melee","melee_defense","offense_melee","reaction","unarmed","natural_weapon"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"reaction_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase20MartialArtsMasterCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Reaction/timing gate depends on Fight Defensively, incoming melee attack roll, awareness, flat-footed state, and cumulative parry count; surfaced as a manual reaction card instead of a passive melee attack bonus.","naturalWeaponPolicy":"Treat species natural weapons as unarmed-family attacks for this talent batch."},"combatActions":[{"id":"unarmed-parry","name":"Unarmed Parry","label":"Unarmed Parry","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"When fighting defensively and aware of an incoming melee attack, use the reaction button on the incoming attack card to roll an unarmed or natural weapon attack. If the roll equals or exceeds the incoming attack roll, the attack is negated. Track the cumulative -2 attack penalty manually for repeated parries since your last turn.","notes":"When fighting defensively and aware of an incoming melee attack, use the reaction button on the incoming attack card to roll an unarmed or natural weapon attack. If the roll equals or exceeds the incoming attack roll, the attack is negated. Track the cumulative -2 attack penalty manually for repeated parries since your last turn.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll","when":"Unarmed Strike or natural weapon vs incoming melee attack roll"}],"resources":["Requires Fight Defensively","Incoming melee attack","Cumulative -2 penalty per parry since last turn"],"requiredContext":["Incoming melee attack","You are aware of the attack","You are not flat-footed"],"targetHint":"Incoming melee attacker","reactionKey":"unarmedParry","reactionTrigger":"ON_ATTACK_DECLARED"}],"reactionKeys":["unarmedParry"],"reactions":[{"key":"unarmedParry","trigger":"ON_ATTACK_DECLARED","source":"Unarmed Parry"}],"phase21ReactionAddendum":{"status":"reaction_engine_wired","owner":"ReactionEngine","notes":"Owned talent now grants the unarmedParry reaction key. Incoming melee attack cards can surface the reaction pill when the defender is fighting defensively and not flat-footed."}},"summary":"While fighting defensively, react with an unarmed attack roll to negate an incoming melee attack, with cumulative penalties for repeated rolls.","source":"Threats of the Galaxy","page":53},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.unarmed_parry","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-melee"]}}}
{"_id":"37bf53b4b2c0e539","name":"Wealth","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Each time you gain a level, including the level at which you select this talent, you receive an amount of credits equal to 5,000 x your noble level. You can spend these credits as you see fit. The credits appear in a civilized, accessible location of your choice or in your private bank account.","description":{"value":"Each time you gain a level, including the level at which you select this talent, you receive an amount of credits equal to 5,000 x your noble level. You can spend these credits as you see fit. The credits appear in a civilized, accessible location of your choice or in your private bank account."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","treeId":"b5bb4154688c66ab","tags":["resources","scaling"],"executionModel":"PROGRESSION","subType":"LEVEL_UP","abilityMeta":{"trigger":"LEVEL_UP","effect":{"type":"GRANT_CREDITS","amount":{"type":"LINEAGE_LEVEL_MULTIPLIER","multiplier":5000},"oncePerLineageLevel":true},"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_future_runtime","applicationScope":"social_commander_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"ProgressionFinalizer Wealth credit grant","notes":"Progression/credit award talent; should be handled by level-up/economy support, not passive combat modifiers.","requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase23SocialCommanderCleanup":{"phase":"T23","tree":"Lineage","status":"reviewed_manual_or_future_runtime","cardsAdded":0,"notes":"Progression/credit award talent; should be handled by level-up/economy support, not passive combat modifiers."}},"summary":"Gain 5,000 credits per noble level each time you gain a level.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":44},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.wealth","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":[],"wealthAutomation":"progression-grant-credits-v1","nobleOfficerCorporateCleanup":{"phase":"T10","status":"implemented_existing_owner","owner":"ProgressionFinalizer Wealth credit grant","note":"Already implemented by level-up/chargen Wealth credit grant logic; no passive modifier needed."}}}}
{"_id":"37c45caffa191816","name":"Raider's Frenzy","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per round, when one of your allies within 6 squares successfully damages a target, you grant all your allies within your line of sight a bonus to damage rolls against that target equal to one-half your class level until the end of your next turn.","description":{"value":"Once per round, when one of your allies within 6 squares successfully damages a target, you grant all your allies within your line of sight a bonus to damage rolls against that target equal to one-half your class level until the end of your next turn."},"class":"fcf8cc428a6eb01a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Master Privateer","treeId":"61db5e2c0c44ef67","tags":["positioning","support","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"gm_player_managed","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until target/ally/minion context automation exists","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent depends on target identity, ally/minion state, line of sight, positioning, encounter timing, or GM adjudication. It should not mutate permanent actor sheet totals."},"summary":"Once per round, when one of your allies within 6 squares successfully damages a target, you grant all your allies within your line of sight a bonus to damage rolls against that target equal to one-half your class level until the end of your next turn.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":33},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.raiders_frenzy","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"37ee909a7de54768","name":"Channel Anger","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Channel Aggression.","benefit":"You let your anger swell into a Rage. As a Swift Action, you may spend a Force Point to gain a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier. At the end of this duration, you move -1 step along the Condition Track.\n\nWhile Raging, you cannot use Skills that require patience and concentration, such as Mechanics, Stealth, or Use the Force.","description":{"value":"You let your anger swell into a Rage. As a Swift Action, you may spend a Force Point to gain a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier. At the end of this duration, you move -1 step along the Condition Track.\n\nWhile Raging, you cannot use Skills that require patience and concentration, such as Mechanics, Stealth, or Use the Force."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Dark Side Devotee","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.ef3ec55015c60bda","name":"Channel Aggression"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"96ef43a3054dcb58","tags":["action_economy","condition_removal","dark_side","force","force_capacity","force_point_spend","force_training","melee","mobility","offense_melee","resource_spend","stealth","sustained_damage","swift_action","use_the_force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"runtime_self_buff","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":false,"modifiers":[],"notes":"Swift action Force Point rage buff with duration, skill restrictions, and later condition-track penalty.","combatActions":[{"id":"channel-anger","name":"Channel Anger","label":"Channel Anger","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"You let your anger swell into a Rage. As a Swift Action, you may spend a Force Point to gain a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier. At the end of this duration, you move -1 step along the Condition Track.","notes":"You let your anger swell into a Rage. As a Swift Action, you may spend a Force Point to gain a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier. At the end of this duration, you move -1 step along the Condition Track.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll"}],"resources":["Force Point context"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Dark Side Devotee","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."},"source":"talent-backcheck","combatActionId":"channel-anger","sithTalentAction":"channelAnger"},"talent_tree":"Dark Side Devotee","tree":"Dark Side Devotee","implementationStatus":"implemented","automationBoundary":"supported","summary":"You let your anger swell into a Rage. As a Swift Action, you may spend a Force Point to gain a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls for a number of rounds equal to 5 + your Constitution modifier.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":213},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.channel_anger","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-melee"],"forcePrestigeCleanup":{"phase":"T9","status":"manual_or_runtime","scope":"runtime_self_buff"}}}}
{"_id":"383915a7d11e1225","name":"Devastating Attack","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you are proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using such a weapon, you treat your target's Damage Threshold as if it were 5 points lower when determining the result of your attack. If you select Heavy Weapons as the weapon group this Talent applies to, you may also use the Talent with Vehicle Weapon attacks. You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different Exotic Weapon or weapon group.","description":{"value":"Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you are proficient. Whenever you make a successful attack against a target using such a weapon, you treat your target's Damage Threshold as if it were 5 points lower when determining the result of your attack. If you select Heavy Weapons as the weapon group this Talent applies to, you may also use the Talent with Vehicle Weapon attacks.\n\nYou may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select this Talent, it applies to a different Exotic Weapon or weapon group."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"2e9265a596cc43f7","tags":["weapon_training","damage_threshold","melee","ranged","targeting"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"requiresSelectedChoice":true,"choiceMetaStatus":"phase14_persistent_choice_seeded","mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"selected_weapon_hit_rider","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Weapon Master","status":"cleaned_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":1,"notes":"Unsafe passive/ActiveEffect data removed. Talent is represented by action cards, attack options, hit/critical riders, or explicit manual metadata as appropriate."},"rules":[{"type":"HIT_RIDER","id":"devastating-attack-threshold-reduction","label":"Devastating Attack","targetEffectsOnHit":[{"type":"damageThresholdAdjustment","value":-5,"duration":"thisAttack"}],"selectedChoice":true}],"manualResolution":false},"choiceMeta":{"resolution":"immediate","required":true,"status":"phase14_choice_kind_wired","choiceKind":"weapon_group_or_exotic","repeatable":true,"storagePath":"flags.swse.choices.devastating_attack","choiceSource":"prerequisiteDerived","optionRegistry":"data/feat-choice-options.json#choiceKinds.weapon_group_or_exotic","derivesFrom":["weapon_proficiency"],"consumes":"weapon_proficiency","provides":"weapon_group_or_exotic"},"summary":"Choose a single Exotic Weapon or weapon group with which you are proficient.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":53},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.devastating_attack","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":[],"requiresImmediateChoice":true}}}
{"_id":"388f30468a80f221","name":"Synchronized Fire","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Expert Gunner","benefit":"Once per encounter, you may ready to fire a single weapon at the same target as an ally, and you coordinate with a single weapon of your ally. If both attacks hit, you add the damage of the two weapons together before applying the target's SR or DR, and treat it as a single attack for purposes of exceeding the target's damage threshold.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, you may ready to fire a single weapon at the same target as an ally, and you coordinate with a single weapon of your ally. If both attacks hit, you add the damage of the two weapons together before applying the target's SR or DR, and treat it as a single attack for purposes of exceeding the target's damage threshold."},"class":"9c9989c34714f920","costNumeric":null,"category":"Ace Pilot","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.befaa195df06b274","name":"Expert Gunner"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"43ead399d82b8142","tags":["support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"synchronized-fire","name":"Synchronized Fire","label":"Synchronized Fire","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, ready and coordinate fire with one ally against the same target; if both attacks hit, combine the weapon damage before Shield Rating or Damage Reduction.","notes":"Once per encounter, ready and coordinate fire with one ally against the same target; if both attacks hit, combine the weapon damage before Shield Rating or Damage Reduction.","resources":["Once per encounter","Vehicle weapon"]}],"phase16VehicleStarshipCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual combat action card in the action economy UI."}},"summary":"Once per encounter, coordinate one weapon with an ally so two successful hits combine before SR/DR and damage-threshold comparison.","source":"Starships of the Galaxy","page":17},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.synchronized_fire","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"38e64db2b516759a","name":"Renowned Pilot","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Your reputation as a skilled pilot precedes you and bolsters the resolve of your allies. All allies within 6 squares of a Vehicle you Pilot can reroll one Pilot check, keeping the better of the two results.\n\nOnce an ally has used this ability, that same ally cannot gain this Talent's benefit during the same encounter.","description":{"value":"Your reputation as a skilled pilot precedes you and bolsters the resolve of your allies. All allies within 6 squares of a Vehicle you Pilot can reroll one Pilot check, keeping the better of the two results.\n\nOnce an ally has used this ability, that same ally cannot gain this Talent's benefit during the same encounter."},"class":"9c9989c34714f920","costNumeric":null,"category":"Ace Pilot","treeId":"b17c1515c06361d6","tags":["positioning","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase16VehicleStarshipCleanup":{"status":"metadata_or_gm_player_managed","owner":"GM/player or future vehicle subsystem","notes":"No truthful automatic runtime owner in this pass; stale migrated modifiers/effects removed if present."}},"summary":"Your reputation as a skilled pilot precedes you and bolsters the resolve of your allies. All allies within 6 squares of a Vehicle you Pilot can reroll one Pilot check, keeping the better of the two results.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":39},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.renowned_pilot","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.408Z","detectedPredicates":["proximity.ally-nearby","proximity.count-allies-within-12"]}}}
{"_id":"394809ed8baff1b9","name":"Improved Armored Defense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Armored Defense.","benefit":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus, whichever is higher. You must be proficient with the Armor you are wearing to gain this benefit.","description":{"value":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus, whichever is higher. You must be proficient with the Armor you are wearing to gain this benefit."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.4c236343b01ea763","name":"Armored Defense"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"17cec542331cb4e4","tags":["armor"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"implementationStatus":"implemented_by_defense_calculator","engineOwner":"DefenseCalculator","mechanicsMode":"passive","applicationScope":"equipped_armor_context","staticSheetPolicy":"owned_by_defense_calculator","conditionSummary":"Applies while wearing armor with which the actor is proficient; uses max(heroic level + half armor bonus, armor bonus) for the armor/level Reflex contribution.","notes":"Removed migrated flat +2 Reflex passive modifier. The real rule is calculated by DefenseCalculator.","implementationNote":"Handled by defense calculator. Applies only while wearing proficient armor.","runtime":"armor-calculator","tags":["armor-specialist"]},"implementationNote":"Handled by defense calculator. Applies only while wearing proficient armor.","effects":[],"summary":"When calculating your Reflex Defense, you may add your Heroic Level plus one-half your Armor bonus (rounded down), or your Armor bonus, whichever is higher.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":52},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.improved_armored_defense","runtimeOwner":"DefenseCalculator","armorTreeCleanup":"phase_t6_armor_specialist"}}}
