{"_id":"3aeee38a6c7b7f12","name":"Double Up","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Find an Opening, Seize the Moment","benefit":"Once per encounter, whenever you would use Seize the Moment, you can forgo the extra swift action to make an immediate melee or ranged attack against the damaged opponent. If your attack is a ranged attack that hits and deals damage, you treat the damage dealt by you and your ally as though it was one attack for the purposes of overcoming DR, SR, and determining whether the damage exceeded the target's damage threshold.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, whenever you would use Seize the Moment, you can forgo the extra swift action to make an immediate melee or ranged attack against the damaged opponent. If your attack is a ranged attack that hits and deals damage, you treat the damage dealt by you and your ally as though it was one attack for the purposes of overcoming DR, SR, and determining whether the damage exceeded the target's damage threshold."},"class":"19ee85a788380256","costNumeric":null,"category":"Outlaw","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.3991e671da41995a","name":"Find an Opening"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"3caa80f6bef04200","tags":["action_economy","defense","mobility","offense_ranged","positioning","ranged","shields","support","survivability","swift_action","pursuit","reaction"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"double-up","name":"Double Up","label":"Double Up","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, whenever you would use Seize the Moment, you can forgo the extra Swift Action to make an immediate melee or ranged attack against the damaged opponent. If your attack is a ranged attack that hits and deals damage, you treat the damage dealt by you and your ally as though it was one attack for purposes of overcoming Damage Reduction, Shield Rating, and determining whether the damage exceeded the target's Damage Threshold.","notes":"Once per encounter, whenever you would use Seize the Moment, you can forgo the extra Swift Action to make an immediate melee or ranged attack against the damaged opponent. If your attack is a ranged attack that hits and deals damage, you treat the damage dealt by you and your ally as though it was one attack for purposes of overcoming Damage Reduction, Shield Rating, and determining whether the damage exceeded the target's Damage Threshold.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll","when":"Immediate melee/ranged attack"}],"resources":["Once per encounter","Forgo Seize the Moment extra swift action","Combines ranged damage for DR/SR/DT"],"requiredContext":["You would use Seize the Moment"],"targetHint":"Damaged opponent","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Outlaw","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."}},"summary":"Once per encounter, whenever you would use Seize the Moment, you can forgo the extra swift action to make an immediate melee or ranged attack against the damaged opponent.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":35},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default"