{"_id":"3e18acc25d6c03db","name":"Steel Resolve","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you use a standard action to make a melee attack, you can take a penalty of -1 to -5 on your attack roll and add twice that value (+2 to +10) as an insight bonus to your Will Defense. This bonus may not exceed your base attack bonus. The changes to attack rolls and Will Defense last until the start of your next turn.","description":"When you use a standard action to make a melee attack, you can take a penalty of -1 to -5 on your attack roll and add twice that value (+2 to +10) as an insight bonus to your Will Defense. This bonus may not exceed your base attack bonus. The changes to attack rolls and Will Defense last until the start of your next turn.","class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"36f18f3e974feb33","tags":["force","force_defense","force_offense","light_side","melee"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"combat_option_manual","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","manualResolution":true,"notes":"Standard-action melee attack option: choose -1 to -5 attack and gain twice that value as insight bonus to Will until next turn. Needs combat option / runtime prompt; no static bonus.","modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"steel-resolve","name":"Steel Resolve","label":"Steel Resolve","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"When you use a Standard Action to make a melee attack, you can take a penalty between -1 to -5 on your attack roll and add twice that value (+2 to +10) as an insight bonus to your Will Defense. This bonus may not exceed your Base Attack Bonus. The changes to attack rolls and Will Defense last until the start of your next turn.","notes":"When you use a Standard Action to make a melee attack, you can take a penalty between -1 to -5 on your attack roll and add twice that value (+2 to +10) as an insight bonus to your Will Defense. This bonus may not exceed your Base Attack Bonus. The changes to attack rolls and Will Defense last until the start of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll"}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Jedi Sentinel","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."}},"talent_tree":"Jedi Sentinel","slug":"steel-resolve","summary":"When you use a standard action to make a melee attack, you can take a penalty of -1 to -5 on your attack roll and add twice that value (+2 to +10) as an insight bonus to your Will Defense.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":24},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.steel_resolve","jediTreeCleanup":{"phase":"T7","status":"manual_or_contextual","reason":"Standard-action melee attack option: choose -1 to -5 attack and gain twice that value as insight bonus to Will until next turn. Needs combat option / runtime prompt; no static bonus."}}}}
