{"_id":"488aaac69a9829bc","name":"Transfer Power","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Force Training feat","benefit":"As a standard action, you can spend any one use of a Force power currently in your Force suite, adding a use of that power to the Force suite of any ally trained in the Use the Force skill. The ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight. When your ally uses that power, it disappears from his or her Force suite. If the ally does not use the Force power before the end of the encounter, it is permanently removed from his or her Force suite.","description":{"value":"As a standard action, you can spend any one use of a Force power currently in your Force suite, adding a use of that power to the Force suite of any ally trained in the Use the Force skill. The ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight. When your ally uses that power, it disappears from his or her Force suite. If the ally does not use the Force power before the end of the encounter, it is permanently removed from his or her Force suite."},"class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"303d91124d4548c0","tags":["force","light_side","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Transfer Power"}],"status":"talent_backcheck_user_text_2026_06_11","description":"Standard Action: spend one Force Power use to grant that power once to a trained ally within 12 squares and line of sight.","mechanicsMode":"action_or_contextual","applicationScope":"force_suite_power_transfer","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"conditionSummary":"Standard Action: spend one Force Power use to grant that power once to a trained ally within 12 squares and line of sight.","metadataPhase":"jedi-prestige-talent-backcheck","metadataNotes":"Updated from user-provided source text; non-automatable targeting/LOS/session adjudication remains GM/player confirmed.","rules":[{"type":"TALENT_RULE","id":"transfer_power","label":"Transfer Power","summary":"Standard Action: spend one Force Power use to grant that power once to a trained ally within 12 squares and line of sight.","action":"standard-action","mode":"force_suite_power_transfer","text":"As a Standard Action, you can spend any one use of a Force Power currently in your Force Power Suite, adding a use of that Force Power to the Force Power Suite of any ally Trained in the Use the Force skill. The ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight.\n\nWhen your ally uses that Force Power, it disappears from his or her Force Power Suite. If the ally does not use the Force Power before the end of the encounter, it is permanently removed from his or her Force Power Suite."}]},"effect":"As a Standard Action, you can spend any one use of a Force Power currently in your Force Power Suite, adding a use of that Force Power to the Force Power Suite of any ally Trained in the Use the Force skill. The ally must be within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight.\n\nWhen your ally uses that Force Power, it disappears from his or her Force Power Suite. If the ally does not use the Force Power before the end of the encounter, it is permanently removed from his or her Force Power Suite.","shortSummary":"Standard Action: spend one Force Power use to grant that power once to a trained ally within 12 squares and line of sight.","prerequisite":"Force Training","prerequisitesText":"Force Training","grantsActions":["standard-action"],"summary":"As a standard action, you can spend any one use of a Force power currently in your Force suite, adding a use of that power to the Force suite of any ally trained in the Use the Force skill.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":20},"effects":[],"fo