{"_id":"55b2475e42ce79f2","name":"Second Strike","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Blast Back","benefit":"Once per encounter when you miss a target with a single melee or ranged attack, as a Free Action you can move up to half your speed and make a second attack of the same type against a different target. This movement doesn't provoke Attacks of Opportunity.\n\nIf you have the Combat Reflexes feat, you may use this Talent a number of times per encounter equal to your Dexterity bonus (minimum 1). You may still only use this Talent once per round.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter when you miss a target with a single melee or ranged attack, as a Free Action you can move up to half your speed and make a second attack of the same type against a different target. This movement doesn't provoke Attacks of Opportunity.\n\nIf you have the Combat Reflexes feat, you may use this Talent a number of times per encounter equal to your Dexterity bonus (minimum 1). You may still only use this Talent once per round."},"class":"b5bed5d1b5f42958","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.2d486ece7350cedf","name":"Blast Back"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"5a30489609182e8c","tags":["mobility","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Once per encounter when you miss a target with a single melee or ranged attack, as a Free Action you can move up to half your speed and make a second attack of the same type against a different target.","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","page":26},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.second_strike","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.413Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
