d your target take a -2 penalty on attack rolls until the beginning of your next turn.","notes":"When you reduce a target to 0 Hit Points or move the target to the bottom of the Condition Track, all your opponents within line of sight of both you and your target take a -2 penalty on attack rolls until the beginning of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Trigger: reduce target to 0 HP or bottom CT","Opponents in line of sight take -2 attacks"],"requiredContext":["Opponents can see you and target"],"targetHint":"Opponents in line of sight","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}]},"summary":"When you reduce a target to 0 hit points or move the target to the bottom of the condition track, all your opponents within line of sight of both you and your target take a -2 penalty on attack rolls until the beginning of your next turn.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":29},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.deadly_repercussions","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.413Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Genohardan","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"58e37d40d3aa7d4b","name":"Precision Implant","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per encounter as a standard action, you can give one adjacent living creature a precision implant. The target must be willing to receive this implant, which grants the target a +1 equipment bonus on attack rolls until the end of the encounter.\n\nThe following talents all grant effects that last until the end of the encounter. At the end of the encounter, any target that benefits from one or more of these talents immediately moves -3 steps down the condition track, and the condition becomes persistent. The persistent condition can only be removed after 8 hours of rest, or by performing successful surgery (as per the application of the Treat Injury skill) on the target.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter as a standard action, you can give one adjacent living creature a precision implant. The target must be willing to receive this implant, which grants the target a +1 equipment bonus on attack rolls until the end of the encounter.\n\nThe following talents all grant effects that last until the end of the encounter. At the end of the encounter, any target that benefits from one or more of these talents immediately moves -3 steps down the condition track, and the condition becomes persistent. The persistent condition can only be removed after 8 hours of rest, or by performing successful surgery (as per the application of the Treat Injury skill) on the target."},"class":"557e1a5ec72166fd","costNumeric":null,"category":"Shaper","treeId":"d8a71a6c5b2b7581","tags":["ability_enhancement","action_economy","biotech","crafting","equipment","healing","implant","positioning","standard_action","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"precision-implant","name":"Precision Implant","label":"Precision Implant","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, give one adjacent willing living creature a +1 equipment bonus on attack rolls until the encounter ends.","notes":"Apply the +1 equipment attack bonus manually to the recipient for the rest of the encounter.","resources":["Once per encounter","Encounter duration"],"requiredContext":["Adjacent willing living creature"],"targetHint":"One adjacent willing living creature"}],"phase18MedicalBiotechCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual action-economy card; no passive bonus is applied automatically."}},"summary":"Once per encounter as a standard action, you can give one adjacent living creature a precision implant.","source":"Legacy Era Campaign Guide","page":47},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.precision_implant","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.413Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"590178f76ad1b08a","name":"Shield Expert","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Armor Proficiency (tight)","benefit":"You are an expert in using personal shields for maximum effectiveness. Once per encounter, you can spend a swift action to regain 10 points of SR (up to the shield’s maximum) on an active personal shield.","description":{"value":"You are an expert in using personal shields for maximum effectiveness. Once per encounter, you can spend a swift action to regain 10 points of SR (up to the shield’s maximum) on an active personal shield."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"17cec542331cb4e4","tags":["action_economy","armor","mobility","shields"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"implementationStatus":"needs_runtime_resource_prompt","engineOwner":"ResourceReactionSystem","mechanicsMode":"resource_reaction","applicationScope":"energy_shield_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"conditionSummary":"Once per encounter, spend a Swift Action to restore 10 SR to an active energy shield, up to its maximum.","notes":"Removed bogus attack +2 state metadata. This needs a shield/SR recovery action or prompt, not a static or attack modifier.","implementationNote":"Implemented through ArmorTalentActions.promptShieldExpert and the combat action tracker.","runtime":"armor-talent-action","tags":["armor-specialist"],"grantedCombatActions":[{"id":"shield-expert","name":"Shield Expert","actionType":"swift","resolutionMode":"armorTalent","armorTalentAction":"shieldExpert","spendAction":true,"description":"You are an expert in using Energy Shields for maximum effectiveness. Once per encounter, you can spend a Swift Action to regain 10 points of SR (up to the shield's maximum) on an active Energy Shield.","notes":"Once per encounter, restores 10 SR to an active Energy Shield up to its maximum."}]},"implementationNote":"Implemented 