{"_id":"5989079457c8a3cf","name":"Safe Zone","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a Standard Action, you can identify a Safe Zone, within which your allies gain certain advantages. You designate a 4-by-4 square area of the combat area as a Safe Zone; at least 1 square of the Safe Zone must be the square you currently occupy. Each ally who starts his or her turn within the Safe Zone gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her Fortitude Defense and Will Defense until the start of the ally's next turn. The Safe Zone lasts until the end of the encounter, and you can have only one Safe Zone in effect at a time.\n\nYou can create a new Safe Zone as a Standard Action, dismissing the old Safe Zone and replacing it with the new one, but no square of the old Safe Zone can overlap with any square of the new Safe Zone. You cannot create a Safe Zone in a space that overlaps another Pathfinder's Safe Zone.","description":{"value":"As a Standard Action, you can identify a Safe Zone, within which your allies gain certain advantages. You designate a 4-by-4 square area of the combat area as a Safe Zone; at least 1 square of the Safe Zone must be the square you currently occupy. Each ally who starts his or her turn within the Safe Zone gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her Fortitude Defense and Will Defense until the start of the ally's next turn. The Safe Zone lasts until the end of the encounter, and you can have only one Safe Zone in effect at a time.\n\nYou can create a new Safe Zone as a Standard Action, dismissing the old Safe Zone and replacing it with the new one, but no square of the old Safe Zone can overlap with any square of the new Safe Zone. You cannot create a Safe Zone in a space that overlaps another Pathfinder's Safe Zone."},"class":"4ee81a6708a516cd","costNumeric":null,"category":"Pathfinder","treeId":"383ff8d392488cf8","tags":["action_economy","battlefield_control","cover","mobility","positioning","recon","scaling","standard_action","support","survival","exploration"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"MODIFIER","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"survival_exploration_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Standard-action Safe Zone placement is surfaced as an action card. The ally-only Fortitude/Will bonus is not applied as a passive bonus to the owner.","phase25SurvivalExplorationCleanup":{"phase":"T25","tree":"Pathfinder","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Standard-action Safe Zone placement is surfaced as an action card. The ally-only Fortitude/Will bonus is not applied as a passive bonus to the owner."},"combatActions":[{"id":"safe-zone-create","name":"Safe Zone: Create / Replace Zone","label":"Safe Zone: Create / Replace Zone","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"As a Standard Action, you can identify a Safe Zone, within which your allies gain certain advantages. You designate a 4-by-4 square area of the combat area as a Safe Zone; at least 1 square of the Safe Zone must be the square you currently occupy. Each ally who starts his or her turn within the Safe Zone gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her Fortitude Defense and Will Defense until the start of the ally's next turn. The Safe Zone lasts until the end of the encounter, and you can have only one Safe Zone in effect at a time.","notes":"As a Standard Action, you can identify a Safe Zone, within which your allies gain certain advantages. You designate a 4-by-4 square area of the combat area as a Safe Zone; at least 1 square of the Safe Zone must be the square you currently occupy. Each ally who starts his or her turn within the Safe Zone gains a +2 circumstance bonus to his or her Fortitude Defense and Will Defense until the start of the ally's next turn. The Safe Zone lasts until the end of the encounter, and you can have only one Safe Zone in effect at a time.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["One 4x4 square Safe Zone","+2 circumstance Fortitude/Will for allies starting in zone","One Safe Zone at a time"],"requiredContext":["Designate legal 4-by-4 square area","At least one square must be your current square"],"targetHint":"Battlefield zone","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[{"type":"ZONE_REFERENCE","id":"safe-zone","label":"Safe Zone","affects":"allies","defenseBonuses":{"fortitude":2,"will":2},"bonusType":"circumstance","owner":"GM/player zone context"}]},"summary":"As a Standard Action, you can identify a Safe Zone, within which your allies gain certain advantages.","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","page":45},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.safe_zone"}}}
{"_id":"59b2b90ad0ae8eb8","name":"Concealed Weapon Expert","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You are deadly with an unarmed strike, hold-out blaster, dagger, or vibrodagger or other small, concealable weapon (as determined by the Gamemaster). Once per round you can use a swift action to reroll an attack using one of these weapons, but you must take the second result, even if it is worse.","description":{"value":"You are deadly with an unarmed strike, hold-out blaster, dagger, or vibrodagger or other small, concealable weapon (as determined by the Gamemaster). Once per round you can use a swift action to reroll an attack using one of these weapons, but you must take the second result, even if it is worse."},"class":"e647ee8f065e1d19","costNumeric":null,"category":"Infiltrator","treeId":"7c7a8730e1b4381a","tags":["melee","sustained_damage","unarmed","stealth","infiltration","pursuit","stun"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Infiltration","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"concealed-weapon-expert","name":"Concealed Weapon Expert","label":"Concealed Weapon Expert","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"You are deadly with an Unarmed strike, Hold-Out Blaster Pistol, Knife, Vibrodagger, or other small concealable weapons (as determined by the Gamemaster). Once per round you can use a Swift Action to reroll an attack using one of these weapons, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.","notes":"You are deadly with an Unarmed strike, Hold-Out Blaster Pistol, Knife, Vibrodagger, or other small concealable weapons (as determined by the Gamemaster). Once per round you can use a Swift Action to reroll an attack using one of these weapons, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll","when":"Concealable weapon"}],"resources":["Once per round","Reroll attack; keep second"],"requiredContext":["Unarmed, hold-out blaster pistol, knife, vibrodagger, or GM-approved concealable weapon"],"targetHint":"Attack target","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}]},"summary":"You are deadly with an unarmed strike, hold-out blaster, dagger, or vibrodagger or other small, concealable weapon (as determined by the Gamemaster).","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":49},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.concealed_weapon_expert","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.413Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Infiltration","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"5a2dee101c2217b3","name":"Exotic Weapons Master","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Proficiency in at least one exotic weapon","benefit":"You treat all exotic weapons as a single weapon group (exotic weapons). If you already have feats that grant proficiency with or augment the use of one exotic weapon, those feats grant proficiency with or augment all exotic weapons. For example, if you already had Exotic Weapon Proficiency (shyarn) and Weapon Focus (shyarn) you now how Weapon Proficiency (exotic weapons) and Weapon Focus (exotic weapons), and the effects of both feats apply to all exotic weapons.","description":{"value":"You treat all exotic weapons as a single weapon group (exotic weapons). If you already have feats that grant proficiency with or augment the use of one exotic weapon, those feats grant proficiency with or augment all exotic weapons. For example, if you already had Exotic Weapon Proficiency (shyarn) and Weapon Focus (shyarn) you now how Weapon Proficiency (exotic weapons) and Weapon Focus (exotic weapons), and the effects of both feats apply to all exotic weapons."},"class":"533f1066362655c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Gladiator","treeId":"12a2a02b0901605d","tags":["action_economy","burst_damage","condition_removal","damage_reduction","mobility","positioning","scaling","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action_reference","applicationScope":"martial_protector_arena_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":true,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Future progression picker + Ability Engine roll-context resolver","notes":"Reviewed in T12. This talent needs a persistent selected weapon group/exotic weapon/equivalence decision before any roll modifier can be applied safely.","combatActions":[{"id":"exotic-weapons-master-t30-reference","name":"Exotic Weapons Master","label":"Exotic Weapons Master","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You treat all Exotic Weapons as a single weapon group. If you already have Feats or Talents that grant you proficiency with, or augment the use of, one Exotic Weapon, those Feats now apply to all Exotic Weapons. For example, if you already had Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Shyarn), and Weapon Focus (Shyarn), you are now proficient with, and possess the Weapon Focus Feat for, all Exotic Weapons.","notes":"You treat all Exotic Weapons as a single weapon group. If you already have Feats or Talents that grant you proficiency with, or augment the use of, one Exotic Weapon, those Feats now apply to all Exotic Weapons. For example, if you already had Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Shyarn), and Weapon Focus (Shyarn), you are now proficient with, and possess the Weapon Focus Feat for, all Exotic Weapons.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["GM/player confirmed context"],"requiredContext":["Arena/attack trigger context confirmed"],"targetHint":"GM/player adjudicated target or context","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"manualResolution":true,"phase30MartialProtectorArenaCleanup":{"phase":"T30","tree":"Gladiatorial Combat","status":"reviewed_manual_or_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"T30 removed unsafe passive rows from martial/protector/arena/species leftovers and surfaced action, reaction, recovery, cover, and attack-rider context as truthful cards/rules."}},"summary":"You treat all exotic weapons as a single weapon group (exotic weapons).","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":44},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"skillSubstitution":true,"substitutionType":"exotic_focus","description":"Grants Weapon Focus (exotic melee) for any weapon group","id":"swse.talent.exotic_weapons_master","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.413Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit","movement.while-moving","proximity.ally-nearby","turn.once-per-round"]}}}
