{"_id":"5fd19be0deca1115","name":"Juyo","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Weapon Focus (lightsabers); Weapon Specialization (lightsabers); base attack bonus +10","benefit":"Once per encounter, you may spend a Force Point as a swift action to designate a single enemy in your line of sight. For the remainder of the encounter, you may reroll your first attack roll each round against that opponent, keeping the better result.","description":"Once per encounter, you may spend a Force Point as a swift action to designate a single enemy in your line of sight. For the remainder of the encounter, you may reroll your first attack roll each round against that opponent, keeping the better result.","class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["action_economy","burst_damage","dark_side","force","force_control","force_offense","lightsaber","melee","mobility","precision","skills","social","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"encounter_target_reroll_manual","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","manualResolution":true,"notes":"Once per encounter, spend a Force Point as a Swift Action to designate one opponent; reroll first attack each round against that opponent. Needs runtime target designation and encounter state; no skill bonus.","modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"juyo","name":"Juyo","label":"Juyo","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, you may spend a Force Point as a Swift Action to designate a single opponent in your line of sight. For the remainder of the encounter, you may reroll your first attack roll each round against that opponent, keeping the better of the two results.","notes":"Once per encounter, you may spend a Force Point as a Swift Action to designate a single opponent in your line