{"_id":"642c6c8643db7470","name":"Greater Weapon Focus","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Weapon Focus with the chosen weapon","benefit":"Choose one exotic weapon or weapon group with which you are proficient. You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the chosen weapon. This bonus stacks with Weapon Focus. You may select this talent multiple times, applying it to a different weapon each time.","description":{"value":"Choose one exotic weapon or weapon group with which you are proficient. You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls with the chosen weapon. This bonus stacks with Weapon Focus. You may select this talent multiple times, applying it to a different weapon each time."},"class":"c4dbedcf989cb6b2","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","treeId":"2f720d8b061f9bd0","tags":["damage_reduction"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"choice_required","applicationScope":"persistent_selection","staticSheetPolicy":"roll_context_only","requiresRuntimeContext":false,"requiresSelectedChoice":true,"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":1,"type":"untyped","predicates":["attack.weapon-matches-selected-choice"],"enabled":true,"priority":500,"description":"Greater Weapon Focus"}],"implementedBy":"Future progression picker + Ability Engine roll-context resolver","notes":"Reviewed in T12. This talent needs a persistent selected weapon group/exotic weapon/equivalence decision before any roll modifier can be applied safely.","choiceMetaStatus":"phase14_persistent_choice_seeded","manualResolution":false,"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Weapon Master","status":"selected_choice_roll_modifier","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Safe selected-choice roll modifier restored; applies only when the selected weapon group/exotic weapon matches the rolled weapon."}},"choiceMeta":{"resolution":"immediate","required":true,"status":"phase14_existing_choice_confirmed","choiceKind":"greater_weapon_focus","repeatable":true,"storagePath":"flags.swse.choices.greater_weapon_focus","choiceSource":"prerequisiteDerived","optionRegistry":"data/feat-choice-options.json#choiceKinds.greater_weapon_focus","derivesFrom":["weapon_focus"],"consumes":"weapon_focus","provides":"greater_weapon_focus"},"summary":"Gain another +1 attack with a chosen weapon, stacking with Weapon Focus.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":212},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.greater_weapon_focus","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.414Z","detectedPredicates":[],"requiresImmediateChoice":true}}}
{"_id":"648d9634a3795988","name":"Spynet Agent","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Bothan species, or two talents from the Infiltration tree","benefit":"You can use your Gather Information check modifier instead of your Knowledge (galactic lore) check modifier when making Knowledge (galactic lore) checks. You are considered trained in the Knowledge (galactic lore) skill for the purpose of using this talent. If you are entitled to a Knowledge (galactic lore) reroll, you can reroll your Gather Information check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).","description":{"value":"You can use your Gather Information check modifier instead of your Knowledge (galactic lore) check modifier when making Knowledge (galactic lore) checks. You are considered trained in the Knowledge (galactic lore) skill for the purpose of using this talent. If you are entitled to a Knowledge (galactic lore) reroll, you can reroll your Gather Information check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations)."},"costNumeric":null,"treeId":"d20682671d035cef","tags":["action_economy","force","force_defense","force_offense","investigation","knowledge","mobility","network","precision","resources","social","social_network","target-designation"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bothan Spynet","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":1,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"spynet-agent","name":"Spynet Agent","label":"Spynet Agent","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You can use your Gather Information check modifier instead of your Knowledge (Galactic Lore) check modifier when making Knowledge (Galactic Lore) checks. You are considered Trained in the Knowledge (Galactic Lore) skill for the purpose of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a Knowledge (Galactic Lore) reroll, you can reroll your Gather Information check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).","notes":"You can use your Gather Information check modifier instead of your Knowledge (Galactic Lore) check modifier when making Knowledge (Galactic Lore) checks. You are considered Trained in the Knowledge (Galactic Lore) skill for the purpose of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a Knowledge (Galactic Lore) reroll, you can reroll your Gather Information check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"gatherInformation"},{"skill":"knowledgeGalacticLore"}],"resources":["Use Gather Information modifier for Knowledge (Galactic Lore)","Counts as trained for this talent"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}]},"summary":"You can use your Gather Information check modifier instead of your Knowledge (galactic lore) check modifier when making Knowledge (galactic lore) checks.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":50},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.spynet_agent","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.414Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit"],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bothan Spynet","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"64cfde2d0cf6c523","name":"Art of Concealment","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Some smugglers are adept at hiding contraband and weapons, even on their person. When making a Stealth check to conceal an item, you can take 10 even under pressure. Additionally, you can conceal an item as a swift action.","description":{"value":"Some smugglers are adept at hiding contraband and weapons, even on their person. When making a Stealth check to conceal an item, you can take 10 even under pressure. Additionally, you can conceal an item as a swift action."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","treeId":"9f7ca12cc084737a","tags":["action_economy","ambush","damage_reduction","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","skills","social","support","sustained_damage","unarmed"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Some smugglers are adept at hiding contraband and weapons, even on their person.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":27},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.art_of_concealment","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-ranged"]}}}
