{"_id":"66b23ee79bd33bf1","name":"Force Talisman","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You may spend a Force Point to imbue a weapon or some other portable object with The Force, creating a Talisman that provides protection to you. Creating the Talisman takes a Full-Round Action.\n\nWhile you wear or carry the Talisman on your person, you gain a +1 Force bonus to one of your Defenses (Reflex Defense, Fortitude Defense, or Will Defense).\n\nYou may only have one Force Talisman active at a given time, and if your Force Talisman is destroyed, you may not create another Force Talisman for 24 hours.","description":{"value":"You may spend a Force Point to imbue a weapon or some other portable object with The Force, creating a Talisman that provides protection to you. Creating the Talisman takes a Full-Round Action.\n\nWhile you wear or carry the Talisman on your person, you gain a +1 Force bonus to one of your Defenses (Reflex Defense, Fortitude Defense, or Will Defense).\n\nYou may only have one Force Talisman active at a given time, and if your Force Talisman is destroyed, you may not create another Force Talisman for 24 hours."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","treeId":"01e443d93e47f9c4","tags":["action_economy","alchemy","crafting","empowerment","force","force_capacity","force_defense","force_point_spend","force_training","resource_spend","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"TALENT_ACTION","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"force-talisman","name":"Force Talisman","actionType":"full-round","requiredTalent":"Force Talisman","description":"You may spend a Force Point to imbue a weapon or some other portable object with The Force, creating a Talisman that provides protection to you. Creating the Talisman takes a Full-Round Action.","resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","spendAction":true,"effects":[],"resources":["Force Point","Talisman"],"notes":"