{"_id":"66ed448a3a2e82bc","name":"Close Scrape","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you are piloting a vehicle of Colossal size or smaller, you may make a Pilot check as a reaction to turn a critical hit into a normal hit. The DC for the Pilot check is equal to the attack roll total of the critical hit. If you are successful, the damage from the attack is not doubled (though it is still considered an automatic hit).","description":{"value":"Whenever you are piloting a vehicle of Colossal size or smaller, you may make a Pilot check as a reaction to turn a critical hit into a normal hit. The DC for the Pilot check is equal to the attack roll total of the critical hit. If you are successful, the damage from the attack is not doubled (though it is still considered an automatic hit)."},"class":"9c9989c34714f920","costNumeric":null,"category":"Ace Pilot","treeId":"b17c1515c06361d6","tags":["precision"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"close-scrape","name":"Close Scrape","label":"Close Scrape","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"When your piloted Colossal-or-smaller vehicle suffers a critical hit, make a Pilot check against the attack roll total to make the hit normal instead of critical.","notes":"When your piloted Colossal-or-smaller vehicle suffers a critical hit, make a Pilot check against the attack roll total to make the hit normal instead of critical.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Pilot"}],"resources":["Once per critical trigger"]}],"phase16VehicleStarshipCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual combat action card in the action economy UI."}},"summary":"React to a critical hit while piloting Colossal-or-smaller craft; a Pilot check against the attack total converts it to a normal hit.","source":"Starships of the Galaxy","page":17},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.close_scrape","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
