{"_id":"6ae9bf79e77bd8c3","name":"Thrown Lightsaber Mastery","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Improved Lightsaber Throw, Lightsaber Throw","benefit":"Any target successfully struck by a lightsaber you throw moves at half speed (round down) until the beginning of your next turn.","description":"Any target successfully struck by a lightsaber you throw moves at half speed (round down) until the beginning of your next turn.","class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"b3c5d90b5036f39b","tags":["lightsaber","melee","mobility","ranged","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"thrown_lightsaber_hit_speed_rider","applicationScope":"post_hit_thrown_lightsaber","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true},"summary":"Any target successfully struck by a lightsaber you throw moves at half speed (round down) until the beginning of your next turn.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":43},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.thrown_lightsaber_mastery","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"6b09fe0c6fe98367","name":"Sow Confusion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Hesitate","benefit":"Once per encounter, as a standard action, you can make a Deception check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all enemies in your line of sight. If the check result equals or exceeds an enemy's Will Defense, that enemy must spend a swift action in addition to a standard action to make an attack until the start of your next turn.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, as a standard action, you can make a Deception check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all enemies in your line of sight. If the check result equals or exceeds an enemy's Will Defense, that enemy must spend a swift action in addition to a standard action to make an attack until the start of your next turn."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.1c381292494e3139","name":"Hesitate"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["action_economy","mobility","skills","social"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Once per encounter, as a standard action, you can make a Deception check and compare the result to the Will Defense of all enemies in your line of sight.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":15},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.sow_confusion","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will","turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"6c374ec52e710f11","name":"Beast Trick","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":null,"benefit":"You can use the mind trick Force power on creatures of Intelligence 2 and lower. However, a beast with an Intelligence of 2 or less still cannot perform any complex action or understand complex commands it wouldn't otherwise be able to understand; an affected beast might understand “Attack those Sith troopers!” but it would not comprehend, “Break into the command center and disable the communications array.\"","description":"You can use the mind trick Force power on creatures of Intelligence 2 and lower. However, a beast with an Intelligence of 2 or less still cannot perform any complex action or understand complex commands it wouldn't otherwise be able to understand; an affected beast might understand “Attack those Sith troopers!” but it would not comprehend, “Break into the command center and disable the communications array.\"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"d3661aa9906bdc79","tags":["beast_companion","force","recovery","resilience","resource_recovery","will_defense"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"cleaned_manual_or_future_runtime","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"You can use the mind trick Force power on creatures of Intelligence 2 and lower.","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":53},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.beast_trick","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":[],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"cleaned_manual_or_future_runtime"}}}}
{"_id":"6c52d837af948ca0","name":"Focused Targeting","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Comrades in Arms","benefit":"When you damage a target with a melee or ranged attack, all allies within 3 squares gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target until the beginning of your next turn.","description":{"value":"When you damage a target with a melee or ranged attack, all allies within 3 squares gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target until the beginning of your next turn."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.d4dcafa34cda98c2","name":"Comrades in Arms"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"eff10782c1e56598","tags":["positioning"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"When you damage a target with a melee or ranged attack, all allies within 3 squares gain a +2 bonus on damage rolls against that target until the beginning of your next turn.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":26},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.focused_targeting","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"6c62f35fddd45d66","name":"Distracting Shout","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Cunning Distraction","benefit":"Once per encounter, as a reaction to one of your allies being attacked, you can make a Deception check, replacing the defense score of that ally with the result of your Deception check for resolution of the attack. If any defense score is higher than the Deception check result, your ally can use that defense score instead. If the attack still hits, this does not count as the one use per encounter of this talent.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, as a reaction to one of your allies being attacked, you can make a Deception check, replacing the defense score of that ally with the result of your Deception check for resolution of the attack. If any defense score is higher than the Deception check result, your ally can use that defense score instead. If the attack still hits, this does not count as the one use per encounter of this talent."},"class":"8da58194b3d58041","costNumeric":null,"category":"Charlatan","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.3340f268613c0349","name":"Cunning Distraction"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"ab9b75bc19f8e983","tags":["action_economy","control","deception","reaction","skills","social","stealth","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"combat_action_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver + character sheet combat actions tab; final resolution remains manual until the relevant target/minion/action-sequence executor exists.","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent depends on target identity, ally/minion state, line of sight, positioning, encounter timing, or GM adjudication. It should not mutate permanent actor sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"distracting-shout","name":"Distracting Shout","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Deception","when":"Replace ally defenses for this attack"}],"resources":["Once per encounter"],"requiredContext":["Ally being attacked"],"notes":"Once per encounter, when an ally is attacked, make a Deception check. The ally may use that result in place of any lower Defense Scores for that attack.","description":"Once per encounter, when an ally is attacked, make a Deception check. The ally may use that result in place of any lower Defense Scores for that attack.","targetHint":"One ally"}]},"summary":"Once per encounter, as a reaction to one of your allies being attacked, you can make a Deception check, replacing the defense score of that ally with the result of your Deception check for resolution of the attack.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":31},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.distracting_shout","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.415Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"6cb7efd0785d4114","name":"Bando Gora Surge","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Bando Gora Captain","talentTree":"Bando Gora Captain","tree":"Bando Gora Captain","treeId":"b7fb2b10740923f6","prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"Whenever you move up the Condition Track by any means, you gain Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + your Heroic Level. Bonus Hit Points are consumed before regular Hit Points, and unused Bonus Hit Points go away at the end of the encounter. Bonus Hit Points from multiple sources do not stack."},"benefit":"Whenever you move up the Condition Track by any means, you gain Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + your Heroic Level. Bonus Hit Points are consumed before regular Hit Points, and unused Bonus Hit Points go away at the end of the encounter. Bonus Hit Points from multiple sources do not stack.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","tags":["force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"bando-gora-surge","name":"Bando Gora Surge","label":"Bando Gora Surge","actionType":"free","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Whenever you move up the Condition Track by any means, you gain Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + your Heroic Level. Bonus Hit Points are consumed before regular Hit Points, and unused Bonus Hit Points go away at the end of the encounter. Bonus Hit Points from multiple sources do not stack.","notes":"Whenever you move up the Condition Track by any means, you gain Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + your Heroic Level. Bonus Hit Points are consumed before regular Hit Points, and unused Bonus Hit Points go away at the end of the encounter. Bonus Hit Points from multiple sources do not stack.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Trigger: move up Condition Track","Gain bonus HP 5 + heroic level"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"com