{"_id":"729a17e25b873f4f","name":"Stick Together","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Comrades in Arms","benefit":"You can spend a Move Action to activate this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, if an ally Moves you can immediately move up to your speed, provided you end your movement within 3 squares of that ally.","description":{"value":"You can spend a Move Action to activate this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, if an ally Moves you can immediately move up to your speed, provided you end your movement within 3 squares of that ally."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.d4dcafa34cda98c2","name":"Comrades in Arms"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"eff10782c1e56598","tags":["mobility","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"You can spend a Move Action to activate this Talent. Until the beginning of your next turn, if an ally Moves you can immediately move up to your speed, provided you end your movement within 3 squares of that ally.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":26},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.stick_together","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.416Z","detectedPredicates":["proximity.ally-nearby"]}}}
{"_id":"72c644f7a09b1186","name":"Deflect","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a reaction, you may negate a ranged attack by making a successful Use the Force check. The DC equals the result of the attack roll you wish to negate, and you take a cumulative -5 penalty on your Use the Force check for every time you have used Block or Deflect since the beginning of your last turn. You must have a lightsaber drawn and ignited, be aware of the attack, and not be flat-footed. Against an autofire attack, a successful check makes you take half damage if the attack hits and no damage if it misses. Deflect has no effect on other area attacks such as grenades, missiles, and flamethrowers, and cannot negate attacks from Colossal (frigate) or larger vehicles unless made with a point-defense weapon.","description":{"value":"As a reaction, you may negate a ranged attack by making a successful Use the Force check. The DC equals the result of the attack roll you wish to negate, and you take a cumulative -5 penalty on your Use the Force check for every time you have used Block or Deflect since the beginning of your last turn. You must have a lightsaber drawn and ignited, be aware of the attack, and not be flat-footed. Against an autofire attack, a successful check makes you take half damage if the attack hits and no damage if it misses. Deflect has no effect on other area attacks such as grenades, missiles, and flamethrowers, and cannot negate attacks from Colossal (frigate) or larger vehicles unless made with a point-defense weapon."},"class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"2359c05ff13f3feb","tags":["lightsaber","melee","ranged","force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Deflect"}],"mechanicsMode":"active_reaction","applicationScope":"block_deflect_runtime","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":false},"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Combat","talentTree":"Lightsaber Combat","tree":"Lightsaber Combat","summary":"React with Use the Force to negate a ranged attack; it has special limits for autofire, area attacks, and very large vehicle weapons.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":41},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.deflect","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.416Z","detectedPredicates":[],"lightsaberTalentImplementation":{"status":"runtime_action_or_contextual","updated":"2026-06-11"}}}}
{"_id":"72ccf7bbe3048453","name":"Deny Move","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Reduce Mobility","benefit":"When you score a critical hit with a melee or ranged attack, your target cannot move on its next turn.","description":{"value":"When you score a critical hit with a melee or ranged attack, your target cannot move on its next turn."},"class":"c4dbedcf989cb6b2","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.c80edefd9c32ad02","name":"Reduce Mobility"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"71e99c646b18d85c","tags":["mobility","precision"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"critical_hit_rider","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":false,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until exact target/ally/battlefield context exists","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive automation. Conditional target, ally, positioning, or scene-state effects should be applied at the table or through a future runtime prompt.","rules":[{"type":"CRITICAL_RIDER","id":"deny-move-critical","label":"Deny Move","targetEffectsOnCritical":[{"type":"condition","condition":"cannotMove","duration":"nextTurn"}]}],"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Critical Master","status":"reviewed","notes":"Reviewed in tactical ranged/military cleanup."}},"summary":"When you score a critical hit with a melee or ranged attack, your target cannot move on its next turn.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":42},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.deny_move","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.416Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit"]}}}
{"_id":"72cfc8816ea3ebf5","name":"Know Your Enemy","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You are well versed in the strengths and weaknesses of enemies of your cause. As a swift action, you can select a single enemy within line of sight and make a Knowledge (galactic lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, you immediately learn any two (your choice) of the following pieces of information: target's base attack bonus or attack bonus with a particular weapon, any one defense Score, any one skill modifier, or the presence of any one talent or feat (you choose the talent or feat, and the Gamemaster reveals whether or not it is present).","description":{"value":"You are well versed in the strengths and weaknesses of enemies of your cause. As a swift action, you can select a single enemy within line of sight and make a Knowledge (galactic lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, you immediately learn any two (your choice) of the following pieces of information: target's base attack bonus or attack bonus with a particular weapon, any one defense Score, any one skill modifier, or the presence of any one talent or feat (you choose the talent or feat, and the Gamemaster reveals whether or not it is present)."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","treeId":"d65a4816379802ee","tags":["action_economy","battlefield_control","positioning","skills","social"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"social_commander_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed target context","notes":"The benefit depends on a target/opponent/reaction/encounter condition; per user direction, punt +X/penalties against conditional targets to GM/player unless an exact runtime owner exists.","combatActions":[{"id":"know-your-enemy","name":"Know Your Enemy","label":"Know Your Enemy","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":false,"resolutionMode":"auto","useLabel":"Roll / Use","description":{"resources":["DC 15 + target CL"],"targetHint":"One enemy within line of sight","when":"Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"},"notes":{"resources":["DC 15 + target CL"],"targetHint":"One enemy within line of sight","when":"Knowledge (Galactic Lore)"},"relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Select one enemy within line of sight and make Knowledge (Galactic Lore) against DC 15 + target CL. On success, learn two listed pieces of information from the talent.","when":""}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{},"skillKey":"Select one enemy within line of sight and make Knowledge (Galactic Lore) against DC 15 + target CL. On success, learn two listed pieces of information from the talent."}],"manualResolution":false,"phase23SocialCommanderCleanup":{"phase":"T23","tree":"Ideologue","status":"combat_action_card","cardsAdded":1,"notes":"Social/commander activation surfaced through abilityMeta combat action cards. Skill-backed cards use the existing sheet skill preroller where safe; final buffs/debuffs remain GM/player/runtime-applied."}},"summary":"You are well versed in the strengths and weaknesses of enemies of your cause.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.know_your_enemy","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.416Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will","turn.once-per-round"],"nobleOfficerCorporateCleanup":{"phase":"T10","status":"gm_player_managed","owner":"GM/player managed target context","note":"The benefit depends on a target/opponent/reaction/encounter condition; per user direction, punt +X/penalties against conditional targets to GM/player unless an exact runtime owner exists."}}}}
{"_id":"7355c8afe9509dad","name":"Close Maneuvering","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per turn, you can use a Swift Action to designate a target. Until the start of your next turn, your movement does not provoke Attacks of Opportunity from that target, provided that you end your movement adjacent to that target.","description":{"value":"Once per turn, you can use a Swift Action to designate a target. Until the start of your next turn, your movement does not provoke Attacks of Opportunity from that target, provided that you end your movement adjacent to that target."},"class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"10c843cef8ce2798","tags":["force","force_control","force_offense","light_side","mobility","positioning"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"ACTION","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":2,"type":"untyped","predicates":["movement.while-moving"],"enabled":true,"priority":500,"description":"Close Maneuvering"}]},"talent_tree":"Jedi Guardian","talentTree":"Jedi Guardian","tree":"Jedi Guardian","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","summary":"Once per turn, you can use a Swift Action to designate a target.","page":23},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.close_maneuvering","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.416Z","detectedPredicates":["movement.while-moving"],"sourcePatch":"jedi-guardian-runtime-pass"}}}
{"_id":"744c2eaaa48e15af","name":"Malkite Techniques","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per encounter, you can apply a toxin to any nonenergy slashing or piercing weapon as a standard action. If an attack roll with that weapon also exceeds the target's Fortitude Defense, that target is poisoned. Each round on the creature's turn, the poison makes an attack roll (1d20 + your heroic level) against the target's Fortitude Defense. If the attack succeeds, the target takes damage equal to 1d6 + one-half your heroic level and moves -1 step along the condition track. A target moved to the end of the condition track by the poison is unconscious but continues to take damage as long as the poison continues to attack. The poison attacks each round until it misses or until the victim is cured with a Treat Injury check (DC 10 + your heroic level).","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, you can apply a toxin to any nonenergy slashing or piercing weapon as a standard action. If an attack roll with that weapon also exceeds the target's Fortitude Defense, that target is poisoned. Each round on the creature's turn, the poison makes an attack roll (1d20 + your heroic level) against the target's Fortitude Defense. If the attack succeeds, the target takes damage equal to 1d6 + one-half your heroic level and moves -1 step along the condition track. A target moved to the end of the condition track by the poison is unconscious but continues to take damage as long as the poison continues to attack. The poison attacks each round until it misses or until the victim is cured with a Treat Injury check (DC 10 + your heroic level)."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","treeId":"c55b003333ff082d","tags":["support","poison","medical","science"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"malkite-techniques","name":"Malkite Techniques","label":"Malkite Techniques","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, you can apply a toxin to any non-Energy Slashing or Piercing weapon as a Standard Action. If an attack roll with that weapon also exceeds the target's Fortitude Defense, that target is Poisoned.","notes":"Once per encounter, apply a toxin to a non-energy slashing or piercing weapon. If a later attack with that weapon also exceeds the target Fortitude Defense, the target is poisoned.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Knowledge (Life Sciences)"},{"skill":"Attack Roll"}],"resources":["Once per encounter","Toxin application","Non-energy slashing or piercing weapon"],"requiredContext":["Toxin available","Eligible weapon"],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action_reference","applicationScope":"runtime_skill_crafting_medical_computer_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase29TechMedicalMicrotreeCleanup":{"phase":"T29","tree":"Malkite Poisoner","status":"reviewed_manual_or_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Tech/medical/science microtree pass removed unsafe passive rows and surfaces crafting, cloning, poison, computer, droid-command, and treatment effects as truthful action/reference cards."}},"summary":"Once per encounter, coat a nonenergy slashing or piercing weapon with a toxin that repeatedly attacks Fortitude, deals damage, and moves the victim down the condition track.","source":"Threats of the Galaxy","page":13},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.malkite_techniques","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.416Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","defense.fortitude"]}}}
{"_id":"74fb6b37af983a4c","name":"Hunter's Mark","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"If you aim before making a ranged attack (see Aim, page 154), you move the target -1 step along the condition track if the attack hits (see Conditions, page 148).","description":{"value":"If you aim before making a ranged attack (see Aim, page 154), you move the target -1 step along the condition track if the attack hits (see Conditions, page 148)."},"class":"336bba6d1e517c92","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["action_economy","condition_removal","dual_wield","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","skills","social","stealth","support","pursuit","target-designation","fear"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"hunter-s-mark","name":"Hunter's Mark","label":"Hunter's Mark","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"If you Aim before making a ranged attack, you move the target character -1 step along the Condition Track if the attack deals damage. This Talent can be used only against characters,