{"_id":"776a0fa8ae532ccc","name":"Affliction","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":null,"benefit":"Your Force power carries the taint of the dark side more so than even other dark side users. When you damage a single opponent with one of your Force powers, that target also takes 2d6 points of Force damage at the beginning of its next turn, before taking any actions.","description":{"value":"Your Force power carries the taint of the dark side more so than even other dark side users. When you damage a single opponent with one of your Force powers, that target also takes 2d6 points of Force damage at the beginning of its next turn, before taking any actions."},"class":"1ba03b2d00245906","costNumeric":null,"category":"Sith Apprentice","treeId":"d1037bc7a08ea80b","tags":["action_economy","dark_side","force","force_offense","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"runtime_delayed_damage","applicationScope":"single_target_force_power_damage","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":false,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"contributesGenericBonus":false,"modifiers":[],"notes":"After damaging one opponent with a Force Power, mark it to take 2d6 Force damage at the beginning of its next turn.","combatActions":[{"id":"affliction","name":"Affliction","label":"Affliction","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":false,"resolutionMode":"sithTalent","useLabel":"Use","description":"Your Force Powers carries the taint of The Dark Side more so than even other Dark Side users. When you damage a single opponent with one of your Force Powers, that target also takes 2d6 points of Force damage at the beginning of its next turn, before taking any Actions.","notes":"After damaging one opponent with a Force Power, mark it to take 2d6 Force damage at the beginning of its next turn.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Force Power damage","Delayed Force damage"],"requiredContext":[],"spendAction":fals