{"_id":"77d09ca0a54f4c36","name":"Power Surge","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"You temporarily surge your power systems to enhance your physical abilities. When you initiate a power surge (a swift action), you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on melee attack rolls, +1 die of damage on melee damage rolls, and an increase of 2 squares to your speed. A power surge lasts for a number of rounds equal to one-half your level (rounded down). At the end of a power surge, you move -1 persistent step along the condition track. The penalties imposed by this condition persist until you receive repairs (using the repair droid application of the Mechanics skill)."},"benefit":"You temporarily surge your power systems to enhance your physical abilities. When you initiate a power surge (a swift action), you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on melee attack rolls, +1 die of damage on melee damage rolls, and an increase of 2 squares to your speed. A power surge lasts for a number of rounds equal to one-half your level (rounded down). At the end of a power surge, you move -1 persistent step along the condition track. The penalties imposed by this condition persist until you receive repairs (using the repair droid application of the Mechanics skill).","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"cec49bc60d1646b1","tags":["action_economy","condition_removal","droid","mechanics","melee","mobility","offense_melee","positioning","power_systems","skills","sustained_damage","swift_action","tech","vehicle"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"power-surge-activate","name":"Power Surge","label":"Power Surge","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Activate Power Surge for half your Heroic Level in rounds: +1 melee attack, +1 weapon die on melee damage, and +2 squares speed. When it ends, move -1 persistent step on the Condition Track until repaired.","notes":"After activation, toggle the Power Surge attack option for melee attacks while the surge is active. Track duration, speed, and the ending persistent condition manually.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll"},{"skill":"Damage Roll"}],"resources":["Swift Action","Duration: half Heroic Level rounds","Persistent CT penalty after ending"]}],"rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"power-surge-melee","label":"Power Surge","control":"flag","requiresAttackType":"melee","attackModifier":1,"damageExtraWeaponDice":1,"summary":"Toggle while Power Surge is active to apply +1 melee attack and +1 weapon die of melee damage."}],"phase19DroidCleanup":{"status":"contextual_attack_option_and_action_card","owner":"CombatOptionResolver + AbilityCombatActionResolver","tree":"Specialized Droid","notes":"Swift activation card plus opt-in melee attack/damage option while the surge is active; duration/speed/ending CT penalty remain manually tracked.","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0}},"summary":"You temporarily surge your power systems to enhance your physical abilities.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":48},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.417Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-melee","movement.while-moving"]}}}
{"_id":"782768cab6bd13de","name":"Dread","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Hunter's Mark, Hunter's Target","benefit":"As a standard action, you can instill bone-chilling fear in an opponent whom you selected for Hunter's Target. Make a Persuasion check against your opponent's Will Defense. If you equal or exceed your opponent's Will Defense, that opponent takes a -5 penalty to Will Defense. This is a mind-affecting effect. The penalty remains as long as you have line of sight to your opponent and immediately ends if the line of sight is broken.","description":{"value":"As a standard action, you can instill bone-chilling fear in an opponent whom you selected for Hunter's Target. Make a Persuasion check against your opponent's Will Defense. If you equal or exceed your opponent's Will Defense, that opponent takes a -5 penalty to Will Defense. This is a mind-affecting effect. The penalty remains as long as you have line of sight to your opponent and immediately ends if the line of sight is broken."},"class":"336bba6d1e517c92","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.907906934ba3c563","name":"Hunter's Target"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["skills","social","pursuit","target-designation","fear"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"dread","name":"Dread","label":"Dread","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"As a Standard Action, you can instill bone-chilling fear in an opponent whom you selected for your Hunter's Target. Make a Persuasion check against your target's Will Defense. If you equal or exceed your target's Will Defense, that target takes a -5 penalty to its Will Defense.","notes":"As a Standard Action, you can instill bone-chilling fear in an opponent whom you selected for your Hunter's Target. Make a Persuasion check against your target's Will Defense. If you equal or exceed your target's Will Defense, that target takes a -5 penalty to its Will Defense.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"persuasion","when":"Against Hunter's Target Will Defense"}],"resources":["Hunter's Target","Mind-affecting fear","Target Will -5 on success"],"requiredContext":["Target is your Hunter's Target"],"targetHint":"Hunter's Target","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}]},"summary":"As a standard action, you can instill bone-chilling fear in an opponent whom you selected for Hunter's Target.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":26},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.dread","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.417Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will"],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
