{"_id":"797de6f9dab4d578","name":"Persistent Haze","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Clear Mind, Force Haze","benefit":"Whenever anyone concealed by your use of the Force Haze talent attacks, you maintain total concealment without having to make another Use the Force check. Only those who do not attack remain concealed; the attacker no longer has total concealment, even when using this talent.","description":"Whenever anyone concealed by your use of the Force Haze talent attacks, you maintain total concealment without having to make another Use the Force check. Only those who do not attack remain concealed; the attacker no longer has total concealment, even when using this talent.","class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.f098749cb8767a5f","name":"Force Haze"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"36f18f3e974feb33","tags":["force","force_offense","light_side"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"persistent-haze","name":"Persistent Haze","label":"Persistent Haze","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"Whenever anyone concealed by your use of the Force Haze Talent attacks, you maintain Total Concealment without having to make another Use the Force check. Only those who do not attack remain concealed; the attacker no longer has Total Concealment, even when using his Talent.","notes":"Whenever anyone concealed by your use of the Force Haze Talent attacks, you maintain Total Concealment without having to make another Use the Force check. Only those who do not attack remain concealed; the attacker no longer has Total Concealment, even when using his Talent.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":["Use the Force check"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"mechanicsMode":"contextual","applicationScope":"force_lightsaber_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Jedi Sentinel","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."}},"talent_tree":"Jedi Sentinel","slug":"persistent-haze","summary":"Whenever anyone concealed by your use of the Force Haze talent attacks, you maintain total concealment without having to make another Use the Force check.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":13},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.persistent_haze","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.417Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"79eee1486dc34af5","name":"Stinging Jab","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"When you hit a target with an unarmed attack, you can choose to deal half damage with your attack. If you do so, your enemy also deals half damage on all melee attacks he or she makes until the end of your next turn."},"benefit":"When you hit a target with an unarmed attack, you can choose to deal half damage with your attack. If you do so, your enemy also deals half damage on all melee attacks he or she makes until the end of your next turn.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"abc3466390fe4050","tags":["counterattack","martial_arts","offense_melee","reaction","unarmed","natural_weapon","rider"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"stingingJab","label":"Stinging Jab","control":"toggle","requiresUnarmed":true,"targetEffectsOnHit":[{"type":"HALVE_TARGET_MELEE_DAMAGE","duration":"untilEndOfYourNextTurn","note":"You deal half damage with this unarmed-family attack; target deals half damage on melee attacks until the end of your next turn."}],"summary":"On an unarmed/natural weapon hit, choose to deal half damage; target deals half melee damage until the end of your next turn."}],"mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_reaction_context","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase21BrawlerShockboxerCleanup":{"status":"runtime_attack_option","owner":"CombatOptionResolver / ReactionEngine / GrapplingSystem","notes":"Removed unsafe +2 attack modifier. The half-damage rider is now an opt-in unarmed-family attack option exported on hit.","naturalWeaponPolicy":"Treat species natural weapons as unarmed-family attacks when the source text affects unarmed attacks."}},"summary":"Halve your unarmed hit's damage to make the target deal half melee damage until the end of your next turn.","source":"Galaxy at War","page":21},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.417Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit"]}}}
{"_id":"7a024dac260bf9ec","name":"Dumb Luck","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Knack, Lucky Shot","benefit":"You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a standard action. Elude Enemy: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within range; if you damage the target, you gain a +2 bonus to your Reflex Defense against that target until the beginning of your next turn. Escape: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within range; if the target successfully damages you before the start of your next turn, you can immediately move 2 squares as a reaction without provoking attacks of opportunity. Make your Own Luck: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within range; if you miss this target, you gain a +2 bonus on your next attack roll.","description":{"value":"You can use each of the following actions once per encounter as a standard action. Elude Enemy: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within range; if you damage the target, you gain a +2 bonus to your Reflex Defense against that target until the beginning of your next turn. Escape: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within range; if the target successfully damages you before the start of your next turn, you can immediately move 2 squares as a reaction without provoking attacks of opportunity. Make your Own Luck: Make a single melee or ranged attack against any target within range; if you miss this target, you gain a +2 bonus on your next attack roll."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.5fbf1a3504865fba","name":"Lucky Shot"},{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.ac6baadb9d65ff7f","name":"Knack"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"cee9b9398682b7d0","tags":["mobility","positioning"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Once each per encounter, use Dumb Luck to gain Reflex against a damaged target, escape after being damaged, or gain +2 on your next attack after a miss.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":14},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.dumb_luck","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.417Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"7a049ee1ecc3891b","name":"Attract Privateer","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You attract a loyal privateer lieutenant. The privateer is a nonheroic character who has a class level equal to three-quarters of your character level, rounded down. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you gain another privateer. Each privateer who accompanies you on an adventure is entitled to an equal share of the total experience points earned for the adventure. For example, a privateer who accompanies a party of five heroes on an adventure receives one-sixth of the XP that the group earns.","description":{"value":"You attract a loyal privateer lieutenant. The privateer is a nonheroic character who has a class level equal to three-quarters of your character level, rounded down. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you gain another privateer. Each privateer who accompanies you on an adventure is entitled to an equal share of the total experience points earned for the adventure. For example, a privateer who accompanies a party of five heroes on an adventure receives one-sixth of the XP that the group earns."},"class":"fcf8cc428a6eb01a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Master Privateer","treeId":"df6678946610c554","tags":["followers","minion","support","resources","scaling"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"progression_or_dependent_actor","applicationScope":"follower_minion_subsystem","staticSheetPolicy":"not_a_modifier","requiresRuntimeContext":false,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"FOLLOWER_TALENT_CONFIG + follower-hooks + MinionCreator/MinionManager + minion action rule cards","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. Crime Lord/Master Privateer minion subsystem owns dependent actor slots, minion talent flags, and manual tactical rule cards. No passive actor modifier is valid here."},"summary":"You attract a loyal privateer lieutenant.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":52},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.attract_privateer","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.417Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"7a2cab18b77945538426f19d662f14f9","name":"Defensive Electronics","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"benefit":"You defend your independence from all. When someone tries to reprogram you, add your class level to your Will Defense.","description":{"value":"You defend your independence from all. When someone tries to reprogram you, add your class level to your Will Defense."},"prerequisites":"","class":"3b1ed5f1038d49fb","category":"Independent Droid","treeId":"9fe73a3703fa45fca628fd43cae6bf7f","tags":["droid","durability","self_repair","tech"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase19DroidCleanup":{"status":"cleaned_future_runtime_context","owner":"future_reprogramming_defense_context_resolver","tree":"Independent Droid","notes":"Unsafe migrated modifiers removed; talent requires a dedicated future runtime context before automation.","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0},"combatActions":[{"id":"defensive-electronics-t31-reference","name":"Defensive Electronics","label":"Defensive Electronics","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You defend your independence from all. When someone tries to Reprogram you, add your Independent Droid Class Level to your Will Defense.","notes":"You defend your independence from all. When someone tries to Reprogram you, add your Independent Droid Class Level to your Will Defense.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":[],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[{"type":"RUNTIME_CONTEXT_REFERENCE","id":"defensive-electronics-t31-context","label":"Defensive Electronics","summary":"You defend your independence from all. When someone tries to Reprogram you, add your Independent Droid Class Level to your Will Defense."}],"phase31FinalRemainingCleanup":{"phase":"T31","tree":"Autonomy","status":"reviewed_manual_runtime_or_existing_en