{"_id":"7d02251f13fd5645","name":"Share Force Technique","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Must know at least 1 Force Technique","benefit":"When you take this talent, choose one Force technique that you know. Once per turn asa swift action, you can grant the use of this Force technique to one ally within 12 squares of you who is trained in the Use the Force skill. The target gains the benefit of this technique until the end of your next turn. You cannot choose the Force Point Recovery technique for this talent.","description":{"value":"When you take this talent, choose one Force technique that you know. Once per turn asa swift action, you can grant the use of this Force technique to one ally within 12 squares of you who is trained in the Use the Force skill. The target gains the benefit of this technique until the end of your next turn. You cannot choose the Force Point Recovery technique for this talent."},"class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"303d91124d4548c0","tags":["force","light_side","positioning","support"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Share Force Technique"}],"status":"talent_backcheck_user_text_2026_06_11","description":"Choose a known Force Technique except Force Point Recovery; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","mechanicsMode":"action_or_contextual","applicationScope":"choice_grant_force_technique","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":true,"conditionSummary":"Choose a known Force Technique except Force Point Recovery; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","metadataPhase":"jedi-prestige-talent-backcheck","metadataNotes":"Updated from user-provided source text; non-automatable targeting/LOS/session adjudication remains GM/player confirmed.","rules":[{"type":"TALENT_RULE","id":"share_force_technique","label":"Share Force Technique","summary":"Choose a known Force Technique except Force Point Recovery; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","action":"swift-action","mode":"choice_grant_force_technique","text":"When you take this Talent, choose one Force Technique that you know. Once per turn as a Swift Action, you can grant the use of this Force Technique to one ally within 12 squares of you who is Trained in the Use the Force Skill.\n\nThe target gains the benefit of this Force Technique until the end of your next turn. You cannot choose the Force Point Recovery Technique for this Talent."}]},"effect":"When you take this Talent, choose one Force Technique that you know. Once per turn as a Swift Action, you can grant the use of this Force Technique to one ally within 12 squares of you who is Trained in the Use the Force Skill.\n\nThe target gains the benefit of this Force Technique until the end of your next turn. You cannot choose the Force Point Recovery Technique for this Talent.","shortSummary":"Choose a known Force Technique except Force Point Recovery; once per turn, grant it to a trained ally within 12 squares until end of next turn.","prerequisite":"At least 1 Force Technique","prerequisitesText":"At least 1 Force Technique","grantsActions":["swift-action"],"summary":"When you take this talent, choose one Force technique that you know.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":20},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.share_force_technique","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.419Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentBackcheck":{"source":"user-pasted-rules","date":"2026-06-11","updatedFields":["system.description","system.benefit","system.effect","system.shortSummary","system.prerequisite","system.abilityMeta"]}}}}
{"_id":"7d0259a008e5d68f","name":"Force Exertion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Force Training feat","benefit":"When you select this talent, choose one Force power that you have in your Force power suite. As a reaction, you can remove any one Force power from your active suite to add an extra use of the Force power designated by this talent. Doing so moves you -1 persistent step along the condition track. This persistent condition is removed by resting for 1 minute. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you choose a different Force power to be gained by using this talent.","description":"When you select this talent, choose one Force power that you have in your Force power suite. As a reaction, you can remove any one Force power from your active suite to add an extra use of the Force power designated by this talent. Doing so moves you -1 persistent step along the condition track. This persistent condition is removed by resting for 1 minute. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you choose a different Force power to be gained by using this talent.","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"d3661aa9906bdc79","tags":["condition_removal","force","force_capacity","force_control","force_power_synergy","mobility","recovery","resilience","resource_recovery","will_defense"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"force-exertion","name":"Force Exertion","label":"Force Exertion","actionType":"free","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Designate one Force power; remove another power to refresh the designated power; you move -1 step down the condition track for 1 minute.","notes":"Designate one Force power; remove another power to refresh the designated power; you move -1 step down the condition track for 1 minute.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":["Refresh designated Force power","Move -1 CT for 1 minute"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"When you select this talent, choose one Force power that you have in your Force power suite.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":88},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.force_exertion","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.419Z","detectedPredicates":["movement.while-moving"],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"7d30702a5a2640a4","name":"Close Contact","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"The point-blank range of any rifle or carbine you use is increased by 5 squares. Short range for the weapon begins 5 squares later, but still ends at the same distance.\n\nYou can take this talent up to two times; each time you take this talent, you increase the point-blank range of any rifle or carbine you use by an additional 5 squares, up to a maximum of 10 squares.","description":{"value":"The point-blank range of any rifle or carbine you use is increased by 5 squares. Short range for the weapon begins 5 squares later, but still ends at the same distance.\n\nYou can take this talent up to two times; each time you take this talent, you increase the point-blank range of any rifle or carbine you use by an additional 5 squares, up to a maximum of 10 squares."},"class":"162d866ba36fce69","costNumeric":null,"category":"Gunslinger","treeId":"1933731cc59f8463","tags":["positioning","ranged"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"passive_reference","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_reaction_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until exact target/ally/battlefield context exists","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive automation. Conditional target, ally, positioning, or scene-state effects should be applied at the table or through a future runtime prompt.","combatActions":[{"id":"close-contact","name":"Close Contact","label":"Close Contact","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Increase point-blank range of rifles/carbines by 5 squares per selection, up to +10 squares.","notes":"Increase point-blank range of rifles/carbines by 5 squares per selection, up to +10 squares.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Rifle or carbine range bands"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Carbineer","status":"reviewed","notes":"Reviewed in tactical ranged/military cleanup."}},"summary":"The point-blank range of any rifle or carbine you use is increased by 5 squares.","source":"Legacy Era Campaign Guide","page":41},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.close_contact","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.419Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"7d4f036dbaabdd02","name":"Defense Boost","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Believer Disciple","talentTree":"Believer Disciple","tree":"Believer Disciple","treeId":"92c32621101a11f9","prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"As a Swift Action, you can make a DC 15 Use the Force check. If the check succeeds, you gain a +1 Force bonus to your Fortitude Defense until the end of the encounter. Before you make your Use the Force check, you can increase the target number to DC 20 to gain a +1 Force bonus to all your Defenses."},"benefit":"As a Swift Action, you can make a DC 15 Use the Force check. If the check succeeds, you gain a +1 Force bonus to your Fortitude Defense until the end of the encounter. Before you make your Use the Force check, you can increase the target number to DC 20 to gain a +1 Force bonus to all your Defenses.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","tags":["force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"defense-boost","name":"Defense Boost","label":"Defense Boost","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"As a Swift Action, you can make a DC 15 Use the Force check. If the check succeeds, you gain a +1 Force bonus to your Fortitude Defense until the end of the encounter. Before you make your Use the Force check, you can increase the target number to DC 20 to gain a +1 Force bonus to all your Defenses.","notes":"As a Swift Action, you can make a DC 15 Use the Force check. If the check succeeds, you gain a +1 Force bonus to your Fortitude Defense until the end of the encounter. Before you make your Use the Force check, you can increase the target number to DC 20 to gain a +1 Force bonus to all your Defenses.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_