{"_id":"7e0b34a95b5f465d","name":"Begin Attack Run","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Charisma 13","benefit":"As a swift action, you designate a single target. When using the attack run action against that target, vehicles in your squadron gain a +5 bonus on their attack rolls (instead of the normal +2). You may have only one target designated at a time.","description":{"value":"As a swift action, you designate a single target. When using the attack run action against that target, vehicles in your squadron gain a +5 bonus on their attack rolls (instead of the normal +2). You may have only one target designated at a time."},"class":"9c9989c34714f920","costNumeric":null,"category":"Ace Pilot","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"cha","min":13}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"dc1b8c5ce2a70394","tags":["action_economy","force","force_offense","light_side"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"begin-attack-run","name":"Begin Attack Run","label":"Begin Attack Run","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Designate a single target; squadron vehicles using Attack Run against that target gain +5 attack instead of the normal +2. Only one target may be designated at a time.","notes":"Designate a single target; squadron vehicles using Attack Run against that target gain +5 attack instead of the normal +2. Only one target may be designated at a time.","resources":["Designated target","Squadron"]}],"phase16VehicleStarshipCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual combat action card in the action economy UI."}},"summary":"Swiftly designate one target; squadron attack runs against it gain +5 instead of +2.","source":"Starships of the Galaxy","page":17},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,