{"_id":"871638a983029bc4","name":"Demand Surrender","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Presence","benefit":"Once per encounter, you can make a Persuasion check as a standard action to demand surrender from an opponent reduced to one-half or less of its hit points. If your check equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, it surrenders, drops held weapons, and takes no hostile actions. A higher-level target gains +5 Will Defense. If you or an ally attacks it, it can act normally again. You can use this talent against a particular target only once per encounter. This is a mind-affecting effect.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter, you can make a Persuasion check as a standard action to demand surrender from an opponent reduced to one-half or less of its hit points. If your check equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, it surrenders, drops held weapons, and takes no hostile actions. A higher-level target gains +5 Will Defense. If you or an ally attacks it, it can act normally again. You can use this talent against a particular target only once per encounter. This is a mind-affecting effect."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.ec8f2ba706cc2c05","name":"Presence"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"8375b9b26b679901","tags":["action_economy","condition_removal","force","force_control","force_offense","light_side","mobility","positioning","support","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"demand-surrender","name":"Demand Surrender","label":"Demand Surrender","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, you can make a Persuasion check as a Standard Action to demand surrender from an opponent who has been reduced to one-half or less of its hit points. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, it surrenders to you and your allies, drops any weapons it is holding, and takes no hostile actions. If the target is higher level than you, it gains a +5 bonus to its Will Defense. If you or any of your allies attack it, it no longer submits to your will and can act normally. You can only use this Talent against a particular target once per encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.","notes":"Once per encounter, you can make a Persuasion check as a Standard Action to demand surrender from an opponent who has been reduced to one-half or less of its hit points. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, it surrenders to you and your allies, drops any weapons it is holding, and takes no hostile actions. If the target is higher level than you, it gains a +5 bonus to its Will Defense. If you or any of your allies attack it, it no longer submits to your will and can act normally. You can only use this Talent against a particular target once per encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Persuasion"}],"resources":["Once per encounter","Persuasion check"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"mechanicsMode":"contextual","applicationScope":"force_lightsaber_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Jedi Consular","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."}},"summary":"Once per encounter, use Persuasion against a wounded target's Will Defense to force its surrender.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":43},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.demand_surrender","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.420Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit","proximity.ally-nearby","turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"874ffa6b66cf2c37","name":"Reduce Defense","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you score a critical hit with a melee or ranged attack, your target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense until it is fully healed (at maximum hit points).","description":{"value":"When you score a critical hit with a melee or ranged attack, your target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense until it is fully healed (at maximum hit points)."},"class":"c4dbedcf989cb6b2","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","treeId":"71e99c646b18d85c","tags":["medicine","precision","skills","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"critical_hit_rider","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":false,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until exact target/ally/battlefield context exists","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive automation. Conditional target, ally, positioning, or scene-state effects should be applied at the table or through a future runtime prompt.","rules":[{"type":"CRITICAL_RIDER","id":"reduce-defense-critical","label":"Reduce Defense","targetEffectsOnCritical":[{"type":"defensePenalty","target":"defense.reflex","value":-2,"duration":"untilFullyHealed"}]}],"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Critical Master","status":"reviewed","notes":"Reviewed in tactical ranged/military cleanup."}},"summary":"When you score a critical hit with a melee or ranged attack, your target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense until it is fully healed (at maximum hit points).","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":42},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.reduce_defense","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.420Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","