{"_id":"878d89b7232413cf","name":"Set for Stun","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You are particularly adept with stun weapons. If you are using a ranged weapon that deals stun damage (including a lethal weapon set to stun), you can spend two consecutive swift actions in the same round to activate this talent. If the stun damage on your next attack exceeds the target's damage threshold, you move the target -3 steps along the condition track instead of the normal -2. You lose the benefit of this talent if you lose line of sight to your target or if you take any other action before making your attack.","description":{"value":"You are particularly adept with stun weapons. If you are using a ranged weapon that deals stun damage (including a lethal weapon set to stun), you can spend two consecutive swift actions in the same round to activate this talent. If the stun damage on your next attack exceeds the target's damage threshold, you move the target -3 steps along the condition track instead of the normal -2. You lose the benefit of this talent if you lose line of sight to your target or if you take any other action before making your attack."},"class":"e647ee8f065e1d19","costNumeric":null,"category":"Infiltrator","treeId":"7c7a8730e1b4381a","tags":["condition_removal","mobility","stealth","infiltration","pursuit","stun"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Infiltration","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":1,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"set-for-stun","name":"Set for Stun","label":"Set for Stun","actionType":"swift","cost":2,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"You are particularly adept with Stun weapons. If you are using a ranged weapon that deals Stun damage (including a lethal weapon set to Stun), you can spend two consecutive Swift Actions in the same round to activate this Talent. If the Stun damage on your next attack exceeds the target's Damage Threshold, you move the target -3 steps along the Condition Track, instead of the normal -2 steps.","notes":"You are particularly adept with Stun weapons. If you are using a ranged weapon that deals Stun damage (including a lethal weapon set to Stun), you can spend two consecutive Swift Actions in the same round to activate this Talent. If the Stun damage on your next attack exceeds the target's Damage Threshold, you move the target -3 steps along the Condition Track, instead of the normal -2 steps.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll","when":"Ranged stun attack"}],"resources":["Two consecutive Swift Actions","Next ranged stun attack","If exceeds DT: -3 CT instead of -2"],"requiredContext":["Ranged weapon dealing stun damage"],"targetHint":"Stun target","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"set-for-stun","label":"Set for Stun","control":"flag","requiresAttackType":"ranged","requiresDamageType":"stun","targetEffectsOnHit":[{"type":"conditionTrackOverride","steps":-3,"requiresDamageExceedsThreshold":true,"label":"Set for Stun"}],"summary":"After spending two swift actions, next ranged stun attack moves target -3 CT if stun damage exceeds DT."}]},"summary":"You are particularly adept with stun weapons.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":49},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.set_for_stun","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.420Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Infiltration","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"87c0a929a04eb870","name":"Vaapad","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Juyo; Weapon Focus (lightsabers); Weapon Specialization (lightsabers); base attack bonus +12","benefit":"When attacking with a lightsaber, you score a critical hit on a natural roll of 19 or 20. A natural 19 is not an automatic hit; if a natural 19 still misses, you do not score a critical hit.","description":"When attacking with a lightsaber, you score a critical hit on a natural roll of 19 or 20. A natural 19 is not an automatic hit; if a natural 19 still misses, you do not score a critical hit.","class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"2bc2572e852832e4","tags":["lightsaber","melee","positioning","precision","force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"passive_contextual","applicationScope":"lightsaber_attack_context","staticSheetPolicy":"roll_context_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"engineOwner":"CombatOptionResolver","conditionSummary":"Vaapad: while attacking with a lightsaber, threaten critical hits on natural 19-20. A natural 19 is not an automatic hit.","rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"vaapad","label":"Vaapad","control":"passive","requiresAttackType":"melee","requiresWeaponGroups":["lightsaber"],"criticalThreatNaturalMin":19,"summary":"When attacking with a lightsaber, threaten a critical hit on natural 19-20. A natural 19 is not an automatic hit."},{"type":"EXTEND_CRITICAL_RANGE","id":"vaapad-lightsaber-critical-range","label":"Vaapad","weaponGroups":["lightsabers","lightsaber"],"by":1,"requiresNaturalRoll":true,"notes":"When attacking with a lightsaber, natural 19-20 threatens a critical hit; natural 19 is not an automatic hit."}],"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"vaapad","name":"Vaapad","label":"Vaapad","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"When attacking with a Lightsaber, you score a critical hit on a natural roll of 19 or 20. However, a natural 19 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll a natural 19 and still miss the target, you do not score a critical hit.","notes":"When attacking with a Lightsaber, you score a critical hit on a natural roll of 19 or 20. However, a natural 19 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll a natural 19 and still miss the target, you do not score a critical hit.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Lightsaber context"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}},{"id":"vaapad-critical-range","name":"Vaapad","label":"Vaapad","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"When attacking with a lightsaber, score a critical hit on a natural 19 or 20. Natural 19 is not an automatic hit.","notes":"When attacking with a lightsaber, score a critical hit on a natural 19 or 20. Natural 19 is not an automatic hit.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Lightsaber attacks","Critical 19-20"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"manualResolution":true,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."}},"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Forms","tree":"Lightsaber Forms","summary":"Lightsaber attacks threaten critical hits on natural 19-20, though 19 is not an automatic hit.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":219},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.vaapad","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.420Z","detectedPredicates":[],"lightsaberFormImplementation":{"status":"active-form-only","rule":"Only one Lightsaber Form can be active at a time; inactive forms grant no benefits.","updated":"2026-06-11"}}}}
{"_id":"893c4fd12df55469","name":"Slip By","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":null,"benefit":"When you damage a target, until the beginning of your next turn, you can move through that target's space. Moving through the target's space might still provoke attacks of opportunity as normal, and you must end your movement in a legal space.","description":"When you damage a target, until the beginning of your next turn, you can move through that target's space. Moving through the target's space might still provoke attacks of opportunity as normal, and you must end your movement in a legal space.","class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","treeId":"bf3b07c1687a3ca2","tags":["mobility","positioning"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"When you damage an opponent, you may move through that opponent’s square; attacks of opportunity apply as normal.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":24},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.slip_by","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.420Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"8989464c43d81045","name":"Cortosis Gauntlet Block","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Armor Proficiency (light, medium)","benefit":"You have received additional training in the use of cortosis gauntlets (see page 183). You can use the Block talent, even when not armed with a lightsaber, provided you are wearing a cortosis gauntlet. If you successfully block an attack with a lightsaber while wearing a cortosis gauntlet, the attacking lightsaber is deactivated.","description":{"value":"You have received additional training in the use of cortosis gauntlets (see page 183). You can use the Block talent, even when not armed with a lightsaber, provided you are wearing a cortosis gauntlet. If you successfully block an attack with a lightsaber while wearing a cortosis gauntlet, the attacking lightsaber is deactivated."},"class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"2359c05ff13f3feb","tags":["lightsaber","melee","force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Cortosis Gauntlet Block"}],"mechanicsMode":"contextual_block_override","applicationScope":"block_requirement_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true},"talent_tree":"Lightsaber Combat","talentTree":"Lightsaber Combat","tree":"Lightsaber Combat","summary":"You have received additional training in the use of cortosis gauntlets (see page 183).","source":"Legacy Era Campaign Guide","page":27},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.cortosis_gauntlet_block","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.420Z","detectedPredicates":[],"lightsaberTalentImplementation":{"status":"runtime_action_or_contextual","updated":"2026-06-11"}}}}
