{"_id":"907906934ba3c563","name":"Hunter's Target","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Hunter's Mark.","benefit":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level.","description":{"value":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level."},"class":"336bba6d1e517c92","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.74fb6b37af983a4c","name":"Hunter's Mark"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["action_economy","mobility","positioning","skills","social","pursuit","target-designation","fear"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"hunter-s-target","name":"Hunter's Target","label":"Hunter's Target","actionType":"free","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level.","notes":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Once per encounter","Designated target","Damage bonus equals class level"],"requiredContext":["Designated opponent is the attack target"],"targetHint":"One opponent","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{"designation":"huntersTarget"}}],"rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"hunters-target","label":"Hunter's Target","control":"flag","damageModifierFormula":"characterLevel","summary":"Toggle only against your designated Hunter's Target after the free-action designation succeeds."}]},"summary":"Once per encounter as a Free Action, you may designate an opponent. For the rest of the encounter, when you succeed on a melee or ranged attack against that opponent, you gain a bonus on damage equal to your Class Level.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":208},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.hunters_target","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.421Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","defense.will"],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"90820963f87dd268","name":"Krath Illusions","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Illusion","description":{"value":"As a swift action, you can reduce the penalty for large illusions by one half (rounded down, minimum -1)."},"benefit":"As a swift action, you can reduce the penalty for large illusions by one half (rounded down, minimum -1).","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"d29a7261c1be4b83","talent_tree":"Krath","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":60,"tags":["dark_side","force","illusion","swift_action","use_the_force"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"TALENT_ACTION","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"contextual","applicationScope":"large_illusion_penalty_reduction","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"modifiers":[],"notes":"Reduces only the penalty for a large Illusion, by one-half rounded down, to a minimum of -1. Grants no bonus to Use the Force checks or to Force Powers generally.","combatActions":[{"id":"krath-illusions","name":"Krath Illusions","actionType":"swift","requiredTalent":"Krath Illusions","description":"As a Swift Action, you can reduce the penalty for a large Illusion by one-half (rounded down), to a minimum penalty of -1.","resolutionMode":"manual","spendAction":true,"effects":[],"resources":["Illusion"],"notes":"Swift Action; halves the large-Illusion penalty (round down, minimum -1).","manualResolution":true,"relatedSkills":["useTheForce"],"label":"Krath Illusions","useLabel":"Use"}],"rules":[{"type":"RUNTIME_CONTEXT_REFERENCE","id":"krath-illusions-krath-context","label":"Krath Illusions","summary":"As a Swift Action, you can reduce the penalty for a large Illusion by one-half (rounded down), to a minimum penalty of -1."}]},"summary":"As a swift action, you can reduce the penalty for large illusions by one half (rounded down, minimum -1)."},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":