{"_id":"976c36831fecbd2b","name":"Blaster and Blade I","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Dual Weapon Mastery I feat, Weapon Proficiency (advanced melee weapons, pistols) feats","benefit":"When you make a single attack with an advanced melee weapon as a standard action, you can immediately make an attack with a pistol as a free action, provided you have both the advanced melee weapon and the pistol in your hands when the melee attack is made. You apply the normal penalties for fighting with two weapons to both of these attacks.","description":{"value":"When you make a single attack with an advanced melee weapon as a standard action, you can immediately make an attack with a pistol as a free action, provided you have both the advanced melee weapon and the pistol in your hands when the melee attack is made. You apply the normal penalties for fighting with two weapons to both of these attacks."},"class":"fcf8cc428a6eb01a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Master Privateer","treeId":"df6678946610c554","tags":["action_economy","burst_damage","condition_removal","damage_reduction","dual_wield","mechanics","melee","mobility","positioning","ranged","scaling","skills","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"combat_action_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver + character sheet combat actions tab; final resolution remains manual until the relevant target/minion/action-sequence executor exists.","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent depends on target identity, ally/minion state, line of sight, positioning, encounter timing, or GM adjudication. It should not mutate permanent actor sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"blaster-and-blade-i","name":"Blaster and Blade I","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Attack Roll","when":"Advanced melee + pistol"}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":["Equipped advanced melee weapon","Equipped pistol"],"notes":"When you make a single attack with an Advanced Melee Weapon as a Standard Action, immediately make a Pistol attack as a Free Action if wielding both weapons. Apply two-weapon penalties.","description":"When you make a single attack with an Advanced Melee Weapon as a Standard Action, immediately make a Pistol attack as a Free Action if wielding both weapons. Apply two-weapon penalties.","targetHint":"One or two targets"}]},"summary":"After a standard-action attack with an advanced melee weapon, make a pistol attack as a free action while wielding both weapons.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":52},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.blaster_and_blade_i","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.422Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit","attack.with-melee","attack.with-ranged"]}}}
