{"_id":"9bee4563b328def7","name":"Sith Alchemy Specialist","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Sith Alchemy","benefit":"You can modify an object with Sith alchemy so that it gains a specific trait. Specific traits are listed on Table 1-1. You can only perform one modification at a time. Unless otherwise noted, you cannot grant more than one benefit to a single object, and you cannot apply the same benefit more than once. You must spend a Force Point and devote 1 hour of uninterrupted work to apply a trait to the relevant object, and when you do so, you increase your Dark Side Score by 1.","description":{"value":"You can modify an object with Sith alchemy so that it gains a specific trait. Specific traits are listed on Table 1-1. You can only perform one modification at a time. Unless otherwise noted, you cannot grant more than one benefit to a single object, and you cannot apply the same benefit more than once. You must spend a Force Point and devote 1 hour of uninterrupted work to apply a trait to the relevant object, and when you do so, you increase your Dark Side Score by 1."},"class":"1ba03b2d00245906","costNumeric":null,"category":"Sith Apprentice","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.eb4f3e8660bc476589d0323d4cc00845","name":"Sith Alchemy"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"a67faf2ae089ab5d","tags":["crafting","dark_side","force","force_point_spend","resource_spend"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"ui_deferred_manual","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Sith Alchemy","status":"cleaned_manual_or_future_runtime","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."},"contributesGenericBonus":false,"notes":"UI/engine deferred: Sith Alchemy item/transformation workflows require dedicated UI and should not be faked as static bonuses.","combatActions":[{"name":"Sith Alchemy Specialist","actionType":"downtime","requiredTalent":"Sith Alchemy Specialist","description":"Modify a Sith Alchemy object to add one permitted trait. Full item trait UI is deferred.","resolutionMode":"sithTalent","spendAction":false,"effects":[],"resources":["Force Point","1 hour","Dark Side Score +1","Dedicated UI needed"],"notes":"UI/engine deferred. Use this card to record trait selection and object modification until the dedicated Sith Alchemy UI exists.","manualResolution":true,"relatedSkills":[],"sithTalentAction":"sithAlchemySpecialist","id":"sith-alchemy-specialist","label":"Sith Alchemy Specialist"}]},"summary":"Spend a Force Point and 1 hour to give a Sith-alchemy object one trait from Table 1-1, increasing your Dark Side Score by 1.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":22},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.sith_alchemy_specialist","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.423Z","detectedPredicates":[],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Sith Alchemy","status":"cleaned_manual_or_future_runtime"}}}}
{"_id":"9befb5e9bce19fa0","name":"The Will To Resist","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":null,"benefit":"Once per turn, as a reaction to being targeted by a Force power or other ability that targets your Will Defense, you can make a Use the Force check and replace your Will Defense with the result of the Use the Force check. After you make this check, until the end of your next turn, you take a -5 penalty on all Use the Force checks.","description":"Once per turn, as a reaction to being targeted by a Force power or other ability that targets your Will Defense, you can make a Use the Force check and replace your Will Defense with the result of the Use the Force check. After you make this check, until the end of your next turn, you take a -5 penalty on all Use the Force checks.","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"d3661aa9906bdc79","tags":["force","force_defense","recovery","resilience","resource_recovery","use_the_force","will_defense"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"the-will-to-resist","name":"The Will to Resist","label":"The Will to Resist","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per turn, if your Will Defense is targeted, you may replace Will with a Use the Force check; you take -5 to Use the Force until the end of your next turn.","notes":"Once per turn, if your Will Defense is targeted, you may replace Will with a Use the Force check; you take -5 to Use the Force until the end of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":["When Will Defense is targeted","Use the Force check replaces Will Defense","-5 Use the Force until next turn"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"Once per turn, react to a Will-targeting effect with Use the Force as your Will Defense, then take -5 Use the Force until your next turn ends.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":53},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.the_will_to_resist","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.423Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will"],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Control","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"9c0c0966b7c7c30e","name":"Unstoppable","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can sometimes shrug off the effect of debilitating attacks, Once per encounter, if you are hit by an attack that would normally knock you down the condition track, you can reduce the number of steps you move down the condition track by 1 step (to a minimum of 0).","description":{"value":"You can sometimes shrug off the effect of debilitating attacks, Once per encounter, if you are hit by an attack that would normally knock you down the condition track, you can reduce the number of steps you move down the condition track by 1 step (to a minimum of 0)."},"class":"533f1066362655c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Gladiator","treeId":"12a2a02b0901605d","tags":["condition_removal","damage_reduction","mobility"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action_reference","applicationScope":"martial_protector_arena_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Future CombatOptionResolver / action-card / reaction prompt / damage-resolution hook","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive modifier data; this talent is a real combat mechanic but needs runtime context and should not mutate permanent sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"unstoppable-t30-reference","name":"Unstoppable","label":"Unstoppable","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You can sometimes shrug off the effect of debilitating attacks. Once per encounter, if you are hit by an attack that would normally knock you down the Condition Track, you can reduce the number of steps you move down the Condition Track by 1 step (to a minimum of 0).","notes":"You can sometimes shrug off the effect of debilitating attacks. Once per encounter, if you are hit by an attack that would normally knock you down the Condition Track, you can reduce the number of steps you move down the Condition Track by 1 step (to a minimum of 0).","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Once per encounter","Ally context"],"requiredContext":["Triggering attack/damage result confirmed","Encounter use available","Arena/attack trigger context confirmed"],"targetHint":"GM/player adjudicated target or context","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"manualResolution":true,"phase30MartialProtectorArenaCleanup":{"phase":"T30","tree":"Gladiatorial Combat","status":"reviewed_manual_or_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"T30 removed unsafe passive rows from martial/protector/arena/species leftovers and surfaced action, reaction, recovery, cover, and attack-rider context as truthful cards/rules."}},"summary":"You can sometimes shrug off the effect of debilitating attacks, Once per encounter, if you are hit by an attack that would normally knock you down the condition track, you can reduce the number of steps you move down the condition track by 1 step (to a minimum of 0).","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":45},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.unstoppable","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.423Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"9c1e0b0566cb45c2","name":"Weakening Strike","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Dastardly Strike","benefit":"Whenever you deal damage to an opponent denied its Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense, you can choose not to move the target down the condition track and instead impose a -5 penalty on all your opponent's attacks and melee damage until the end of your next turn.","description":{"value":"Whenever you deal damage to an opponent denied its Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense, you can choose not to move the target down the condition track and instead impose a -5 penalty on all your opponent's attacks and melee damage until the end of your next turn."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.9e4345faaaa94dd8","name":"Dastardly Strike"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["condition_removal","melee"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"MODIFIER","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Whenever you deal damage to an opponent denied its Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense, you can choose not to move the target down the condition track and instead impose a -5 penalty on all your opponent's attacks and melee damage until the end of your next turn.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":15},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.weakening_strike"}}}
{"_id":"9c2a4cbe82e922ec","name":"Bodyguard III","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Attract Minion, Bodyguard I, Bodyguard II","benefit":"When you redirect an attack to a minion using the Bodyguard I talent, that minion can make an immediate melee or ranged attack against your attacker if the attacker is within range. Additionally, the bonus provided by the Bodyguard II talent increases to your full class level.","description":{"value":"When you redirect an attack to a minion using the Bodyguard I talent, that minion can make an immediate melee or ranged attack against your attacker if the attacker is within range. Additionally, the bonus provided by the Bodyguard II talent increases to your full class level."},"class":"324631ca844a88be","costNumeric":null,"category":"Crime Lord","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.7679eae1004af0cc","name":"Bodyguard II"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"560cc7994b357a0d","tags":["followers","minion","ally_support","support","teamwork","counterattack","melee","ranged","defense","survivability","scaling"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"progression_or_dependent_actor","applicationScope":"follower_minion_subsystem","staticSheetPolicy":"not_a_modifier","requiresRuntimeContext":false,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"FOLLOWER_TALENT_CONFIG + follower-hooks + MinionCreator/MinionManager + minion action rule cards","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. Crime Lord/Master Privateer minion subsystem owns dependent actor slots, minion talent flags, and manual tactical rule cards. No passive actor modifier is valid here."},"summary":"When you redirect an attack to a minion using the Bodyguard I talent, that minion can make an immediate melee or ranged attack against your attacker if the attacker is within range.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":27},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.bodyguard_iii","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.423Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex"],"nobleOfficerCorporateCleanup":{"phase":"T10","status":"implemented_or_deferred_minion_enhancement","owner":"MinionManager / FollowerManager minion benefit registry","note":"This talent modifies attracted minions or grants minion tactical permissions. MinionManager owns the registry; no actor static modifier is valid here."}}}}
{"_id":"9c88f3f82e6e2082","name":"Bonded Mount","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Charm Beast","benefit":"Whenever you encounter a domesticated beast with a friendly or helpful attitude toward you, you can spend a Force Point as a full-round action to bond the beast to you as a mount. A bonded mount shares an empathic link with you, allowing you to sense its emotions as a free action. When you ride a bonded mount, your mount uses your Reflex Defense and Will Defense instead of its own, Additionally, if your mount has any special senses (such as scent, darkvision, or low-light vision) that you do not possess, you gain the benefits of its special senses as long as you are riding that mount.","description":{"value":"Whenever you encounter a domesticated beast with a friendly or helpful attitude toward you, you can spend a Force Point as a full-round action to bond the beast to you as a mount. A bonded mount shares an empathic link with you, allowing you to sense its emotions as a free action. When you ride a bonded mount, your mount uses your Reflex Defense and Will Defense instead of its own, Additionally, if your mount has any special senses (such as scent, darkvision, or low-light vision) that you do not possess, you gain the benefits of its special senses as long as you are riding that mount."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.bab9a1ce285f98b9","name":"Charm Beast"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"ed899f9f41fc1391","tags":["action_economy","beast","beast_companion","dark_side","exploration","force","force_capacity","force_defense","force_point_spend","force_training","nature","resource_spend","support","survival","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"survival_exploration_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Full-round Force Point bond card. Removed mount shared-defense AE because it should apply while riding the bonded mount, not to the owner at all times.","phase25SurvivalExplorationCleanup":{"phase":"T25","tree":"Beastwarden","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Full-round Force Point bond card. Removed mount shared-defense AE because it should apply while riding the bonded mount, not to the owner at all times."},"combatActions":[{"id":"bonded-mount-bond","name":"Bonded Mount: Form Bond","label":"Bonded Mount: Form Bond","actionType":"full-round","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Whenever you encounter a domesticated Beast with a Friendly or Helpful Attitude toward you, you can spend a Force Point as a Full-Round Action to bond the Beast to you as a mount. A Bonded Mount shares an emphatic link with you, allowing you to sense its emotions as a Free Action.","notes":"Whenever you encounter a domesticated Beast with a Friendly or Helpful Attitude toward you, you can spend a Force Point as a Full-Round Action to bond the Beast to you as a mount. A Bonded Mount shares an emphatic link with you, allowing you to sense its emotions as a Free Action.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Spend 1 Force Point","Domesticated beast, Friendly or Helpful","Mount may use rider Reflex/Will while ridden"],"requiredContext":["Domesticated beast is Friendly or Helpful","GM confirms mount is eligible"],"targetHint":"Domesticated beast mount","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"companionRules":[{"type":"BONDED_MOUNT","id":"bonded-mount","forcePointCost":1,"sharedDefensesWhileRiding":["reflex","will"],"grantsMountSensesWhileRiding":true}],"source":"talent-backcheck","combatActionId":"bonded-mount","sithTalentAction":"bondedMount","manualResolution":false},"talent_tree":"Beastwarden","tree":"Beastwarden","implementationStatus":"implemented","automationBoundary":"supported","summary":"Whenever you encounter a domesticated beast with a friendly or helpful attitude toward you, you can spend a Force Point as a full-round action to bond the beast to you as a mount.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":18},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.bonded_mount","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.423Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","defense.will"]}}}
{"_id":"9cda854b5448414f","name":"Greater Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Greater Weapon Focus (lightsabers); Weapon Focus (lightsabers); Weapon Specialization (lightsabers)","benefit":"You gain a +2 bonus on melee damage rolls with lightsabers. This bonus stacks with Weapon Specialization (lightsabers).","description":"You gain a +2 bonus on melee damage rolls with lightsabers. This bonus stacks with Weapon Specialization (lightsabers).","class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"b3c5d90b5036f39b","tags":["lightsaber","melee","damage_bonus"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"passive_lightsaber_melee_damage_bonus","applicationScope":"lightsaber_melee_damage_roll","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":false,"rules":[{"type":"WEAPON_DAMAGE_BONUS","weaponGroups":["lightsabers"],"requiresAttackType":"melee","value":2,"label":"Greater Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)"}]},"summary":"Gain another +2 lightsaber melee damage, stacking with Weapon Specialization.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":218},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.greater_weapon_specialization_lightsabers","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.423Z","detectedPredicates":[],"jediTreeCleanup":{"phase":"T7","status":"damage_context_implemented","reason":"Greater Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers): additional +2 damage on melee damage rolls with lightsabers; stacks with Weapon Specialization (Lightsabers)."}}}}
