{"_id":"a6e38142447c64a9","name":"Ranged Flank","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a pistol or a rifle, you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for the purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are flanking that target. You may only be considered to be flanking a single target at range at a time. You must spend a swift action on your turn to designate the target you flank at range.","description":{"value":"If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a pistol or a rifle, you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for the purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are flanking that target. You may only be considered to be flanking a single target at range at a time. You must spend a swift action on your turn to designate the target you flank at range."},"class":"162d866ba36fce69","costNumeric":null,"category":"Gunslinger","treeId":"cb6f775cd227a3e3","tags":["positioning","ranged"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"gm_player_managed","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until exact target/ally/battlefield context exists","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive automation. Conditional target, ally, positioning, or scene-state effects should be applied at the table or through a future runtime prompt."},"summary":"If you are within 6 squares of a target and are armed with a pistol or a rifle, you can act as though you occupied the nearest square adjacent to the target for the purposes of determining whether or not you or any allies are flanking that target.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":27},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.ranged_flank","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.424Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"a6fa8cb695f2882c","name":"Signature Item","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You are famous for using certain items, and you have become skilled at wielding them. You select a single weapon, suit of armor, vehicle, starship, or other item. While wielding that weapon, wearing that armor, piloting that vehicle, or otherwise using that item, you gain a +2 morale bonus on opposed skill checks. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you choose a new object to be your signature item. The effects of multiple signature items are cumulative with one another, increasing this morale bonus by 1 each time.","description":{"value":"You are famous for using certain items, and you have become skilled at wielding them. You select a single weapon, suit of armor, vehicle, starship, or other item. While wielding that weapon, wearing that armor, piloting that vehicle, or otherwise using that item, you gain a +2 morale bonus on opposed skill checks. You can select this talent multiple times. Each time you do so, you choose a new object to be your signature item. The effects of multiple signature items are cumulative with one another, increasing this morale bonus by 1 each time."},"class":"336bba6d1e517c92","costNumeric":null,"category":"Bounty Hunter","treeId":"a47ed82a822e3962","tags":["scaling","pursuit","target-designation","fear","social"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"signature-item","name":"Signature Item","label":"Signature Item","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You are famous for using certain items, and you have become skilled at wielding them. You select a single weapon, suit of armor, Vehicle, or other item. While wielding that weapon, wearing that armor, piloting that Vehicle, or otherwise using that item, you gain a +2 morale bonus on opposed Skill Checks.","notes":"You are famous for using certain items, and you have become skilled at wielding them. You select a single weapon, suit of armor, Vehicle, or other item. While wielding that weapon, wearing that armor, piloting that Vehicle, or otherwise using that item, you gain a +2 morale bonus on opposed Skill Checks.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Persistent chosen item","+2 morale opposed skill checks while using chosen item"],"requiredContext":["Chosen item is being used"],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}]},"summary":"You are famous for using certain items, and you have become skilled at wielding them.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":42},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.signature_item","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.424Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bounty Hunter","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
