{"_id":"a810b68876f7e44e","name":"Intimate Knowledge","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Surveillance","benefit":"Experienced spies and scouts remember many details from previous assignments, providing insights on later missions. Once per encounter as a standard action, you can take 20 on a check involving a Knowledge skill you are trained in, or take 10 on a check involving a Knowledge skill you are untrained in, even if circumstances would not normally allow you to take 10 or 20.","description":{"value":"Experienced spies and scouts remember many details from previous assignments, providing insights on later missions. Once per encounter as a standard action, you can take 20 on a check involving a Knowledge skill you are trained in, or take 10 on a check involving a Knowledge skill you are untrained in, even if circumstances would not normally allow you to take 10 or 20."},"class":"b5bed5d1b5f42958","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.f23b63464e0aeff7","name":"Surveillance"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"7c42882a1347ef18","tags":["support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Experienced spies and scouts remember many details from previous assignments, providing insights on later missions.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":28},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.intimate_knowledge","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.424Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"a8347dda0f619f2d","name":"Adversary Lore","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a standard action, you can peer into the Force and search for weaknesses in the defenses of your enemies. Make a Use the Force check against the Will Defense of a target creature within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight. If the skill check equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, that target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense against you and all allies who can hear and understand you until the end of your next turn.","description":"As a standard action, you can peer into the Force and search for weaknesses in the defenses of your enemies. Make a Use the Force check against the Will Defense of a target creature within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight. If the skill check equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, that target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense against you and all allies who can hear and understand you until the end of your next turn.","class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"e99cfa9db8493573","tags":["action_economy","force","force_offense","light_side","mobility","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"adversary-lore","name":"Adversary Lore","label":"Adversary Lore","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"As a Standard Action, you can peer into The Force and search for weaknesses in the defenses of your enemies. Make a Use the Force check against the Will Defense of a target creature within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight.","notes":"As a Standard Action, you can peer into The Force and search for weaknesses in the defenses of your enemies. Make a Use the Force check against the Will Defense of a target creature within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":["Use the Force check"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"mechanicsMode":"contextual","applicationScope":"force_lightsaber_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Jedi Consular","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."}},"summary":"As a standard action, you can peer into the Force and search for weaknesses in the defenses of your enemies.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":14},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.adversary_lore","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.424Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"],"runtimeImplemented":true,"implementationNote":"Implemented through ConsularTalentActions and the combat action tracker."}}}
{"_id":"a843f45ec0f99db6","name":"Hold the Line","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Guardian","talentTree":"Jedi Guardian","tree":"Jedi Guardian","treeId":"10c843cef8ce2798","prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"When you make a successful attack of opportunity against a target leaving your threatened area, you stop the target's movement, ending its action."},"benefit":"When you make a successful attack of opportunity against a target leaving your threatened area, you stop the target's movement, ending its action.","class":"Jedi","category":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","tags":["force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"When you make a successful attack of opportunity against a target leaving your threatened area, you stop the target's movement, ending its action.","page":14},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"sourcePatch":"jedi-guardian-runtime-pass","id":"swse.talent.hold-the-line"}}}
{"_id":"a86559a808738c98","name":"Biotech Adept","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can reroll any Knowledge (life sciences) or Treat Injury check made to use or repair biotech devices and weapons, but you must keep the second result, even if it is worse.","description":{"value":"You can reroll any Knowledge (life sciences) or Treat Injury check made to use or repair biotech devices and weapons, but you must keep the second result, even if it is worse."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","treeId":"33c3210fcac8c664","tags":["mechanics","skills"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase18MedicalBiotechCleanup":{"status":"cleaned_future_runtime_context","owner":"future_skill_reroll_resolver","notes":"Rerolls Knowledge (Life Sciences) or Treat Injury checks only for Biotech use/repair contexts."}},"summary":"You can reroll any Knowledge (life sciences) or Treat Injury check made to use or repair biotech devices and weapons, but you must keep the second result, even if it is worse.","source":"Legacy Era Campaign Guide","page":29},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.biotech_adept","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.424Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"a8973662a2f1cf0f","name":"Spotter","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a Move Action, you can make a Perception check with a DC equal to 10 + the CL of a single target enemy in your line of sight. If you succeed on the check, you and all your allies that can hear and understand you gain a +1 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your next turn.","description":{"value":"As a Move Action, you can make a Perception check with a DC equal to 10 + the CL of a single target enemy in your line of sight. If you succeed on the check, you and all your allies that can hear and understand you gain a +1 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your next turn."},"class":"b5bed5d1b5f42958","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","treeId":"127a55c242e031f2","tags":["action_economy","ambush","melee","perception","positioning","ranged","skills","stealth","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"As a Move Action, you can make a Perception check with a DC equal to 10 + the CL of a single target enemy in your line of sight.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.spotter","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.424Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-melee","attack.with-ranged"]}}}
