{"_id":"b92e61669b29d090","name":"Surprise Strike","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Sometimes a smuggler has to fight his way out of a bad situation. If you fail any Deception check to convey deceptive information, you can initiate combat and make a single unarmed attack as a free action in the surprise round (or with a melee or ranged weapon, if you have the Quick Draw feat); all other combatants are considered surprised even if they are aware of you.","description":{"value":"Sometimes a smuggler has to fight his way out of a bad situation. If you fail any Deception check to convey deceptive information, you can initiate combat and make a single unarmed attack as a free action in the surprise round (or with a melee or ranged weapon, if you have the Quick Draw feat); all other combatants are considered surprised even if they are aware of you."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","treeId":"9f7ca12cc084737a","tags":["action_economy","ambush","mobility","skills","social","sustained_damage","unarmed"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Sometimes a smuggler has to fight his way out of a bad situation.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":27},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.surprise_strike","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.426Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
