{"_id":"bab0b5d081e304b6","name":"Experienced Brawler","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Melee Smash, Stunning Strike","benefit":"You can use each of the following actions as a standard action once per encounter. Avoid Attack: Make a single melee attack against an opponent within your reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain a +5 dodge bonus to Reflex Defense against a single attack as a reaction. Fortified Mind: Make a single melee attack against an opponent within your reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain a +5 bonus to Fortitude or Will Defense against a single attack as a reaction. Focused Stance: Make a single melee attack against an opponent within your reach. At any time before the beginning of your next turn, as a reaction, you can move up to 2 squares; this movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.","description":{"value":"You can use each of the following actions as a standard action once per encounter. Avoid Attack: Make a single melee attack against an opponent within your reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain a +5 dodge bonus to Reflex Defense against a single attack as a reaction. Fortified Mind: Make a single melee attack against an opponent within your reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, you gain a +5 bonus to Fortitude or Will Defense against a single attack as a reaction. Focused Stance: Make a single melee attack against an opponent within your reach. At any time before the beginning of your next turn, as a reaction, you can move up to 2 squares; this movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.9292819462b46074","name":"Stunning Strike"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"67fdd8dce9abd6c1","tags":["evasion","mobility","positioning","reaction","melee"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"experienced-brawler-avoid-attack","name":"Experienced Brawler: Avoid Attack","label":"Experienced Brawler: Avoid Attack","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, make a single melee attack against an opponent within reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, gain a +5 dodge bonus to Reflex Defense against a single attack as a Reaction.","notes":"Once per encounter, make a single melee attack against an opponent within reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, gain a +5 dodge bonus to Reflex Defense against a single attack as a Reaction.","resources":["Once per encounter"]},{"id":"experienced-brawler-fortified-mind","name":"Experienced Brawler: Fortified Mind","label":"Experienced Brawler: Fortified Mind","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, make a single melee attack against an opponent within reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, gain a +5 bonus to either Fortitude Defense or Will Defense against a single attack as a Reaction.","notes":"Once per encounter, make a single melee attack against an opponent within reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, gain a +5 bonus to either Fortitude Defense or Will Defense against a single attack as a Reaction.","resources":["Once per encounter"]},{"id":"experienced-brawler-focused-stance","name":"Experienced Brawler: Focused Stance","label":"Experienced Brawler: Focused Stance","actionType":"standard","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per encounter, make a single melee attack against an opponent within reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, as a Reaction, move up to 2 squares without provoking attacks of opportunity.","notes":"Once per encounter, make a single melee attack against an opponent within reach. Until the beginning of your next turn, as a Reaction, move up to 2 squares without provoking attacks of opportunity.","resources":["Once per encounter"]}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_reaction_context","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase21BrawlerShockboxerCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Each sub-action grants a delayed single-use reaction window; surfaced as explicit once-per-encounter action cards.","naturalWeaponPolicy":"Treat species natural weapons as unarmed-family attacks when the source text affects unarmed attacks."}},"summary":"Once each per encounter after a melee attack, gain +5 Reflex, gain +5 Fortitude/Will, or move 2 squares safely as a reaction.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":18},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.experienced_brawler","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.426Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will","turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"bab9a1ce285f98b9","name":"Charm Beast","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can make a Use the Force check in place of a Persuasion check when attempting to change the attitude of an undomesticated creature with an Intelligence of 2 or less. Additionally, you do not take the normal -5 penalty on the check if the creature can’t speak or understand your language. (This talent is identical to the Dathomiri Witch talent of the same name, and both are considered to be the same talent for the purposes of satisfying prerequisites).","description":{"value":"You can make a Use the Force check in place of a Persuasion check when attempting to change the attitude of an undomesticated creature with an Intelligence of 2 or less. Additionally, you do not take the normal -5 penalty on the check if the creature can’t speak or understand your language. (This talent is identical to the Dathomiri Witch talent of the same name, and both are considered to be the same talent for the purposes of satisfying prerequisites)."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","treeId":"ed899f9f41fc1391","tags":["action_economy","battlefield_control","beast_companion","force","force_capacity","force_defense","force_offense","force_training","melee","mobility","persuasion","positioning","social","support","sustained_damage","use_the_force","weapon_empowerment"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_force_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":false,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"charm-beast","name":"Charm Beast","label":"Charm Beast","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You can make a Use the Force check in place of a Persuasion check when attempting to change the Attitu