{"_id":"bf23bf3704382723","name":"Single Weapon Flourish II","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Double Attack (advanced melee weapons, exotic melee weapon, or lightsabers), Master of Elegance, Single Weapon Flourish I, Weapon Finesse","benefit":"When you wield only a single light melee weapon or a single lightsaber, you can make a full attack as a standard action instead of a full-round action.","description":{"value":"When you wield only a single light melee weapon or a single lightsaber, you can make a full attack as a standard action instead of a full-round action."},"class":"d87c05d2a34f5627","costNumeric":null,"category":"Melee Duelist","treeId":"1381bb8c9a838279","tags":["action_economy","lightsaber","melee","force"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_reaction_context","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Future CombatOptionResolver / action-card / reaction prompt / damage-resolution hook","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive modifier data; this talent is a real combat mechanic but needs runtime context and should not mutate permanent sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"single-weapon-flourish-ii","name":"Single Weapon Flourish II","label":"Single Weapon Flourish II","actionType":"full-round","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"When you wield only a single light melee weapon, or a single Lightsaber, once per turn on your turn, you can make a Full Attack Action as a Standard Action, instead of a Full-Round Action.","notes":"When you wield only a single light melee weapon, or a single Lightsaber, once per turn on your turn, you can make a Full Attack Action as a Standard Action, instead of a Full-Round Action.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Once per turn","