{"_id":"bf6bcc2fc31411d2","name":"Improved Suppression Fire","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you successfully suppress an enemy using the aid another action (see page 151 of the Saga Edition core rulebook), that enemy takes a -5 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn. When targeting an area with an autofire weapon, each enemy in the attack area takes a -2 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn, regardless of whether your attack hits.","description":{"value":"When you successfully suppress an enemy using the aid another action (see page 151 of the Saga Edition core rulebook), that enemy takes a -5 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn. When targeting an area with an autofire weapon, each enemy in the attack area takes a -2 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn, regardless of whether your attack hits."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"2e9265a596cc43f7","tags":["battlefield_control","burst_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"When you successfully suppress an enemy using the aid another action (see page 151 of the Saga Edition core rulebook), that enemy takes a -5 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn.","source":"Legacy Era Campaign Guide","page":31},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.improved_suppression_fire","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.427Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"bff3997bbdecc98a","name":"Gun Club","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can use a ranged weapon as a melee weapon without taking a penalty on your attack roll. The weapon is otherwise treated as a Club in all respects. If you are using a Rifle with a mounted Bayonet or Vibrobayonet, you may wield that weapon as a Double Weapon. The Bayonet or Vibrobayonet end is treated normally, and the other end is treated as a Club.","description":{"value":"You can use a ranged weapon as a melee weapon without taking a penalty on your attack roll. The weapon is otherwise treated as a Club in all respects.\n\nIf you are using a Rifle with a mounted Bayonet or Vibrobayonet, you may wield that weapon as a Double Weapon. The Bayonet or Vibrobayonet end is treated normally, and the other end is treated as a Club."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"67fdd8dce9abd6c1","tags":["melee","positioning","ranged"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"runtime_context","applicationScope":"combat_option_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase24TacticalRangedMilitaryCleanup":{"phase":"T24","tree":"Republic Commando","status":"cleaned_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Unsafe passive/ActiveEffect data removed. Talent is represented by action cards, attack options, hit/critical riders, or explicit manual metadata as appropriate."},"combatActions":[{"id":"gun-club","name":"Gun Club","label":"Gun Club","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"You may use a ranged weapon as a melee weapon without the normal penalty; it is otherwise treated as a club. Mark the attack context as rangedWeaponAsMelee for related options such as Weapon Shift.","notes":"You may use a ranged weapon as a melee weapon without the normal penalty; it is otherwise treated as a club. Mark the attack context as rangedWeaponAsMelee for related options such as Weapon Shift.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Ranged weapon used as melee weapon"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"manualResolution":false,"rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"gun-club-ranged-as-melee","label":"Gun Club","summary":"Flag that this melee attack is using a ranged weapon as a club without the normal penalty.","control":"flag","requiresAttackType":"melee","requiresContextFlags":["rangedWeaponAsMelee"],"suppresses":["rangedWeaponAsMeleePenalty"]}]},"summary":"You can use a ranged weapon as a melee weapon without taking a penalty on your attack roll. The weapon is otherwise treated as a Club in all respects.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":52},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.gun_club","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.427Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.with-melee","attack.with-ranged"]}}}
{"_id":"bffc3826d39f3946","name":"Guard's Endurance","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Ward","benefit":"Whenever you begin your turn adjacent to the target of your Ward talent (see below), you gain bonus hit points equal to your character level until the start of your next turn. Damage is subtracted from the bonus hit points first, and any bonus hit points remaining at the end of the encounter go away. Bonus hit points from different sources do not stack.","description":{"value":"Whenever you begin your turn adjacent to the target of your Ward talent (see below), you gain bonus hit points equal to your character level until the start of your next turn. Damage is subtracted from the bonus hit points first, and any bonus hit points remaining at the end of the encounter go away. Bonus hit points from different sources do not stack."},"class":"c4dbedcf989cb6b2","costNumeric":null,"category":"Elite Trooper","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.d9241073d3b975e6","name":"Ward"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"c92c2cbc79b8a515","tags":["positioning"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action_reference","applicationScope":"martial_protector_arena_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed until exact target/ally/battlefield context exists","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive automation. Conditional target, ally, positioning, or scene-state effects should be applied at the table or through a future runtime prompt.","combatActions":[{"id":"guards-endurance-t30-reference","name":"Guard's Endurance","label":"Guard's Endurance","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"W