{"_id":"c11e9edfda40c53d","name":"Bothan Resources","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Spynet Agent","benefit":"Your status within the Spynet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for restricted or rare items. With a successful DC 20 Gather Information check, you can purchase standard weapons, equipment, and transport services at 50% of the going rate, or exotic and restricted weapons, equipment, and transport services at 75% of the going rate.","description":{"value":"Your status within the Spynet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for restricted or rare items. With a successful DC 20 Gather Information check, you can purchase standard weapons, equipment, and transport services at 50% of the going rate, or exotic and restricted weapons, equipment, and transport services at 75% of the going rate."},"costNumeric":null,"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.648d9634a3795988","name":"Spynet Agent"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"d20682671d035cef","tags":["investigation","knowledge","resources","social","social_network","target-designation"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bothan Spynet","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"bothan-resources","name":"Bothan Resources","label":"Bothan Resources","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"Your status within the SpyNet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for Restricted or Rare items. With a successful DC 20 Gather Information check, you can purchase standard weapons, Equipment, and transport services at 50% of the going rate, or Rare and Restricted weapons, Equipment, and transport services at 75% of the going rate.","notes":"Your status within the SpyNet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for Restricted or Rare items. With a successful DC 20 Gather Information check, you can purchase standard weapons, Equipment, and transport services at 50% of the going rate, or Rare and Restricted weapons, Equipment, and transport services at 75% of the going rate.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"gatherInformation","when":"DC 20 procurement check"}],"resources":["Discounted standard/Rare/Restricted goods and services"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}]},"summary":"Your status within the Spynet gives you access to additional resources, and you know the best sources for restricted or rare items.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":50},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.bothan_resources","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.427Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bothan Spynet","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"c1be1f29c00436d5","name":"Transfer Essence","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Dark Side Score equal to your Wisdom score","benefit":"When you die, you become a dark side spirit (see page 118) until the end of the encounter. You continue to occupy a space in this form, but other creatures can occupy the same space or move through your space without impediment. As a standard action, you can attempt to possess an adjacent target. You must succeed on a Use the Force check against an adjacent target's Will Defense. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, you deal 8d6 points of stun damage to the target; if you reduce the target to 0 hit points or move it to the bottom of the condition track with this attack, you possess the target as though it were a willing host (see the dark spirit template for details). Alternately, as a standard action, you can transfer your essence into a single adjacent object, such as a holocron or a lightsaber. If you do so, you lie dormant within the object until another creature attempts to use that object, at which time you can emerge and attempt to possess the creature, as described above. If you do not possess a creature or object within 10 rounds of manifesting as a dark spirit, your spirit dissipates and ceases to exist.","description":"When you die, you become a dark side spirit (see page 118) until the end of the encounter. You continue to occupy a space in this form, but other creatures can occupy the same space or move through your space without impediment. As a standard action, you can attempt to possess an adjacent target. You must succeed on a Use the Force check against an adjacent target's Will Defense. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, you deal 8d6 points of stun damage to the target; if you reduce the target to 0 hit points or move it to the bottom of the condition track with this attack, you possess the target as though it were a willing host (see the dark spirit template for details). Alternately, as a standard action, you can transfer your essence into a single adjacent object, such as a holocron or a lightsaber. If you do so, you lie dormant within the object until another creature attempts to use that object, at which time you can emerge and attempt to possess the creature, as described above. If you do not possess a creature or object within 10 rounds of manifesting as a dark spirit, your spirit dissipates and ceases to exist.","costNumeric":null,"prerequisitesMeta":["Requires Dark Side Score ≥ Wisdom"],"treeId":"de95d37c72b1c4cd","tags":["dark_side","force","force_multiplier"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_runtime","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Dark Side","status":"cleaned_manual_or_future_runtime","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"When you die, you become a dark side spirit (see page 118) until the end of the encounter.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":16},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.transfer_essence","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.427Z","detectedPredicates":[],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Dark Side","status":"cleaned_manual_or_future_runtime"}}}}
