{"_id":"c2447676a43a70a2","name":"Luck Favors the Bold","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Face the Foe","benefit":"If at least one enemy within your line of sight is aware of you and you do not have Cover against that enemy, at the start of your turn if you are conscious you gain a number of Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + one-half your Heroic Level. Damage is subtracted from Bonus Hit Points first, and any Bonus Hit Points remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. Bonus Hit Points do not stack.","description":{"value":"If at least one enemy within your line of sight is aware of you and you do not have Cover against that enemy, at the start of your turn if you are conscious you gain a number of Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + one-half your Heroic Level. Damage is subtracted from Bonus Hit Points first, and any Bonus Hit Points remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. Bonus Hit Points do not stack."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.cbdedc32ac362634","name":"Face the Foe"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"b7a1211d08826500","tags":["survivability","durability","scaling","cover","positioning"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"social_commander_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed target context","notes":"The benefit depends on a target/opponent/reaction/encounter condition; per user direction, punt +X/penalties against conditional targets to GM/player unless an exact runtime owner exists.","combatActions":[{"id":"luck-favors-the-bold","name":"Luck Favors the Bold","label":"Luck Favors the Bold","actionType":"free","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"At the start of your turn, if an aware enemy is in line of sight and you do not have cover against that enemy, gain bonus hit points equal to 5 + one-half heroic level.","notes":"At the start of your turn, if an aware enemy is in line of sight and you do not have cover against that enemy, gain bonus hit points equal to 5 + one-half heroic level.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Start of turn","Bonus HP do not stack"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"Self","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"manualResolution":true,"phase23SocialCommanderCleanup":{"phase":"T23","tree":"Gambling Leader","status":"combat_action_card","cardsAdded":1,"notes":"Social/commander activation surfaced through abilityMeta combat action cards. Skill-backed cards use the existing sheet skill preroller where safe; final buffs/debuffs remain GM/player/runtime-applied."}},"summary":"If at least one enemy within your line of sight is aware of you and you do not have Cover against that enemy, at the start of your turn if you are conscious you gain a number of Bonus Hit Points equal to 5 + one-half...","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","page":24},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.luck_favors_the_bold","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.427Z","detectedPredicates":[],"nobleOfficerCorporateCleanup":{"phase":"T10","status":"gm_player_managed","owner":"GM/player managed target context","note":"The benefit depends on a target/opponent/reaction/encounter condition; per user direction, punt +X/penalties against conditional targets to GM/player unless an exact runtime owner exists."}}}}
{"_id":"c2b0b6dcba513cca","name":"Spring the Trap","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"If you and all your allies roll higher Initiative checks to start combat than do all your opponents, you automatically gain a Surprise Round, even if the opponents are aware of you when combat begins.","description":{"value":"If you and all your allies roll higher Initiative checks to start combat than do all your opponents, you automatically gain a Surprise Round, even if the opponents are aware of you when combat begins."},"class":"f62ca2e639cab614","costNumeric":null,"category":"Soldier","treeId":"12027e0ad5e4d260","tags":["ambush","skills","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"MODIFIER","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"If you and all your allies roll higher Initiative checks to start combat than do all your opponents, you automatically gain a Surprise Round, even if the opponents are aware of you when combat begins.","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","page":28},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.spring_the_trap"}}}
{"_id":"c2d2d55ee60f886f","name":"Lure Closer","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Trick Step","benefit":"Once per turn, as a Move Action, you can make a Deception check against the Will Defense of one enemy within 12 squares and within your line of sight. If you check results equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target must move a number of squares equal to half its speed, and each square of movement must bring the target closer to you (though the target does avoid Hazards and obstacles).\n\nIf the target cannot avoid a Hazard (such as a pit), it stops moving in the nearest safe square. This movement is considered involuntary and does not provoke Attacks of Opportunity. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.","description":{"value":"Once per turn, as a Move Action, you can make a Deception check against the Will Defense of one enemy within 12 squares and within your line of sight. If you check results equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target must move a number of squares equal to half its speed, and each square of movement must bring the target closer to you (though the target does avoid Hazards and obstacles).\n\nIf the target cannot avoid a Hazard (such as a pit), it stops moving in the nearest safe square. This movement is considered involuntary and does not provoke Attacks of Opportunity. This is a Mind-Affecting effect."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.4c689ac688e80c9e","name":"Trick Step"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"4af97ad058b1b30f","tags":["evasion","mobility","positioning","skills","social"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Once per turn, as a Move Action, you can make a Deception check against the Will Defense of one enemy within 12 squares and within your line of sight.","source":"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide","page":25},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.lure_closer","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.427Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will"]}}}
