{"_id":"c3a67c14c713a7a3","name":"Skilled Demolitionist","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can set a detonator as a swift action, and your explosives never go off as the detonator is being placed, even if you fail the check by 10 or more. You must still roll to determine if the charge otherwise goes off as planned (see “Mechanics,” page 69 of the Saga Edition core rulebook).","description":{"value":"You can set a detonator as a swift action, and your explosives never go off as the detonator is being placed, even if you fail the check by 10 or more. You must still roll to determine if the charge otherwise goes off as planned (see “Mechanics,” page 69 of the Saga Edition core rulebook)."},"class":"de3f367749b82fcf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Saboteur","treeId":"8897a36d59662ee9","tags":["action_economy","burst_damage","mobility","positioning","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"set-detonator","name":"Set Detonator","label":"Set Detonator","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Set a detonator as a Swift Action. Your explosives do not go off while the detonator is being placed, even if the check fails by 10 or more.","notes":"Set a detonator as a Swift Action. Your explosives do not go off while the detonator is being placed, even if the check fails by 10 or more.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Mechanics","when":"Setting a detonator"}],"resources":[],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"Explosive or mine detonator"}],"phase17TechEngineeringCleanup":{"status":"combat_action_card","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Surfaced as a manual action-economy card. Automation can be added later without inventing passive bonuses."}},"summary":"You can set a detonator as a swift action, and your explosives never go off as the detonator is being placed, ev