{"_id":"c59de6f440c92832","name":"Cause Mutation","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Sith Alchemy","benefit":"You can use your mastery of Sith alchemy to create mutated abominations. You must have access to a willing (or unconscious) creature to which you will apply the Sith Abomination template (see the side-bar) or the Chrysalis Beast template (see page 133). You also need a medical lab outfitted for the process, which requires a number of days equal to the creature's modified CL. You must spend a Force Point at the completion of the process to complete the transformation. A creature you have mutated is considered to be a domesticated creature, but for you only (unless it was already a domesticated creature before its mutation).","description":{"value":"You can use your mastery of Sith alchemy to create mutated abominations. You must have access to a willing (or unconscious) creature to which you will apply the Sith Abomination template (see the side-bar) or the Chrysalis Beast template (see page 133). You also need a medical lab outfitted for the process, which requires a number of days equal to the creature's modified CL. You must spend a Force Point at the completion of the process to complete the transformation. A creature you have mutated is considered to be a domesticated creature, but for you only (unless it was already a domesticated creature before its mutation)."},"class":"1ba03b2d00245906","costNumeric":null,"category":"Sith Apprentice","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.eb4f3e8660bc476589d0323d4cc00845","name":"Sith Alchemy"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"a67faf2ae089ab5d","tags":["beast_companion","crafting","dark_side","force","force_control","force_point_spend","healing","resource_spend","support"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"ui_deferred_manual","application