{"_id":"cc6f40522eca4cdd90dc5a04edad0a07","name":"Modification Specialist","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"benefit":"You have become skilled at reprogramming and modifying your own systems. You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on Mechanics and Use Computer checks to reprogram yourself or perform self-modifications (see page 197 of the Saga Edition core rulebook).","description":{"value":"You have become skilled at reprogramming and modifying your own systems. You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on Mechanics and Use Computer checks to reprogram yourself or perform self-modifications (see page 197 of the Saga Edition core rulebook)."},"prerequisites":"","class":"3b1ed5f1038d49fb","category":"Independent Droid","treeId":"9fe73a3703fa45fca628fd43cae6bf7f","tags":["crafting","droid","durability","mechanics","modification","self_repair","skills","slicing","tech"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase19DroidCleanup":{"status":"cleaned_future_runtime_context","owner":"future_self_reprogramming_modifier_resolver","tree":"Independent Droid","notes":"Unsafe migrated modifiers removed; talent requires a dedicated future runtime context before automation.","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0},"combatActions":[{"id":"modification-specialist-t31-reference","name":"Modification Specialist","label":"Modification Specialist","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You have become skilled at Reprogramming and modifying your own Droid Systems. You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on Mechanics and Use Computer checks to Reprogram yourself or perform self-modifications.","notes":"You have become skilled at Reprogramming and modifying your own Droid Systems. You do not incur the normal -5 penalty on Mechanics and Use Computer checks to Reprogram yourself or perform self-modifications.","relatedSkills":[{"