{"_id":"ccaa66ed749e3317","name":"Mind Probe","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you touch a living creature with an Intelligence of 3 or higher, you can use the Force to probe its mind for secrets. You must be adjacent to the target, and using the mind probe is a full-round action. If the target is unwilling, you must succeed on a Use the Force check, equal ing or exceeding the target's Will Defense. This ability otherwise functions exactly as the Gather Information skill's Learn News and Rumors, Learn Secret Information, and Locate Individual applications. Your Use the Force check must still exceed the base Gather Information skill DCs in order to retrieve the information you seek, but you need not pay anything in bribes, and you retrieve the information as a part of the full-round action. Failing the skill check by 5 or more does not cause someone to notice that you are seeking the information.","description":{"value":"When you touch a living creature with an Intelligence of 3 or higher, you can use the Force to probe its mind for secrets. You must be adjacent to the target, and using the mind probe is a full-round action. If the target is unwilling, you must succeed on a Use the Force check, equal ing or exceeding the target's Will Defense. This ability otherwise functions exactly as the Gather Information skill's Learn News and Rumors, Learn Secret Information, and Locate Individual applications. Your Use the Force check must still exceed the base Gather Information skill DCs in order to retrieve the information you seek, but you need not pay anything in bribes, and you retrieve the information as a part of the full-round action. Failing the skill check by 5 or more does not cause someone to notice that you are seeking the information."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","treeId":"d25dc04b0e16f107","tags":["action_economy","dual_wield","force","force_capacity","force_defense","force_training","positioning","sustained_damage","use_the_force","telepath","mind-affecting"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"ACTION","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"mind-probe","name":"Mind Probe","label":"Mind Probe","actionType":"full-round","cost":1,"manualResolution":false,"resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","useLabel":"Use","description":"When you touch a living creature with an Intelligence score of 3 or higher, you can use The Force to probe its mind for secrets. You must be adjacent to the target, and using the Mind Probe is a Full-Round Action. If the target is unwilling, you must succeed on a Use the Force check, equaling or exceeding the target's Will Defense. This ability otherwise functions exactly as the Gather Information skill's Learn News and Rumors, Learn Secret Information, and Locate Individual applications.\n\nYour Use the Force check must still exceed the base Gather Information skill DCs in order to retrieve the information you seek, but you need not pay anything in bribes, and you retrieve the information as a part of the Full-Round Action. Failing the Skill Check by 5 or more does not cause someone to notice that you are seeking the information.","notes":"Roll Use the Force against Will if unwilling and compare to the normal Gather Information DC for the information sought.","relatedSkills":["useTheForce"],"resources":["Use the Force","Will Defense","Gather Information DC"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{"forceAdeptTalentAction":"mindProbe"},"forceAdeptTalentAction":"mindProbe"}],"rules":[{"type":"RUNTIME_CONTEXT_REFERENCE","id":"mind-probe-context","label":"Mind Probe","summary":"When you touch a living creature with an Intelligence score of 3 or higher, you can use The Force to probe its mind for secrets. You must be adjacent to the target, and using the Mind Probe is a Full-Round Action. If the target is unwilling, you must succeed on a Use the Force check, equaling or exceeding the target's Will Defense. This ability otherwise functions exactly as the Gather Information skill's Learn News and Rumors, Learn Secret Information, and Locate Individual applications.\n\nYour Use the Force check must still exceed the base Gather Information skill DCs in order to retrieve the information you seek, but you need not pay anything in bribes, and you retrieve the information as a part of the Full-Round Action. Failing the Skill Check by 5 or more does not cause someone to notice that you are seeking the information."}],"mechanicsMode":"runtime_or_contextual","applicationScope":"force_adept_talent_runtime","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":false,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Telepath","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."},"backcheckNotes":{"phase":"force-mystic-telepath-backcheck","source":"user-pasted rules text","descriptionUpdated":true,"runtimeAction":"mindProbe"}},"summary":"When you touch a living creature with an Intelligence of 3 or higher, you can use the Force to probe its mind for secrets.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":18},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.mind_probe","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.428Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.will"]}}}
