{"_id":"cddfb9833c7d3344","name":"Channel Vitality","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can fuel your mastery of the Force with your own vitality. As a swift action, you can move -1 step down the condition track to gain a temporary Force Point. This temporary Force Point lasts until the end of your turn, at which point it is lost if it has not been used.","description":{"value":"You can fuel your mastery of the Force with your own vitality. As a swift action, you can move -1 step down the condition track to gain a temporary Force Point. This temporary Force Point lasts until the end of your turn, at which point it is lost if it has not been used."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","treeId":"a3d0b7c9a6d041f2","tags":["action_economy","condition_removal","force","force_capacity","force_control","force_point_spend","force_training","mobility","resource_spend","swift_action"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"ACTION","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"channel-vitality","name":"Channel Vitality","label":"Channel Vitality","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":false,"resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","useLabel":"Use","description":"You can fuel your mastery of The Force with your own vitality. As a Swift Action, you can move -1 step down the Condition Track to gain a temporary Force Point. This temporary Force Point lasts until the end of your turn, at which point it is lost if it has not been used.","notes":"Moves the actor one step down the Condition Track and grants one temporary Force Point that expires at end of turn.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Condition Track","Temporary Force Point"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{"forceAdeptTalentAction":"channelVitality"},"forceAdeptTalentAction":"channelVitality"}],"rules":[{"type":"ACTOR_UPDATE","id":"channel-vitality-temp-fp","label":"Channel Vitality","condi