{"_id":"cdf3e44536031f53","name":"Distracting Attack","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Brutal Attack with the weapon used","benefit":"When you deal damage to a target with a melee or ranged attack, compare the attack roll to the target's Will Defense. If the attack roll also meets or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense until the end of your next turn.","description":{"value":"When you deal damage to a target with a melee or ranged attack, compare the attack roll to the target's Will Defense. If the attack roll also meets or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to Reflex Defense until the end of your next turn."},"class":"533f1066362655c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Gladiator","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.d9f47bfdde76475f","name":"Brutal Attack"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"12a2a02b0901605d","tags":["melee","ranged","will_defense","control","battlefield_control","setup","targeting","precision"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action_reference","applicationScope":"martial_protector_arena_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Future CombatOptionResolver / action-card / reaction prompt / damage-resolution hook","notes":"Reviewed in T12. Removed legacy static/passive modifier data; this talent is a real combat mechanic but needs runtime context and should not mutate permanent sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"distracting-attack-t30-reference","name":"Distracting Attack","label":"Distracting Attack","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"When you deal damage to a target with a melee or ranged attack, compare the attack roll to the targets' Will Defense. If the attack roll also meets or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to their Reflex Defense until the end of your next turn.","notes":"When you deal damage to a target with a melee or ranged attack, compare the attack roll to the targets' Will Defense. If the attack roll also meets or exceeds the target's Will Defense, the target takes a -2 penalty to their Reflex Defense until the end of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Until your next turn"],"requiredContext":["Triggering attack/damage result confirmed","Arena/attack trigger context confirmed"],"targetHint":"GM/player adjudicated target or context","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[{"type":"HIT_RIDER","id":"distracting-attack-reflex-penalty","label":"Distracting Attack","summary":"When you damage a target, compare the attack roll to Will Defense; if it also meets/exceeds Will, target takes -2 Reflex until end of your next turn. GM/player confirms rider."}],"manualResolution":true,"phase30MartialProtectorArenaCleanup":{"phase":"T30","tree":"Gladiatorial Combat","status":"reviewed_manual_or_runtime_context","removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"T30 removed unsafe passive rows from martial/protector/arena/species leftovers and surfaced action, reaction, recovery, cover, and attack-rider context as truthful cards/rules."}},"summary":"When you deal damage to a target with a melee or ranged attack, compare the attack roll to the target's Will Defense.","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":44},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.distracting_attack","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.428Z","detectedPredicates":["defense.reflex","defense.will"]}}}
{"_id":"cdf46b8cdde49733","name":"Knowledge Is Power","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Spynet Agent","benefit":"As a swift action, you can designate a single target within your line of sight and make a Knowledge (galactic lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you score a critical hit against that target on a natural rol! of 19 or 20. If you have another ability that increases your weapon's critical range against that target (such as the elite trooper's extended critical range talent, or the Jedi Knight's Vaapad talent), you increase this range by 1 (for example, from 19-20 to 18-20). However, anything other than a natural 20 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll anything other than a natural 20 and still miss the target, you do not score a critical hit.","description":{"value":"As a swift action, you can designate a single target within your line of sight and make a Knowledge (galactic lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you score a critical hit against that target on a natural rol! of 19 or 20. If you have another ability that increases your weapon's critical range against that target (such as the elite trooper's extended critical range talent, or the Jedi Knight's Vaapad talent), you increase this range by 1 (for example, from 19-20 to 18-20). However, anything other than a natural 20 is not considered an automatic hit; if you roll anything other than a natural 20 and still miss the target, you do not score a critical hit."},"costNumeric":null,"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.648d9634a3795988","name":"Spynet Agent"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"d20682671d035cef","tags":["action_economy","critical_hit","investigation","knowledge","positioning","precision","resources","social","social_network","swift_action","target-designation"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"hunter_pursuit_fear_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver / GM-player context","notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals.","phase26HunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bothan Spynet","status":"combat_action_card","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"notes":"Reviewed in T26 hunter/pursuit/fear cleanup. Conditional target, fear, pursuit, stealth, reaction, or minion effects should not mutate permanent actor totals."},"combatActions":[{"id":"knowledge-is-power","name":"Knowledge is Power","label":"Knowledge is Power","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"As a Swift Action, you can designate a single target within line of sight and make a Knowledge (Galactic Lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you score a Critical Hit against that target on a natural roll of 19 or 20.","notes":"As a Swift Action, you can designate a single target within line of sight and make a Knowledge (Galactic Lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL. If the check is successful, for the remainder of the encounter you score a Critical Hit against that target on a natural roll of 19 or 20.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"knowledgeGalacticLore","when":"DC 15 + target CL"},{"skill":"gatherInformation","when":"Allowed through SpyNet Agent where applicable"}],"resources":["Designate target in line of sight","Encounter-long result on success"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"One target in line of sight","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[{"type":"ATTACK_OPTION","id":"knowledge-is-power","label":"Knowledge is Power","control":"flag","criticalThreatNaturalMin":19,"summary":"Toggle against the analyzed target after the check succeeds; natural 19-20 threatens critical."}]},"summary":"As a swift action, you can designate a single target within your line of sight and make a Knowledge (galactic lore) check against a DC equal to 15 + the target's CL.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":50},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.knowledge_is_power","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.428Z","detectedPredicates":[],"talentHunterPursuitFearCleanup":{"phase":"T26","tree":"Bothan Spynet","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
{"_id":"ce151ce88fd55934","name":"Prime Targets","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"talent_tree":"Jedi Sentinel","prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you hit a target with a Lightsaber attack, if the target has not been attacked since the end of your last turn, you deal +1 die of damage.","description":"When you hit a target with a Lightsaber attack, if the target has not been attacked since the end of your last turn, you deal +1 die of damage.","class":"Jedi","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"36f18f3e974feb33","slug":"prime-targets","summary":"Deal +1 die of Lightsaber damage to a target that has not been attacked since the end of your last turn.","source":"Galaxy at War","page":18,"tags":["lightsaber","melee","burst_damage","damage_bonus","targeting"]},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"ce1f5d3316b052f6","name":"True Betrayal","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Cast Suspicion, Friend or Foe","benefit":"As a standard action, make a Persuasion check against the Will Defense of one enemy within your line of sight that can hear and understand you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, that target immediately makes an attack (as a free action) against another target of your choice. This can be a melee attack against an adjacent target or a ranged attack against a target within the attacker's point-blank range.\n\nThe target gets a +5 bonus to its Will Defense if it is higher level than you. This is a mind-affecting effect.","description":{"value":"As a standard action, make a Persuasion check against the Will Defense of one enemy within your line of sight that can hear and understand you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's Will Defense, that target immediately makes an attack (as a free action) against another target of your choice. This can be a melee attack against an adjacent target or a ranged attack against a target within the attacker's point-blank range.\n\nThe target gets a +5 bonus to its Will Defense if it is higher level than you. This is a mind-affecting effect."},"class":"8c58016e587dd2c7","costNumeric":null,"category":"Noble","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.014d291a6e16cc12","name":"Friend or Foe"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"da34105c875650ae","tags":["skills","social","intrigue","reaction","control"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual","applicationScope":"gm_player_managed","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"GM/player managed target context","notes":"The benefit depends on a target/opponent/reaction/encounter condi