{"_id":"d1561acfdeac3d78","name":"Dark Deception","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You can cloak your intentions with a veil of anger and hate. When another character attempts to sense you through the Force in any way, you can choose to act as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score.\n\nAdditionally, Deception is now a class skill for you.","description":{"value":"You can cloak your intentions with a veil of anger and hate. When another character attempts to sense you through the Force in any way, you can choose to act as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score.\n\nAdditionally, Deception is now a class skill for you."},"class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"eab0d8bbee7e0f4f","tags":["dark_side","force","light_side","skills"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"conditional","applicationScope":"runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":true,"engineOwner":"Force context / GM-player","conditionSummary":"Dark Deception: when another character senses you through the Force, you may choose to appear as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score. Its class-skill effect is separate.","recommendedAction":"Keep class-skill effect; handle Force-sensing spoof at the table or in a future Force-sense prompt.","modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"dark-deception","name":"Dark Deception","label":"Dark Deception","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"You can cloak your intentions with a veil of anger and hate. When another character attempts to sense you through The Force in any way, you can choose to act as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score.","notes":"You can cloak your intentions with a veil of anger and hate. When another character attempts to sense you through The Force in any way, you can choose to act as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":[],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}},{"id":"dark-deception-force-sensing-reference","name":"Dark Deception","label":"Dark Deception","actionType":"passive","cost":0,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"reference","useLabel":"Reference","description":"When another character attempts to sense you through the Force, you may act as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score. This is not a Deception class-skill bonus.","notes":"When another character attempts to sense you through the Force, you may act as though your Dark Side Score equals your Wisdom score. This is not a Deception class-skill bonus.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Deception"}],"resources":["Force sensing context"],"requiredContext":["Someone attempts to sense you through the Force"],"targetHint":"","spendAction":false,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[{"type":"REFERENCE_RULE","id":"dark-deception-dark-side-score-veil","label":"Dark Deception","notes":"This is a Force-sensing identity/intent veil, not a Deception class-skill grant."}],"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Jedi Shadow","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":1,"removedLegacyModifierRows":0,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."}},"summary":"You can cloak your intentions with a veil of anger and hate.","source":"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide","page":39},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.dark_deception","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.429Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"d1683318140f3906","name":"Legendary Commander","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Charisma 13, Intelligence 13, Born Leader","benefit":"When you are the commander of a capital ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your heroic level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (round down), the pilot's heroic level, or the ship's armor bonus, whichever is more. In addition, all gunners on your ship add one-half your heroic level or one-half their heroic level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with vehicle weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of ace).","description":{"value":"When you are the commander of a capital ship, calculate its Reflex Defense using your heroic level plus one-half the ship's armor bonus (round down), the pilot's heroic level, or the ship's armor bonus, whichever is more. In addition, all gunners on your ship add one-half your heroic level or one-half their heroic level, whichever is more, to damage rolls with vehicle weapons. Finally, you treat any generic crew as being one quality level higher (maximum of ace)."},"class":"30b9cd24b80ebf46","costNumeric":null,"category":"Officer","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"attribute","ability":"cha","min":13},{"type":"attribute","ability":"int","min":13},{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.6a66ba6e0834dd6f","name":"Born Leader"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"057a978a7dc1d5a7","tags":["armor"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"manual_or_future_runtime","applicationScope":"social_commander_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Vehicle/crew systems or GM/player managed","notes":"Capital ship commander/crew quality runtime rule; belongs to vehicle sheet/crew runtime rather than actor passive modifiers.","phas