{"_id":"df91dea8db444459","name":"Burst Transfer","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"You can double the amount of data transferred with the Binary language in a single round (see page 191 of the Saga Edition core rulebook) when communicating with other droids with Burst Transfer, and you cut Access Information time in half when making Use Computer checks to find general or specific information (see page 76 of the Saga Edition core rulebook)."},"benefit":"You can double the amount of data transferred with the Binary language in a single round (see page 191 of the Saga Edition core rulebook) when communicating with other droids with Burst Transfer, and you cut Access Information time in half when making Use Computer checks to find general or specific information (see page 76 of the Saga Edition core rulebook).","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"ad499981ddb8450e","tags":["action_economy","damage_reduction","droid","healing","mechanics","mobility","pilot","reaction","shields","skills","slicing","standard_action","support","sustained_damage","vehicle"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase19DroidCleanup":{"status":"cleaned_future_runtime_context","owner":"future_binary_use_computer_time_resolver","tree":"2nddegree Droid","notes":"Unsafe migrated modifiers removed; talent requires a dedicated future runtime context before automation.","removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0}},"summary":"Double Binary data transfer with another droid that has Burst Transfer and halve Access Information time when using Use Computer.","source":"Scavenger's Guide to Droids","page":26},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.431Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"df9c25340dcb7c95","name":"Ion Mastery","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"You know the typical weaknesses of vehicles and droids, and you know how to preserve such targets for capture rather than destroying them. When attacking with ion weapons, you gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls and deal +1 die of ion damage.","description":{"value":"You know the typical weaknesses of vehicles and droids, and you know how to preserve such targets for capture rather than destroying them. When attacking with ion weapons, you gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls and deal +1 die of ion damage."},"class":"fcf8cc428a6eb01a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Master Privateer","treeId":"df6678946610c554","tags":["ranged","offense_ranged","precision","damage_bonus","nonlethal","droid","vehicle","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"conditional","applicationScope":"roll_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"Future attack/damage roll-context resolver","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent applies only in an ion-weapon attack/damage context and needs a roll-context hook; passive attack/damage ActiveEffects are removed."},"summary":"You know the typical weaknesses of vehicles and droids, and you know how to preserve such targets for capture rather than destroying them.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":52},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.ion_mastery","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.431Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"df9c364e91826cbf","name":"Uncanny Dodge I","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Acute Senses; Improved Initiative","benefit":"You retain your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense regardless of being caught flat-footed or struck by a hidden attacker. You still lose your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense if you are immobilized.","description":{"value":"You retain your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense regardless of being caught flat-footed or struck by a hidden attacker. You still lose your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense if you are immobilized."},"class":"b5bed5d1b5f42958","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.9840f0e8b8f53bb5","name":"Improved Initiative"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"1c48d1cd9ab1f5c8","tags":["evasion"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Keep your Dexterity bonus to Reflex Defense while flat-footed or attacked from hiding, unless immobilized.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":49},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.uncanny_dodge_i","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.431Z","detectedPredicates":[]}}}
{"_id":"dfb9e58c7bcb095c","name":"Jedi Quarry","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"As a swift action, you designate a single target creature as the focus of your attentions. You gain a +2 bonus to your speed any time you spend a move action to move, provided that you end your movement adjacent to the target. You retain this bonus (and may not use this talent again) until your target surrenders, is reduced to 0 hit points, or moves to the bottom of the condition track, or until the encounter ends.","description":{"value":"As a swift action, you designate a single target creature as the focus of your attentions. You gain a +2 bonus to your speed any time you spend a move action to move, provided that you end your movement adjacent to the target. You retain this bonus (and may not use this talent again) until your target surrenders, is reduced to 0 hit points, or moves to the bottom of the condition track, or until the encounter ends."},"class":"fb5c2644f988e6bf","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi Knight","treeId":"44554c28675292b6","tags":["force","force_control","light_side","mobility","positioning"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"action_or_contextual","applicationScope":"quarry_movement_bonus","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"notes":"Swift-action quarry designation and movement ending adjacent to the target. Requires chosen target and movement outcome; no permanent speed bonus.","modifiers":[],"status":"talent_backcheck_user_text_2026_06_11","description":"Swift Action designate quarry; gain +2 Speed when moving if you end adjacent to the target.","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"conditionSummary":"Swift Action designate quarry; gain +2 Speed when moving if you end adjacent to the target.","metadataPhase":"jedi-prestige-talent-backcheck","metadataNotes":"Updated from user-provided source text; non-automatable targeting/LOS/session adjudication remains GM/player confirmed.","rules":[{"type":"TALENT_RULE","id":"jedi_quarry","label":"Jedi Quarry","summary":"Swift Action designate quarry; gain +2 Speed when moving if you end adjacent to the target.","action":"swift-action","mode":"quarry_movement_bonus","text":"As a Swift Action, you can designate a single target creature as the focus of your attentions. You gain a +2 bonus to your Speed any time you spend a Move Action to Move, provided that you end your movement adjacent to the target.\n\nYou retain this bonus (and may not use this Talent again) until your target surrenders, is reduced to 0 Hit Points, moves to the bottom of the Condition Track, or until the encounter ends."}]},"effect":"As a Swift Action, you can designate a single target creature as the focus of your attentions. You gain a +2 bonus to your Speed any time you spend a Move Action to Move, provided that you end your movement adjacent to the target.\n\nYou retain this bonus (and may not use this Talent again) until your target surrenders, is reduced to 0 Hit Points, moves to the bottom of the Condition Track, or until the encounter ends.","shortSummary":"Swift Action designate quarry; gain +2 Speed when moving if you end adjacent to the target.","prerequisite":"","prerequisitesText":"","grantsActions":["swift-action"],"summary":"As a swift action, you designate a single target creature as the focus of your attentions.","source":"Jedi Academy Training Manual","page":20},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.jedi_quarry","jediTreeCleanup":{"phase":"T7","status":"manual_or_contextual","reason":"Swift-action quarry designation and movement ending adjacent to the target. Requires chosen target and movement outcome; no permanent speed bonus."},"talentBackcheck":{"source":"user-pasted-rules","date":"2026-06-11","updatedFields":["system.description","system.benefit","system.effect","system.shortSummary","system.prerequisite","system.abilityMeta"]}}}}
