{"_id":"e289618b92890003","name":"Treacherous","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Improved Soft Cover, Innocuous","benefit":"Whenever you are attacked in combat and adjacent to a creature other than your attacker, you can move 1 square as a reaction. The attack intended for you instead targets the adjacent creature, though if you move away from a creature that threatens you, it can make an attack of opportunity before the original attack is resolved.","description":{"value":"Whenever you are attacked in combat and adjacent to a creature other than your attacker, you can move 1 square as a reaction. The attack intended for you instead targets the adjacent creature, though if you move away from a creature that threatens you, it can make an attack of opportunity before the original attack is resolved."},"class":"8da58194b3d58041","costNumeric":null,"category":"Charlatan","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.1681031c6828d556","name":"Improved Soft Cover"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"ab9b75bc19f8e983","tags":["action_economy","control","cover","deception","defense","mobility","positioning","reaction","social","stealth"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"combat_action_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver + character sheet combat actions tab; final resolution remains manual until the relevant target/minion/action-sequence executor exists.","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent depends on target identity, ally/minion state, line of sight, positioning, encounter timing, or GM adjudication. It should not mutate permanent actor sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"treacherous","name":"Treacherous","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolu