{"_id":"f0ade00000000001","name":"Instrument of the Force","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"When you successfully use Search Your Feelings, you gain a Force Point that must be used before the end of the encounter. If you use this Force Point in a manner that would end in unfavorable results according to Search Your Feelings, increase your Dark Side Score by 1. If you use the Force Point in an action that would normally increase your Dark Side Score, increase it by 2 instead.","description":{"value":"When you successfully use Search Your Feelings, you gain a Force Point that must be used before the end of the encounter. If you use this Force Point in a manner that would end in unfavorable results according to Search Your Feelings, increase your Dark Side Score by 1. If you use the Force Point in an action that would normally increase your Dark Side Score, increase it by 2 instead."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","treeId":"e35ee41362604227","tags":["force","search_your_feelings"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"TALENT_ACTION","abilityMeta":{"actionType":"passive","resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","forceAdeptTalentAction":"instrumentOfTheForce","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"combatActions":[{"id":"instrument-of-the-force","name":"Instrument of the Force","actionType":"passive","requiredTalent":"Instrument of the Force","description":"You are particularly in tune with The Living Force. When you successfully use Search Your Feelings, you gain a Force Point that must be used before the end of the encounter.","resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","spendAction":false,"effects":[],"resources":["Search Your Feelings","Bonus Force Point","Dark Side Score"],"notes":"After Search Your Feelings succeeds, gain an encounter Force Point; this action can also record the Dark Side Score consequence from spending that point.","manualResolution":false,"relatedSkills":["useTheForce"],"forceAdeptTalentAction":"instrumentOfTheForce","label":"Instrument of the Force","useLabel":"Use"}],"implementationDeferred":false},"summary":"When you successfully use Search Your Feelings, you gain a Force Point that must be used before the end of the encounter.","source":"Unknown Regions","page":30},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"backchecked":true,"source":"force-adept-force-item-batch"}}}
{"_id":"f0ade00000000002","name":"Long Call","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Mystical Link","benefit":"When using the telepathy ability of Use the Force, reduce the DC of the Use the Force check by half, as do Force-users for whom you are a willing telepathic recipient. When attempting to contact an unwilling target, you can reroll and take the better result. By spending a Force Point, you can simultaneously contact a number of targets equal to your Charisma modifier, minimum two, with a single Use the Force check.","description":{"value":"When using the telepathy ability of Use the Force, reduce the DC of the Use the Force check by half, as do Force-users for whom you are a willing telepathic recipient. When attempting to contact an unwilling target, you can reroll and take the better result. By spending a Force Point, you can simultaneously contact a number of targets equal to your Charisma modifier, minimum two, with a single Use the Force check."},"class":"289fcf920ef0e184","costNumeric":null,"category":"Force Adept","treeId":"e35ee41362604227","tags":["force","telepathy","use_the_force"],"executionModel":"ACTIVE","subType":"TALENT_ACTION","abilityMeta":{"actionType":"standard","resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","forceAdeptTalentAction":"longCall","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"combatActions":[{"id":"long-call","name":"Long Call","actionType":"standard","requiredTalent":"Long Call","description":"When using the Telepathy ability of Use the Force, you reduce the DC of the Use the Force check by half, as do those Force-users for whom you are a willing telepathic recipient. When attempting to contact an unwilling target, you can reroll and take the better result.","resolutionMode":"forceAdeptTalent","spendAction":true,"effects":[],"resources":["Telepathy","Force Point"],"notes":"Halve Telepathy DC for willing recipients; reroll and keep better against unwilling targets; spend a Force Point to 