{"_id":"f0cf0ad742a5e014","name":"Vehicular Evasion","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"If the vehicle you are piloting is hit by an area attack, it takes half damage if the attack hits. If the area attack misses your vehicle, it takes no damage. You cannot use this talent when your vehicle is stationary or disabled.","description":{"value":"If the vehicle you are piloting is hit by an area attack, it takes half damage if the attack hits. If the area attack misses your vehicle, it takes no damage. You cannot use this talent when your vehicle is stationary or disabled."},"class":"9c9989c34714f920","costNumeric":null,"category":"Ace Pilot","treeId":"b17c1515c06361d6","tags":["battlefield_control","condition_removal","evasion","mechanics","pilot","positioning","scaling","skills","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"phase16VehicleStarshipCleanup":{"status":"metadata_or_gm_player_managed","owner":"GM/player or future vehicle subsystem","notes":"No truthful automatic runtime owner in this pass; stale migrated modifiers/effects removed if present."}},"summary":"Your moving, functioning vehicle takes half damage from a hit area attack and none on a miss.","source":"Saga Edition Core Rulebook","page":207},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.vehicular_evasion","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit","turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"f15b54aeaaa5c578","name":"Guardian Strike","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Whenever you use a Lightsaber to deal damage to a target, that target takes a -2 penalty on attack rolls against any target other than you until the beginning of your next turn.","description":{"value":"Whenever you use a Lightsaber to deal damage to a target, that target takes a -2 penalty on attack rolls against any target other than you until the beginning of your next turn."},"class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"10c843cef8ce2798","tags":["force","force_offense","light_side","lightsaber","melee"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[{"target":"attack","value":0,"type":"untyped","predicates":[],"enabled":false,"priority":500,"description":"[REQUIRES MANUAL MAPPING] Guardian Strike"}]},"talent_tree":"Jedi Guardian","talentTree":"Jedi Guardian","tree":"Jedi Guardian","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","summary":"Whenever you use a Lightsaber to deal damage to a target, that target takes a -2 penalty on attack rolls against any target other than you until the beginning of your next turn.","page":21},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.guardian_strike","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":[],"sourcePatch":"jedi-guardian-runtime-pass"}}}
{"_id":"f16128ef7a76aa03","name":"Stymie","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per round, as a swift action, you can designate a target within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight as the target of this talent. Until the beginning of your turn, you can cause that target to take a -5 penalty on all checks made with a single skill. You must have line of sight to your target to make use of this talent, and declare which skill is to be penalized at the time this talent is activated. This is a mind-affecting effect.","description":{"value":"Once per round, as a swift action, you can designate a target within 12 squares of you and in your line of sight as the target of this talent. Until the beginning of your turn, you can cause that target to take a -5 penalty on all checks made with a single skill. You must have line of sight to your target to make use of this talent, and declare which skill is to be penalized at the time this talent is activated. This is a mind-affecting effect."},"class":"21dfe84d159a1b7f","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scoundrel","treeId":"67b59e020c1660eb","tags":["positioning","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"Swift action once per round: impose -5 on one chosen skill for a visible target within 12 squares; mind-affecting.","source":"Clone Wars Campaign Guide","page":24},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.stymie","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"f18fba568e414141","name":"Retaliation Jab","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","description":{"value":"If an enemy misses you with a melee attack, as a reaction you can automatically deal damage equal to your Strength modifier, minimum 1 point of damage, to your attacker, if the attacker is within your reach."},"benefit":"If an enemy misses you with a melee attack, as a reaction you can automatically deal damage equal to your Strength modifier, minimum 1 point of damage, to your attacker, if the attacker is within your reach.","class":"","category":"","costNumeric":null,"treeId":"abc3466390fe4050","tags":["action_economy","counterattack","martial_arts","melee","mobility","offense_melee","positioning","reaction","support","unarmed","natural_weapon"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"reactionKeys":["retaliationJab"],"reactions":[{"key":"retaliationJab","trigger":"ON_ATTACK_MISSED","source":"Retaliation Jab"}],"combatActions":[{"id":"retaliation-jab","name":"Retaliation Jab","label":"Retaliation Jab","actionType":"reaction","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"If an enemy misses you with a melee attack and is within your reach, automatically deal damage equal to your Strength modifier (minimum 1) to that attacker.","notes":"If an enemy misses you with a melee attack and is within your reach, automatically deal damage equal to your Strength modifier (minimum 1) to that attacker.","reactionKey":"retaliationJab","reactionTrigger":"ON_ATTACK_MISSED","resources":["Trigger: enemy misses you with melee attack","Attacker within reach"]}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"combat_action_or_reaction_context","staticSheetPolicy":"manual_only","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"phase21BrawlerShockboxerCleanup":{"status":"reaction_registered","owner":"AbilityCombatActionResolver","notes":"Removed unsafe +2 attack modifier. Registered as an ON_ATTACK_MISSED reaction; current attack cards do not yet open post-miss reaction windows, so the lane card remains available as a truthful reaction marker.","naturalWeaponPolicy":"Treat species natural weapons as unarmed-family attacks when the source text affects unarmed attacks."}},"summary":"When a melee attack misses you, react to deal your Strength modifier in damage to the attacker if it is within reach.","source":"Galaxy at War","page":21},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":["attack.when-hit","attack.with-melee","proximity.ally-nearby"]}}}
{"_id":"f23b63464e0aeff7","name":"Surveillance","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Trained in the Perception skill","benefit":"As a full-round action, you can make a Perception check against a single target within line of sight. The DCs equal to 15 or the target's Stealth check result (if the target is actively trying to remain hidden), whichever is greater. If the check is successful, you grant yourself and all allies within line of sight a +2 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your next turn. Your allies must be able to hear and understand you to benefit from this bonus, and they do not lose the benefit of this talent if they move out of line of sight after it is used.","description":{"value":"As a full-round action, you can make a Perception check against a single target within line of sight. The DCs equal to 15 or the target's Stealth check result (if the target is actively trying to remain hidden), whichever is greater. If the check is successful, you grant yourself and all allies within line of sight a +2 insight bonus on attack rolls against that target until the end of your next turn. Your allies must be able to hear and understand you to benefit from this bonus, and they do not lose the benefit of this talent if they move out of line of sight after it is used."},"class":"b5bed5d1b5f42958","costNumeric":null,"category":"Scout","prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"skillTrained","skill":"43c5941072ec78af"}],"_source":"fix5F-canonical"},"treeId":"7c42882a1347ef18","tags":["action_economy","mechanics","mobility","perception","skills","stealth","support","sustained_damage"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[]},"summary":"As a full-round action, you can make a Perception check against a single target within line of sight.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":28},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.surveillance","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":["turn.once-per-round"]}}}
{"_id":"f259cf27c1b62c47","name":"Tactical Superiority","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Spend two swift actions to select two allies. Each ally can move 2 squares as a reaction. This movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity.","description":{"value":"Spend two swift actions to select two allies. Each ally can move 2 squares as a reaction. This movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity."},"class":"324631ca844a88be","costNumeric":null,"category":"Crime Lord","treeId":"560cc7994b357a0d","tags":["positioning"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"combat_action_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"requiresSelectedChoice":false,"modifiers":[],"implementedBy":"AbilityCombatActionResolver + character sheet combat actions tab; final resolution remains manual until the relevant target/minion/action-sequence executor exists.","notes":"Reviewed in phase T15. This talent depends on target identity, ally/minion state, line of sight, positioning, encounter timing, or GM adjudication. It should not mutate permanent actor sheet totals.","combatActions":[{"id":"tactical-superiority","name":"Tactical Superiority","actionType":"swift","cost":2,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","relatedSkills":[],"resources":[],"requiredContext":["Two allies"],"notes":"Spend two Swift Actions to select two allies. Each selected ally can move 2 squares as a Reaction without provoking attacks of opportunity.","description":"Spend two Swift Actions to select two allies. Each selected ally can move 2 squares as a Reaction without provoking attacks of opportunity.","targetHint":"Two allies"}]},"summary":"Spend two swift actions to select two allies.","source":"Scum and Villainy","page":27},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.tactical_s