{"_id":"f561d569196bdda5","name":"Entreat Aid","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"","benefit":"Once per turn as a swift action, you can spend a Force Point to let one adjacent ally use the aid another action (as a reaction) to assist you with a skill check. You must make the skill check before the end of your turn, or the benefit of the aid another action is lost. An ally that has already used the aid another action to assist you since the end of your last turn may not be targeted by this talent.","description":{"value":"Once per turn as a swift action, you can spend a Force Point to let one adjacent ally use the aid another action (as a reaction) to assist you with a skill check. You must make the skill check before the end of your turn, or the benefit of the aid another action is lost. An ally that has already used the aid another action to assist you since the end of your last turn may not be targeted by this talent."},"class":"fec1f8af44fcc35a","costNumeric":null,"category":"Jedi","treeId":"e99cfa9db8493573","tags":["action_economy","force","light_side","positioning","support","reaction"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"entreat-aid","name":"Entreat Aid","label":"Entreat Aid","actionType":"swift","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"Once per turn as a Swift Action, you can spend a Force Point to let one adjacent ally use the Aid Another Action (as a Reaction) to assist you with a Skill Check. You must make the Skill Check before the end of your turn, or the benefit of the Aid Another Action is lost.","notes":"Once per turn as a Swift Action, you can spend a Force Point to let one adjacent ally use the Aid Another Action (as a Reaction) to assist you with a Skill Check. You must make the Skill Check before the end of your turn, or the benefit of the Aid Another Action is lost.","relatedSkills":[],"resources":["Force Point context","Once per turn"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":"","spendAction":true,"ruleData":{}}],"rules":[],"mechanicsMode":"contextual","applicationScope":"force_lightsaber_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","requiresRuntimeContext":true,"manualResolution":false,"phase27JediLightsaberMysticCleanup":{"phase":"T27","tree":"Jedi Consular","status":"reviewed_contextual_or_manual_card","removedEmbeddedActiveEffects":0,"removedLegacyModifierRows":1,"notes":"Jedi/lightsaber/Mystic leftover pass removed embedded effects and surfaces activation/timing/target context through action cards or resolver rules."},"implementationNote":"Implemented through ConsularTalentActions.promptEntreatAid and the combat action tracker."},"implementationNote":"Implemented through ConsularTalentActions.promptEntreatAid and the combat action tracker.","summary":"Once per turn as a swift action, you can spend a Force Point to let one adjacent ally use the aid another action (as a reaction) to assist you with a skill check.","source":"Legacy Era Campaign Guide","page":26},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.entreat_aid","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":["proximity.ally-nearby"]}}}
{"_id":"f5ebaf5d77257e0c","name":"Wrath of the Dark Side","type":"talent","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"prerequisites":"Power of the Dark Side","benefit":"When you roll a natural 20 on a Use the Force check to activate a Force power that directly deals damage to a target, you can choose not to regain all of your spent Force powers as normal and instead the targets damaged by the power take half that damage again at the start of their next turn. Only powers that directly damage the target are subject to this talent, including corruption, Force blast, Force grip, Force lightning, Force slam, Force storm, Force thrust (only when spending a Force Point), and repulse (only when spending a Force Point).","description":"When you roll a natural 20 on a Use the Force check to activate a Force power that directly deals damage to a target, you can choose not to regain all of your spent Force powers as normal and instead the targets damaged by the power take half that damage again at the start of their next turn. Only powers that directly damage the target are subject to this talent, including corruption, Force blast, Force grip, Force lightning, Force slam, Force storm, Force thrust (only when spending a Force Point), and repulse (only when spending a Force Point).","costNumeric":null,"prerequisitesStructured":{"type":"all","conditions":[{"type":"talent","uuid":"Compendium.foundryvtt-swse.talents.Item.627bd3abd30b973f","name":"Power of the Dark Side"}],"_source":"canonical-csv"},"treeId":"de95d37c72b1c4cd","tags":["dark_side","force","force_capacity","force_multiplier","force_offense","force_power_synergy"],"executionModel":"PASSIVE","subType":"STATE","abilityMeta":{"modifiers":[],"combatActions":[{"id":"wrath-of-the-dark-side","name":"Wrath of the Dark Side","label":"Wrath of the Dark Side","actionType":"free","cost":1,"manualResolution":true,"resolutionMode":"manual","useLabel":"Use / Note","description":"When you roll a natural 20 with a damage-dealing Force power, do not regain powers for damage; target also takes half damage again at the start of your next turn.","notes":"When you roll a natural 20 with a damage-dealing Force power, do not regain powers for damage; target also takes half damage again at the start of your next turn.","relatedSkills":[{"skill":"Use the Force"}],"resources":["Trigger: natural 20 with damage-dealing Force Power"],"requiredContext":[],"targetHint":""}],"mechanicsMode":"combat_action","applicationScope":"force_user_runtime_context","staticSheetPolicy":"exclude","manualResolution":true,"requiresRuntimeContext":true,"phase22ForceCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Dark Side","status":"combat_action_card","notes":"Removed unsafe migrated static modifiers/effects. Talent requires Force-user activation, target, Force Point, suite, item, or encounter context and must not mutate actor totals passively."}},"summary":"On a natural 20 with a directly damaging Force power, forgo normal Force-power recovery to deal half that damage again at the start of the targets next turn.","source":"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide","page":88},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"swse":{"id":"swse.talent.wrath_of_the_dark_side","migratedToState":true,"migrationDate":"2026-03-08T18:22:17.433Z","detectedPredicates":[],"forceTalentCleanup":{"phase":"T22","tree":"Dark Side","status":"combat_action_card"}}}}
